_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/afe3a899-413d-5f7a-9679-9e219f8f82e3', 'word_count': 714, 'uri': 'nyt://article/afe3a899-413d-5f7a-9679-9e219f8f82e3'}, {'abstract': 'While guns top the list of weapons used in violent assaults, every so often, a crime is committed with a weapon that harks back to a different era.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/01/nyregion/ice-picks-are-still-used-as-weapons.html', 'snippet': 'While guns top the list of weapons used in violent assaults, every so often, a crime is committed with a weapon that harks back to a different era.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The young man staggered down a city street as blood flowed from a puncture wound. The weapon used in the steely attack — an ice pick — was sticking out of his lower back.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/01/nyregion/ICEPICK2/ICEPICK2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/01/nyregion/ICEPICK2/ICEPICK2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/01/nyregion/ICEPICK2/ICEPICK2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/01/nyregion/ICEPICK2/ICEPICK2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/01/nyregion/ICEPICK2/ICEPICK2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/