ty when the accident happened near the George Washington Bridge on Friday night.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A teenager was killed when he popped his head out of a rooftop hatch on a double-decker bus and struck an underpass near the George Washington Bridge on Friday night, an official at the Port Authority of New York and New Jersey said.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Teenager Dies After Sticking Head Through Bus Hatch and Striking Underpass', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Teenager Dies After Sticking Head Through Bus Hatch and Striking Underpass', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traffic Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Buses', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'George Washington Bridge', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hackensack University Medical Center', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Port Authority of New York and New Jersey', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'St Francis Prep High School', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-01T04:49:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d5691f75-c34e-5be3-8565-e4e57699cd06', 'word_count': 206, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d5691f75-c34e-5be3-8565-e4e57699cd06'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections appearing in print on September 1, 2012.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/01/pageoneplus/corrections-september-1-2012.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections appearing in print on September 1, 2012.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FRONT PAGE', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: September 1