 outside the same American military outpost where a similar attack one year ago wounded scores of American soldiers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/02/world/asia/us-base-in-afghanistan-target-of-fatal-bomb-attacks.html', 'snippet': 'Taliban suicide bombers killed at least a dozen Afghans and wounded 58 others outside the same American military outpost where a similar attack one year ago wounded scores of American soldiers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — Taliban suicide bombers staged what appeared to be a carefully coordinated attack southwest of Kabul on Saturday that killed at least a dozen Afghans and wounded 58 more just outside the same American military outpost where a similar attack one year ago wounded scores of American soldiers.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/world/02afghanistan-span/02afghanistan-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 347, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/02/world/02afghanistan-span/02afghanistan-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 347}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/world/02afghanistan-span/afghanistan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/world/02afghanistan-span/afghanistan-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/world/02afghanistan-span/02afghanistan-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', '