organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7b17e755-4fb7-5233-a0d6-511446ce1864', 'word_count': 679, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7b17e755-4fb7-5233-a0d6-511446ce1864'}, {'abstract': 'Steve Pearce, whom the Yankees picked up from Houston, started the decisive three-run rally in the seventh inning with a single in a victory over the Orioles.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/02/sports/baseball/yankees-get-a-lift-from-the-newcomer-steve-pearce.html', 'snippet': 'Steve Pearce, whom the Yankees picked up from Houston, started the decisive three-run rally in the seventh inning with a single in a victory over the Orioles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Steve Pearce was surprised when the Baltimore Orioles designated him for assignment July 21, but he believed the demotion was temporary. He was fully prepared to report to Class AAA Norfolk with the expectation that he would soon be recalled to join the Orioles in a pennant race.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/sports/YJPYANKEES1/YJPYANKEES1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 764, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/sports/YJPYANKEES1/YJPYANKEES1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1527, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Yankees Get a Lift from the Newcomer Pearce', 'kicker': 'Yankees 4, Orioles 3', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Yankees Push the Orioles To a Rare Close Defeat', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pearce, Steve (1983- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Baltimore Orioles'