fa4'}, {'abstract': 'There was broad agreement in Jackson Hole, Wyo., that the stimulus that the Fed is considering, and may announce in two weeks, will not revive the economy. Indeed, given the magnitude of the looming “fiscal cliff,” they may not even be enough to prevent a recession.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/01/after-fed-action-then-what/', 'snippet': 'There was broad agreement in Jackson Hole, Wyo., that the stimulus that the Fed is considering, and may announce in two weeks, will not revive the economy. Indeed, given the magnitude of the looming “fiscal cliff,” they may not even be enough to p...', 'lead_paragraph': 'JACKSON HOLE, Wyo. — The Fed is on the verge of expanding its stimulus policies. We learned that much during the meetings in Jackson Hole, Wyo. But what may be more interesting is the undercurrent of discussion about what happens when those measures prove insufficient.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After Fed Action, Then What?', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bernanke, Ben S', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blinder, Alan S', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kohn, Donald L', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lindsey, Lawrence B', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Posen, Adam S', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Reserve System', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Jackson Hole (Wyo)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-01T21:59:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Binyamin Appelbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'B