 the United States would broaden its presence in the region, but that “the Pacific is big enough for all of us.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/02/world/asia/clinton-tries-to-ease-tension-with-china-on-asia-trip.html', 'snippet': 'Secretary of State Hillary Rodham Clinton began a six-nation visit to Asia by saying that the United States would broaden its presence in the region, but that “the Pacific is big enough for all of us.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'RAROTONGA, Cook Islands — Secretary of State Hillary Rodham Clinton began a 10-day, 6-nation visit to Asia pledging to broaden American diplomatic, economic and security support in the Pacific, but also offering conciliatory remarks toward China at a time when tensions are rising over territorial disputes.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Clinton Begins Asia Trip, Trying to Ease Tension With China', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Clinton Begins Asia Trip, Trying to Ease Tension With China', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-02T01:34:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Lee Myers', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': 'Lee', 'lastname': 'Myers', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/508a50bd-f9b1-5e2a-a781-e0106a8647f6', 'word_count': 544, 'uri': 'nyt://article/508a50bd-f9b1-5e2a-a781-e0106a8647f6'}, {'abstract': 'Rather than let a vacant Walmart become an eyesore, the city of McAllen spent $24 million to convert it into a 123,000-square-foot public library.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/02/us/former-walmart-in-mcallen-is-now-an-airy-public-library.html', 'snippet': 'Rather than let a vacant Walmart become an eyesore, the city of McAllen spent $24 million to convert it into a 123,000-square-foot public library.', 'lead_paragraph': 'McALLEN, Tex. — The hulking husk of a vacant Walmart here in the Rio Grande Valley is enjoying an unlikely second act. When the big-box retailer moved to a larger location down the street, the building might have been destined to house yet another large chain or to fall into disrepair. But rather than let it become an eyesore, the city scooped it up and spent $24 million transforming the drab structure into a 123,000-square-foot public library that serves as a vibrant space for residents here. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27B', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/us/02TTCulture/02TTCulture-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/02/us/02TTCulture/02TTCulture-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/us/02TTCulture/02TTCulture-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/us/02TTCulture/02TTCulture-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1293, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Big-Box Store Has New Life as an Airy Public Library', 'kicker': 'Texas Monthly', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Big-Box Store Has New 