2/09/01/conversations-with-andy-murray-questions-from-readers/', 'snippet': 'Andy Murray said he cried a few days after the Olympics, when the whole thing finally sank in. And any movie with Will Ferrell in it is O.K. by him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Andy Murray defeated Feliciano Lopez, 7-6 (5), 7-6 (5), 4-6, 7-6 (4), on Saturday to reach the fourth round of the United States Open. In his regular postmatch interview with Straight Sets, Murray took questions from readers of The New York Times who sent their inquiries from all over the world.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Conversations With Andy Murray: Questions From Readers', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'You Can Pass Murray the Haggis, but Not the Newspaper', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-02T01:54:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By GREG BISHOP', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Greg', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'BISHOP', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/69b97060-db26-5745-9980-b9912ed7c224', 'word_count': 971, 'uri': 'nyt://article/69b97060-db26-5745-9980-b9912ed7c224'}, {'abstract': 'Mayor Antonio Villaraigosa of Los Angeles, chairman of the Democratic National Convention, makes the rounds on the Sunday shows to preview the week ahead.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/01/sunday-breakfast-menu-sept-2/', 'snippet': 'Mayor Antonio Villaraigosa of Los Angeles, chairman of the Democratic National Convention, makes the rounds on the Sunday shows to preview the week ahead.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Presidential politics will again dominate the conversations on the news shows on Sunday, on the weekend between th