covered a shared history.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/02/fashion/weddings/beth-reisfeld-charles-lesch-weddings.html', 'snippet': 'As the couple learned more about each other, they discovered a shared history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Beth Lynn Reisfeld, the daughter of Carol L. Reisfeld and Dr. Peter L. Reisfeld of Dix Hills, N.Y., is to be married Sunday to Charles Harry Taylor Lesch, the son of Prof. Paula S. Fass and Prof. John E. Lesch of Berkeley, Calif. The wedding is to be held at Bridgewaters in Manhattan, with Rabbi Shlomo Shulman officiating. Rabbi Richard G. Hirsch, a cousin of the groom, is to take part.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/fashion/weddings/02REISFELDjpg/02REISFELDjpg-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/fashion/weddings/02REISFELDjpg/02REISFELDjpg-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1638, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/fashion/weddings/02REISFELDjpg/02REISFELDjpg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/02/fashion/weddings/02REISFELDjpg/02REISFELDjpg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/fashion/weddings/02REISFELDjpg/02REISFELDjpg-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Beth Reisfeld, Charles Lesch', 'kicker