ke his first start for the Baltimore Orioles in April, he watched as his fifth pitch whipped off the bat of Derek Jeter and landed 421 feet from home plate at Camden Yards for a home run. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/sports/baseball/02pins-chen/02pins-chen-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 872, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/sports/baseball/02pins-chen/02pins-chen-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1743, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/sports/baseball/02pins-chen/02pins-chen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/02/sports/baseball/02pins-chen/02pins-chen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/sports/baseball/02pins-chen/02pins-chen-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Rookie Chen Stays Steady in Rotation for Orioles', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rookie Chen Stays Steady In Rotation For Orioles', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chen, Wei-Yin', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Baltimore Orioles', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-02T05:03:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_de