2/advertisers-join-the-social-video-app-showyou/', 'snippet': 'As marketers debate the efficacy of online display advertising, a unit of the Omnicom Media Group has partnered with the video platform Showyou to show users video ads alongside other content.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As marketers debate the efficacy of online display advertising and users ignore the standard blocks of ads found on many Web sites, many advertisers are turning to videos that blur the line between content and marketing.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Advertisers Join the Social Video App Showyou', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Advertisers Join Social Video App', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Online Advertising', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings and Downloads', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Omnicom Group Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Showyou', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-03T00:12:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tanzina Vega', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tanzina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vega', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6f572d6c-6fd2-5a52-a7b9-8684a4525a35', 'word_count': 404, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6f572d6c-6fd2-5a52-a7b9-8684a4525a35'}, {'abstract': 'The appearance is said to be the first of a veiled news presenter on state television, which had enforced a de facto ban during the Mubarak era.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/03/world/middleeast/egypt-abuzz-as-woman-in-hijab-reads-news-on-state-tv.html', 'snippet': 'The appearance is said to be the first of a veiled news presenter on state television, which had enforced a de facto ban during the Mubarak era.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAIRO — In what was called a first for Egyptian state television, a woman wearing a head scarf presented headlines in a newscast on Sunday, breaking with a code of secular dress that for decades effectively barred the wearing of Islamic head coverings.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/world/egypt/egypt-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 737, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/world/egypt/egypt-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1971, 'width': 1419, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/world/egypt/egypt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/03/world/egypt/egypt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/world/egypt/egypt-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Egypt Abuzz as Newsreader on State TV Wears Hijab', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Egypt Abuzz As Anchor On State TV Wears Hijab', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Muslim Brotherhood (Egypt)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value'