Matt Bissonnette, a former Navy SEALs member who wrote a first-person account of the Osama bin Laden raid, was willing to speak out because of “bad blood” with his unit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/03/us/bin-laden-books-navy-author-was-slighted-account-says.html', 'snippet': 'A new e-book says that Matt Bissonnette, a former Navy SEALs member who wrote a first-person account of the Osama bin Laden raid, was willing to speak out because of “bad blood” with his unit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The former Navy SEALs member who is a co-author of a first-person account of the raid that killed Osama bin Laden was willing to break “the code of silence” honored by many commandos because of “bad blood” with his former unit, the elite SEAL Team 6, according to a new e-book written by other Special Operations veterans.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/us/SEAL/SEAL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 685, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/us/SEAL/SEAL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1370, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Account Says Navy Author Wrote Book After a Slight', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Account Says Navy Author Wrote Book After a Slight', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Books and Readers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'bin Laden, Osama', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Navy Seals', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bissonnette, Matt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'No Easy Day: The Firsthand Account of the Mission That Killed Osama bin Laden (Book)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-03T00:34:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Dao', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dao', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0acbe2ee-b303-5327-8502-23c8c20cc9fc', 'word_count': 735, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0acbe2ee-b303-5327-8502-23c8c20cc9fc'}, {'abstract': 'Two police partners embarked one evening on a journey into a parallel world, a backstage apart from Broadway’s gloss that most visitors never glimpse or even consider.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/03/nyregion/for-times-square-police-a-stage-tourists-dont-see.html', 'snippet': 'Two police partners embarked one evening on a journey into a parallel world, a backstage apart from Broadway’s gloss that most visitors never glimpse or even consider.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The tour began just after dusk, as the lavender sky dissolved into night, backlit by the pulsing luminescence of Times Square. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/nyregion/SUMMERNIGHTS1/SUMMERNIGHTS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/03/nyregion/SUMMERNIGHTS1/SUMMERNIGHTS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/nyregion/SUMMERNIGHTS1/SUMMERNIGHTS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'l