like his mentor, Assemblyman Vito J. Lopez, has vowed to effect long-promised reforms to Democratic Party politics in the borough.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/03/nyregion/seddio-is-protege-and-likely-successor-of-lopez-as-brooklyn-leader.html', 'snippet': 'Frank R. Seddio, like his mentor, Assemblyman Vito J. Lopez, has vowed to effect long-promised reforms to Democratic Party politics in the borough.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Each time a Brooklyn kingmaker falls in this borough of the back-room deal — the tenures of three of the last four Democratic bosses have ended in scandal — the outrage turns to an outcry for one of New York’s last political machines to be dismantled.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/nyregion/MACHINE/MACHINE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 579, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/nyregion/MACHINE/MACHINE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1159, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/nyregion/MACHINE/MACHINE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/03/nyregion/MACHINE/MACHINE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/nyregion/MACHINE/MACHINE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Likely Successor to Disgraced Brooklyn Party Leader Is a Friend and Protégé', 'ki