 the first 10 holes, including seven in a row, on his way to an eight-under-par 63 in the third round of the Deutsche Bank Championship. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/sports/YGOLF/YGOLF-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 850, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/sports/YGOLF/YGOLF-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1699, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/sports/YGOLF/YGOLF-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/03/sports/YGOLF/YGOLF-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/sports/YGOLF/YGOLF-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Oosthuizen Catches McIlroy With Early Flurry of Birdies', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Oosthuizen Catches McIlroy With Early Flurry of Birdies', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McIlroy, Rory', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Oosthuizen, Louis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Dustin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bradley, Keegan', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-03T00:58:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 