 Streets of Charlotte', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Democratic National Convention', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Charlotte (NC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foreclosures', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigrants', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-03T01:13:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Viv Bernstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Viv', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bernstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9828d4cb-4773-56ae-9e10-eb5020f807ef', 'word_count': 664, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9828d4cb-4773-56ae-9e10-eb5020f807ef'}, {'abstract': 'The success of Andy Murray and the emerging Laura Robson at the United States Open adds hope for those awaiting the first homegrown Wimbledon singles champion since 1977.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/03/sports/tennis/andy-murray-and-laura-robson-emerge-at-us-open-as-british-wimbledon-contenders.html', 'snippet': 'The success of Andy Murray and the emerging Laura Robson at the United States Open adds hope for those awaiting the first homegrown Wimbledon singles champion since 1977.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Whatever happens from here on out at the United States Open, the tennis summer of 2012 shall in no small part be remembered for compelling evidence of a country’s climate change. Those dark clouds of defeatism that hovered for decades over the famed Wimbledon lawns and British tennis have finally rolled out and been replaced by a sky of gold and silver hue and hope.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/sports/ARATONfloater/ARATONfloater-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/03/sports/ARATONfloater/ARATONfloater-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/sports/ARATONfloater/ARATONfloater-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 738, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/sports/ARATONfloater/ARATONfloater-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1476, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/sports/ARATONfloater/ARATONfloater-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/03/sports/ARATONfloater/ARATONfloater-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/sports/ARATONfloater/ARATONfloater-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 151, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Success at Open Bodes Well for Britons’ Chances at Wimbledon', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Success at Open Bodes Well for Britons’ Chances at Wimbledon', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Leon', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wimbledon Tennis Tournament', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Murray, Andy (1987- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Robson, Laura', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-03T01:14:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Harvey Araton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Harvey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Araton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ebb89249-c9a0-5971-9ae0-d5037e35348e', 'word_count': 902, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ebb89249-c9a0-5971-9ae0-d5037e35348e'}, {'abstract': 'The Obama administration is taking steps it hopes will force Iran to reconsider almost stalemated nuclear negotiations — and forestall an Israeli attack on Iran’s nuclear facilities.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/03/world/middleeast/us-is-weighing-new-curbs-on-iran-in-nod-to-israel.html', 'snippet': 'The Obama administration is taking steps it hopes will force Iran to reconsider almost stalemated nuclear negotiations — and forestall an Israeli attack on Iran’s nuclear facilities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — With Israel openly debating whether to strike at Iran’s nuclear facilities in the coming months, the Obama administration is moving ahead with a range of steps short of war that it hopes will forestall an Israeli attack, while forcing the Iranians to take more seriously negotiations that are all but stalemated.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'To Calm Israel, U.S. Offers Ways to Restrain Iran', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '