-5cf9-8833-ac04fc31f103'}, {'abstract': 'Mayor Julián Castro of San Antonio will give the Democrats’ keynote address, the role that brought national attention to Barack Obama.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/03/us/politics/democratic-convention-spotlight-beckons-san-antonio-mayor.html', 'snippet': 'Mayor Julián Castro of San Antonio will give the Democrats’ keynote address, the role that brought national attention to Barack Obama.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN ANTONIO — Mayor Julián Castro will be closely watching two elections on Nov. 6.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Spotlight With Precedent Beckons a Mayor From Texas', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Spotlight With Precedent Beckons Texas Mayor', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Antonio (Tex)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Castro, Julian', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Democratic National Convention', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hispanic-Americans', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (Pre-School)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Speeches and Statements', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-03T01:33:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Manny Fernandez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Manny', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fernandez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0326c31d-35a8-5584-9aff-7524b2576cf7', 'word_count': 1279, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0326c31d-35a8-5584-9aff-7524b2576cf7'}, {'abstract': 'There are a lot of big boasts in this campaign, and not all of them are about the budget.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/03/opinion/krugman-rosie-ruiz-republicans.html', 'snippet': 'There are a lot of big boasts in this campaign, and not all of them are about the budget.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Remember Rosie Ruiz? In 1980 she was the first woman to cross the finish line at the Boston Marathon — except it turned out that she hadn’t actually run most of the race, that she sneaked onto the course around a mile from the end. Ever since, she has symbolized a particular kind of fraud, in which people claim credit for achieving things they have not, in fact, achieved.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/02/opinion/paul-krugman/paul-krugman-articleLarge.png', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/02/opinion/paul-krugman/paul-krugman-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/02/opinion/paul-krugman/paul-krugman-jumbo.png', 'height': 512, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/02/opinion/paul-krugman/paul-krugman-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1000, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/02/opinion/paul-krugman/paul-krugman-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thum