{'abstract': 'As the Internet has opened the art market to the masses, the volume of fraud has vastly increased, experts say.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/03/arts/design/growth-in-online-art-market-brings-more-fraud.html', 'snippet': 'As the Internet has opened the art market to the masses, the volume of fraud has vastly increased, experts say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bargain hunting online? How about an original Rembrandt for $900 (“you can clearly tell its age by the paper,” the seller of this etching attests), or a signed piece in ink by Matisse for $1,250. (The artist’s work is, the online seller notes, “radical and unprecedented in the history of Western art.”) ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/arts/FAKES-jp1/FAKES-jp1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 999, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/arts/FAKES-jp1/FAKES-jp1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1997, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/arts/FAKES-jp1/FAKES-jp1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/02/arts/FAKES-jp1/FAKES-jp1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/arts/FAKES-jp1/FAKES-jp1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Picasso Online for Just $450? Yes, It Is a Steal', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': N