und.', 'web_url': 'https://straightsets.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/03/gasquet-tops-n-c-a-a-champion-johnson/', 'snippet': 'Richard Gasquet, seeded 13th, ended Steve Johnson’s wild-card run one match short of the third round.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Steve Johnson’s final shot sailed long on Sunday, Richard Gasquet of France lifted a fist and shook it wearily in triumph as he walked to shake hands with him.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gasquet Tops N.C.A.A. Champion Johnson', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-03T05:48:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By JOHN MARTIN', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'MARTIN', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5e4af62d-1c9e-53f5-b991-9526372e2406', 'word_count': 291, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5e4af62d-1c9e-53f5-b991-9526372e2406'}, {'abstract': 'Review of Shirish Kunder’s ‘Joker.’', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/03/aliens-with-dance-moves-and-the-midas-touch/', 'snippet': 'Review of Shirish Kunder’s ‘Joker.’', 'lead_paragraph': '“There might be a utopian vision inside Shirish Kunder’s ‘Joker,’ a Bollywood comedy about establishing contact with extraterrestrials,” Andy Webster wrote in The New York Times. “But if so, it’s buried under a mountain of static.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Aliens With Dance Moves and the Midas Touch', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-03T05:51:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3e9b5ab3-cc4c-5fb2-bf88-acca2aac8115', 'word_count': 102, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3e9b5ab3-cc4c-5fb2-bf88-acca2aac8115'}, {'abstract': 'Can Twitter stand up for privacy, free expression and profitability all at the same time?', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/03/twitters-free-speech-defender/', 'snippet': 'Can Twitter stand up for privacy, free expression and profitability all at the same time?', 'lead_paragraph': '“Alexander Macgillivray, Twitter’s chief lawyer, says that fighting for free speech is more than a good idea,” Somini Sengupta wrote for The New York Times. “He thinks it is a competitive advantage for his company.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Twitter’s Free Speech Defender', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-03T06:18:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ace5bc15-10a1-547b-923d-892e568a8da4', 'word_count': 237, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ace5bc15-10a1-547b-923d-892e568a8da4'}, {'abstract': 'Metropolitan Diary: A teacher planning to describe a speech by Eugene V. Debs realized there was one detail her students probably wouldn’t understand.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/03/when-people-stood-on-soapboxes/', 'snippet': 'Metropolitan Diary: A teacher planning to describe a speech by Eugene V. Debs realized there was one detail her students probably wouldn’t understand.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dear Diary:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], '