unch for corporate clients and political friends on Monday at the Mint Museum in Charlotte, N.C.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/03/a-glimpse-of-lobbyists-convention-exile/', 'snippet': 'Tony and Heather Podesta, the K Street power couple, held an extravagant brunch for corporate clients and political friends on Monday at the Mint Museum in Charlotte, N.C.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C. — Lobbyists are beside themselves: the president’s public cold shoulder has exiled them to the fringes of the convention. Just how far afield?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Glimpse of Lobbyists’ Convention Exile', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Democratic National Convention', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hagan, Kay R', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Podesta, Heather', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mint Museum', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Charlotte (NC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-03T19:46:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Barbaro and Ashley Parker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barbaro', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/756a02b6-d64a-58f0-bbb2-1ce2336e3740', 'word_count': 383, 'uri': 'nyt://article/756a02b6-d64a-58f0-bbb2-1ce2336e3740'}, {'ab