as aimed at police officers who were trying to keep the two sides apart. Late Monday night, a second round of sectarian clashes in Belfast left nine officers injured, Reuters reported. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Northern Ireland: Protesters Injure Police Officers in Belfast', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | Europe', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Northern Ireland: Protesters Injure Police Officers in Belfast', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Belfast (Northern Ireland)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parades', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christians and Christianity', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Northern Ireland', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Attacks on Police', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-04T00:33:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Douglas Dalby', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Douglas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dalby', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/04aa947e-559f-521b-aa8a-1934c95d5d9c', 'word_count': 109, 'uri': 'nyt://article/04aa947e-559f-521b-aa8a-1934c95d5d9c'}, {'abstract': 'Matt, a college graduate; Kemar, an A student; a 4-year-old girl; a young boxer — fatal shootings in New York City are up.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/04/nyregion/in-the-safest-big-city-a-summer-of-guns-and-death.html', 'snippet': 'Matt, a college graduate; Kemar, an A student; a 4-year-old girl; a young boxer — fatal shootings in New York City are up.', 'lead_par