ghanistan where members of the Shinwari tribe have long been engaged in internal tribal warfare.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/05/world/asia/bomber-kills-at-least-20-at-afghan-funeral.html', 'snippet': 'Dozens of people were killed Tuesday by a suicide bomber in an area of eastern Afghanistan where members of the Shinwari tribe have long been engaged in internal tribal warfare.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JALALABAD, Afghanistan — At least 25 mourners were killed when a suicide bomber struck at a funeral on Tuesday in eastern Afghanistan, Afghan officials said. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/05/world/asia/05afghanistan/05afghanistan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/05/world/asia/05afghanistan/05afghanistan-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/05/world/asia/05afghanistan/05afghanistan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/05/world/asia/05afghanistan/05afghanistan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/05/world/asia/05afghanistan/05afghanistan-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bomber Kills at Least 25 at Afghan Funeral', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bomber Kills at Least 25 at