organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0665085a-0427-58ad-8aac-9a996d0d0a4d', 'word_count': 872, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0665085a-0427-58ad-8aac-9a996d0d0a4d'}, {'abstract': 'According to dueling narratives, point guard Raymond Felton will either be a fine complement to the Knicks’ two high scorers or a mediocre floor general prone to petulance.', 'web_url': 'https://offthedribble.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/04/two-views-of-felton-as-he-takes-over-for-lin/', 'snippet': 'According to dueling narratives, point guard Raymond Felton will either be a fine complement to the Knicks’ two high scorers or a mediocre floor general prone to petulance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the height of the Jeremy Lin free-agency drama in July, just days before he was officially cast adrift by a front office still mired in lock step silence on the matter, the Knicks signed Raymond Felton.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Two Views of Felton as He Takes Over for Lin', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ANTHONY, CARMELO', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Felton, Raymond', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lin, Jeremy', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'MCMILLAN, NATE', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "Stoudemire, Amar'e", 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Woodson, Mike', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-04T15:00:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Cavan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'm