ublican National Committee raised about $100 million in August, a person briefed on the total said Tuesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mitt Romney and the Republican National Committee raised about $100 million in August, a person briefed on the total said Tuesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Another $100 Million Month for Romney and the R.N.C.', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-04T18:06:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Confessore', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Confessore', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eaad6872-cdf5-5ff0-bb94-1b1b84f17e5a', 'word_count': 147, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eaad6872-cdf5-5ff0-bb94-1b1b84f17e5a'}, {'abstract': 'The Energy Department fails to take some relatively easy low-cost steps to cut its energy consumption, an audit found.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/04/do-as-i-say-not-as-i/', 'snippet': 'The Energy Department fails to take some relatively easy low-cost steps to cut its energy consumption, an audit found.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Even as the Energy Department preaches energy conservation and efficiency, it is failing to take advantage of readily available, low-cost opportunities to reduce its energy consumption, the department’s inspector general said in a\xa0report released on\xa0Tuesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Do as I Say, Not as I …', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Conservation of Resources', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}