c offering on its chief financial officer, David Ebersman, has caused quite a reaction — including Mark Cuban denouncing my view, saying “Facebook Handled their IPO Exactly Righ,t” and Forbes saying “The Man Responsible For Facebook’s Stock Debacle Is Mark Zuckerberg.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Who Is to Blame for Facebook’s I.P.O.? A Mix of Responses', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Initial Public Offerings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ebersman, David A', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zuckerberg, Mark E', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Facebook Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-04T20:53:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Ross Sorkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': 'Ross', 'lastname': 'Sorkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1a894540-7512-56d9-8f8a-c6d2b015212f', 'word_count': 790, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1a894540-7512-56d9-8f8a-c6d2b015212f'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Boesky, 55, is the chief executive of Pembrook Capital Management, an investment adviser and fund manager focused on debt.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/05/realestate/commercial/the-30-minute-interview-stuart-j-boesky.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Boesky, 55, is the chief executive of Pembrook Capital Management, an investment adviser and fund manager focused on debt.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mr. Boesky, 55, is the chief executive of Pembrook Capital Management, an investment adviser and fund manager focused on debt. The company, which is based in New York, also originates first mortgages and bridge and mezzanine loans for all property types.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/05/business/Interview/Interview-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 792, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/05/business/Interview/Interview-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1585, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/05/business/Interview/Interview-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/05/business/Interview/Interview-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/05/business/Interview/Interview-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Stuart J. Boesky', 'kicker': 'The 30-Minute Interview ', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Stuart J. Boesky', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate (Commercial)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boesky, Ivan F', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pembrook Capital Management LLC', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boesky, Stuart J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-04T21:02:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'subsection_name': '