lyn once again ended violently, and people questioned why a beloved cultural celebration had become synonymous with assaults.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The only reminders of a spirited and clamorous parade a day earlier were a few blue wooden barricades lying on the sidewalk that had been part of heightened crowd-control efforts by the police.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/05/nyregion/PARADE1/PARADE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/05/nyregion/PARADE1/PARADE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 380}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/05/nyregion/PARADE1/PARADE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/05/nyregion/PARADE1/PARADE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Searching for Answers After Violence Mars Parade', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Searching for Answers After Violence Mars Parade', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'West Indian-American Day', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parades', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Crown Heights (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-05T01:27:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk'