e': 'Singh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 5}, {'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Horn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 6}, {'firstname': 'Claudine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hutton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 7}, {'firstname': 'Catriona', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stuart', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 8}, {'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Derry', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 9}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/717362b3-220e-58f8-9ec6-8979b1c78253', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/717362b3-220e-58f8-9ec6-8979b1c78253'}, {'abstract': 'A federal judge in Boston on Tuesday ordered the Massachusetts Department of Correction to provide an inmate with a sex change.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/05/us/massachusetts-sex-change-is-ordered-for-inmate.html', 'snippet': 'A federal judge in Boston on Tuesday ordered the Massachusetts Department of Correction to provide an inmate with a sex change.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A federal judge in Boston on Tuesday ordered the Massachusetts Department of Correction to provide an inmate with a sex change. Doctors for Michelle L. Kosilek, a transsexual prisoner who was convicted of murdering his wife in 1990, say gender reassignment surgery is the only way to treat his severe gender identity disorder. Corrections officials had denied the surgery, saying that it could create security problems. In his decision, Judge Mark L. Wolf found that the denial of the surgery, which would be financed with state taxes, amounted to a violation of the Eighth Amendment, which prohibits cruel and unusual punishment. He is believed to be the first federal judge to order gender reassignment. Mr. Kosilek is serving a life sentence without parole. He sued the Department of Corrections over the matter in 2000. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Massachusetts: Sex Change Is Ordered for Inmate', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | New England', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Massachusetts: Sex Change Is Ordered For Inmate', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Massachusetts', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Transgender and Transsexual', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kosilek, Michelle L', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisons and Prisoners', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wolf, Mark L', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gender', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-05T04:35:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jess Bidgood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jess', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bidgood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/32f0d4c1-f984-534d-a6f0-513ca7d859df', 'word_count': 134, 'uri': 'nyt://article/32f0d4c1-f984-534d-a6f0-513ca7d859df'}, {'abstract': 'Governor Martin O’Malley of Maryland spoke about the differences between President Obama and Mitt Romney at the 2012 Democratic National Convention.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/us/politics/100000001760489/martin-omalleys-speech-at-the-dnc.html', 'snippet': 'Governor Martin O’Malley of Maryland spoke about the differences between President Obama and Mitt Romney at the 2012 Democratic National Convention.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Governor Martin O’Malley of Maryland spoke about the differences between President Obama and Mitt Romney at the 2012 Democratic National Convention.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/05/us/politics/video-dnc-day1-7pm-omalley/video-dnc-day1-7pm-omalley-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/05/us/politics/video-dnc-day1-7pm-omalley/video-dnc-day1-7pm-omalley-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Martin O’Malley’s Speech at the D.N.C.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Malley, Martin J", 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Democratic National Convention', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Speeches and Statements', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-05T04:36:15+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/9afea6ad-5bf6-5210-9073-59f3f51b7ba4', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/9afea6ad-5bf6-5210-9073-59f3f51b7ba4'}, {'abstract': 'The Pentagon press secretary said on Tuesday that the Defense Department believed there was classified information in a new first-person account of the raid that killed Osama bin Laden.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/05/us/pentagon-says-book-contains-classified-information.html', 'snippet': 'The Pentagon press secretary said on Tuesday that the Defense Department believed there was classified information in a new first-person account of the raid that killed Osama bin Laden.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Pentagon press secretary, George Little, said on Tuesday that the Defense Department believed there was classified information in a new first-person account of the raid that killed Osama bin Laden. Mr. Little did not specify what the information was or do more than repeat threats of legal action. The book, “No Easy Day,” written by a former member of the Navy SEALs, Matt Bissonnette, with a co-author, Kevin Maurer, went on sale on Tuesday. Pentagon officials say Mr. Bissonnette violated nondisclosure agreements he signed with the government, but Mr. Bissonnette and his lawyer say he did not. Penguin, the publisher, is printing 575,000 hardcover copies, placing “No Easy Day” among the biggest books of the year. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pentagon Says Book Contains Classified Information', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | Washington', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pentagon Says Book Contains Classified Information', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Defense Department', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Penguin Group', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'bin Laden, Osama', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classified Information and State Secrets', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bissonnette, Matt', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'No Easy Day: The Firsthand Account of the Mission That Killed Osama bin Laden (Book)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-05T04:37:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabeth Bumiller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elisabeth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bumiller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/50b53ef1-306a-561d-bc2c-00a679d8fe12', 'word_count': 120, 'uri': 'nyt://article/50b53ef1-306a-561d-bc2c-00a679d8fe12'}, {'abstract': 'The Hong Kong-based airline Cathay Pacific, citing the vulnerability of shark populations due to overfishing, says it will no longer carry shark fin on its cargo flights.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/05/hong-kong-airline-bans-shark-fin-as-cargo/', 'snippet': 'The Hong Kong-based airline Cathay Pacific, citing the vulnerability of shark populations due to overfishing, says it will no longer carry shark fin on its cargo flights.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — Cathay Pacific, responding to pressure from an array of environmental groups in Asia, has announced that it will no longer carry shark fin on its cargo flights.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/05/blogs/fins-rdv/fins-rdv-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 663, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/05/blogs/fins-rdv/fins-rdv-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1326, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/05/blogs/fins-rdv/fins-rdv-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/05/blogs/fins-rdv/fins-rdv-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheigh