t-the-democrats-didnt-say/', 'snippet': 'Kathleen Sebelius and others defended the health care law, but didn’t dwell on its main purpose: To provide coverage for 30 million uninsured Americans.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C. – After years of waiting for Democrats to acknowledge President Obama’s pre-eminent achievement – health care reform – it was good to hear them talk about it with pride from the convention stage on Tuesday night. Speaker after speaker reminded the audience of the law, vigorously refuting the Republican dogma that it is an Orwellian disaster.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What the Democrats Didn’t Say', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Democratic National Convention', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sebelius, Kathleen', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-05T19:15:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Firestone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Firestone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/beff0719-5451-555c-8dd0-0665623e7280', 'word_count': 503, 'uri': 'nyt://article/beff0719-5451-555c-8dd0-0665623e7280'}, {'abstract': 'Bank of America is the latest bank to adopt a simplified format for checking account disclosures.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/05/bank-of-america-adopts-simpler-checking-account-disclosure/', 'snippet': 'Bank of America is the latest bank to adopt a simplified format for checking account disclosures.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bank of America recently became the last 