, telegrams, phone calls, text messages. From the dawn of civilization, man has experimented with different modes of communication, each with pros and cons. Smoke signals, for example, contribute to far fewer car accidents than text messages. Text messages, on the other hand, leave much less soot.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2010/06/01/technology/Pogue-190-for-Email/Pogue-190-for-Email-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2010/06/01/technology/Pogue-190-for-Email/Pogue-190-for-Email-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Smartphone? Presto! 2-Way Radio', 'kicker': 'State of the Art', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Smartphone? Presto! 2-Way Radio', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wireless Communications', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-05T21:37:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Pogue', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pogue', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c72da000-53d6-5786-895e-62492f2679a1', 'word_count': 1302, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c72da000-53d6-5786-895e-62492f2679a1'}, {'abstract': 'When the two men behind TomandLorenzo.com are doing their jobs, they aren’t above falling apart near celebrities.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/06/fashion/new-york-fashion-week-tom-fitzgerald-and-lorenzo-marquez-fashion-bloggers.html', 'snippet': 'When the two men behind TomandLorenzo.com are doing their jobs, they aren’t above falling apart near celebrities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE bloggers behind TomandLorenzo.com have been to countless fashion shows, but one stands out as surreal. It was Oscar de la Renta’s pre-fall collection last December, a tough ticket to score. Not only were the pair seated front row, but Anna Wintour was six seats away.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/06/fashion/06UPCLOSE/06UPCLOSE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/06/fashion/06UPCLOSE/06UPCLOSE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/06/fashion/06UPCLOSE/06zUPCLOSE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/06/fashion/06UPCLOSE/06zUPCLOSE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/06/fashion/06UPCLOSE/06UPCLOSE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/06/fashion/06UPCLOSE/06UPCLOSE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/06/fashion/06UPCLOSE/06UPCLOSE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge',