losely monitoring the area’s six populations of sandplain gerardia.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/06/nyregion/botanists-fear-long-island-droughts-toll-on-sandplain-gerardia-flower.html', 'snippet': 'Dry conditions across the country, including Long Island, are worrying the botanists closely monitoring the area’s six populations of sandplain gerardia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MONTAUK, N.Y. — At the eastern end of Long Island, on the South Fork, tucked among the wobbly clam shacks and the steroidal homes, there are a few small grassy plots sectioned off by short chicken-wire fences. The wire is rusty, and the wooden posts that hold it upright are weathered to a milky gray. One plot is not far from a cliff that drops straight to the sea. Another is within eyeshot of a condominium association’s swimming pool. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/06/nyregion/FLOWER2/FLOWER2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 737, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/06/nyregion/FLOWER2/FLOWER2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1889, 'width': 1360, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/06/nyregion/FLOWER2/FLOWER2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/06/nyregion/FLOWER2/FLOWER2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/06/nyregion/FLOWER2/FLOWER2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name':