nyt://video/bf0c5bfe-db6e-5692-845e-51ff2191a5ae'}, {'abstract': 'He’s the only person who can turn the word “arithmetic” into an applause line.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/05/bill-clinton-speaks/', 'snippet': 'He’s the only person who can turn the word “arithmetic” into an applause line.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C.–Watching Bill Clinton take the stage at the Democratic National Convention and take over the room with his first few, simple words – “We are here to nominate a President and I’ve got one in mind” — was like watching a great violinist follow a group of gifted amateurs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bill Clinton Speaks', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Democratic National Convention', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Bill', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-06T03:39:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Rosenthal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenthal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/46adea25-28a7-56fd-8506-a68791911a4f', 'word_count': 521, 'uri': 'nyt://article/46adea25-28a7-56fd-8506-a68791911a4f'}, {'abstract': 'The full transcript of former President Bill Clinton’s speech to the Democratic National Convention.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/05/us/politics/transcript-of-bill-clintons-speech-to-the-democratic-national-convention.html', 'snippet': 'The full transcript of former President Bill Clinton’s speech to the Democratic National Convention.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The following is the full text of former President Bill Clinton’s speech on Wednes