-c1ab24358b5a'}, {'abstract': 'The basic outlines of the stories told at the Democratic convention about layoffs and plant closings that occurred after Bain bought three companies were accurate, but they lacked context and mitigating details.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/06/a-fuller-explanation-of-bain-stories-told-at-democratic-convention/', 'snippet': 'The basic outlines of the stories told at the Democratic convention about layoffs and plant closings that occurred after Bain bought three companies were accurate, but they lacked context and mitigating details.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The three people who told their stories about their experiences with Mitt Romney’s firm, Bain Capital, Wednesday night during the Democratic National Convention laid out the by-now-familiar Democratic critique that he prized profits over people during his 15-year career in private equity and that he was a job destroyer, rather than a job creator.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Fuller Explanation of Bain Stories Told at Democratic Convention', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ampad', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bain Capital', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Dade International', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-06T04:44:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Luo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Luo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_