 his rivalry with Federer, who later lost to Tomas...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Immediately after Andy Murray came back to beat Marin Cilic, the No. 12 seed from Croatia, 3-6, 7-6 (4), 6-2, 6-0, in the quarterfinals of the United States Open on Wednesday, attention turned, as it usually has for Murray lately, to Roger Federer. In his regular postmatch conversation with Straight Sets, Murray detailed his rivalry with Federer, who later was upset by Tomas Berdych.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Conversations With Andy Murray: Federer Always Seems to Be Lurking', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Federer, Roger', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Murray, Andy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-06T06:03:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Greg Bishop', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Greg', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bishop', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1927774b-f85f-5d2a-a61f-bc4296dba66b', 'word_count': 817, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1927774b-f85f-5d2a-a61f-bc4296dba66b'}, {'abstract': 'The bill is the latest volley between political parties and the Supreme Court over the issue.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/06/indias-latest-reservations-bill-stirs-controversy/', 'snippet': 'The bill is the latest volley between political parties and the Supreme Court over the issue.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a measure that could expand India’s affirmative action programs, the government introduc