e counseling at the Lawrenceville School in Lawrenceville, N.J.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tip Sheet | How to Succeed in College', 'kicker': 'The Choice', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lawrenceville School', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-06T09:58:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeffrey Durso-Finley and Holly Burks Becker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeffrey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Durso-Finley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Holly', 'middlename': 'Burks', 'lastname': 'Becker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a6e762e8-9d61-5676-abfa-6a2ee1a422c9', 'word_count': 1074, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a6e762e8-9d61-5676-abfa-6a2ee1a422c9'}, {'abstract': 'Novak Djokovic, the defending U.S. Open champion, faces Juan Martin del Potro in the quarterfinals.', 'web_url': 'https://straightsets.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/06/what-to-watch-on-thursday-3/', 'snippet': 'Novak Djokovic, the defending U.S. Open champion, faces Juan Martin del Potro in the quarterfinals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It took Novak Djokovic barely more than 90 minutes to go up by two sets and a break over Stanislas Wawrinka on Wednesday before his opponent called it quits — another dominant performance for the defending champion. Through four matches at the United States Open, Djokovic has lost just 20 games and has not dropped a set.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What to Watch