bfcc'}, {'abstract': 'As the European Central Bank unveils measures to help the debt-plagued economies of the euro zone, some European leaders are calling for tighter integration to solve the Continent’s economic problems in the longer term. Is closer union the answer, and how will proposals for treaty changes be greeted by a majority of governments and voters?', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/06/papering-over-cracks-in-europes-union/', 'snippet': 'As the European Central Bank unveils measures to help the debt-plagued economies of the euro zone, some European leaders are calling for tighter integration to solve the Continent’s economic problems in the longer term. Is closer union the answer,...', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — When cracks in the roof of the European Parliament building in Brussels resulted in the building’s partial closure this week, skeptics were quick to seize on a handy metaphor for the state of the European Union.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/06/blogs/rdv-europarl/rdv-europarl-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/06/blogs/rdv-europarl/rdv-europarl-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Papering Over Cracks in Europe’s Union', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Draghi, Mario', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe