/thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/06/a-dreamer-addresses-the-democratic-convention/', 'snippet': 'One unnoticed speaker at the Democratic convention was Benita Veliz, a leader of a group of young undocumented immigrants who call themselves Dreamers, because they would be eligible for legal status under the long-stalled Dream Act.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Benita Veliz was only at the lectern at the Democratic convention for a few minutes on Wednesday night. CNN did not even turn its cameras on the stage during her brief speech. But for many Latinos in the hall, her moment under the lights was a stunning surprise. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A ‘Dreamer’ Addresses the Democratic Convention', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Out Of the Shadows: A Speech Makes History', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Citizenship and Naturalization', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Democratic National Convention', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deportation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dream Act (Development, Relief and Education for Minors Act)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Endorsements', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foreign Students (in US)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hispanic-Americans', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigrants', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Republican National Convention', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Castro, Julian', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama