e Denise L. Cote approved conditions that curb publishers’ ability to restrict a retailer’s “discretion over e-book pricing.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/06/judge-approves-e-book-pricing-settlement-between-government-and-publishers/', 'snippet': 'In a widely expected decision, Judge Denise L. Cote approved conditions that curb publishers’ ability to restrict a retailer’s “discretion over e-book pricing.', 'lead_paragraph': '8:35 p.m. | Updated In a decision that could start an e-book price war in the publishing industry, a federal judge on Thursday approved a settlement between the Justice Department and three major publishers in a civil antitrust case that accused the companies of collusion in the pricing of digital books.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Judge Approves E-Book Pricing Settlement Between Government and Publishers', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Judge Approves E-Book Pricing Settlement Between Government and Publishers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Antitrust Laws and Competition Issues', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Books and Readers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cote, Denise', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMAZON.COM INC', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN BOOKSELLERS ASSN', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Apple Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Authors Guild', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Barnes & Noble Inc', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hachette Book Group', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'HarperCollins Publishers', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organiza