sident Obama’s most forceful and substantive surrogates, but he has hardly been the most consistent. In fact, in a new ad, Mitt Romney’s campaign is reminding voters that Mr. Clinton was once a sharp critic of Mr. Obama, in 2008.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Clinton Was Not Always an Obama Fan, Romney Ad Recalls', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Ad Campaign: Recalling a Less Friendly Time', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Advertising', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2008', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Bill', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Hampshire', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-06T18:45:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sarah Wheaton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sarah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wheaton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9b55e56e-82dd-5944-aae3-f92da204b9af', 'word_count': 383, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9b55e56e-82dd-5944-aae3-f92da204b9af'}, {'abstract': 'New video games out this fall include Call of Duty: Black Ops 2, Assassin’s Creed III, Dishonored and Luigi’s Ghost Mansion.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/09/arts/video-games/new-video-games-far-cry-3-assassins-creed-iii-dishonored.html', 'snippet': 'New video games out this fall include Call of Duty: Black Ops 2, Assassin’s Creed III, Dishonored and Luigi’s Ghost Mansion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FOR video game players the summer begins after Labor Day. The preceding months have the prestige titles and the intriguing independent projects. In that category 2012 has served up Dear Esther, Fez, Journey and Papo & Yo, to name a few. The fall is the time for blockbusters, many of them sequels with big explosions.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '97', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/09/arts/video-games/09SUELLENTROP1_SPAN/09SUELLENTROP1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/09/arts/video-games/09SUELLENTROP1_SPAN/09SUELLENTROP1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/09/arts/video-games/09SUELLENTROP1_SPAN/09SUELLENTROP1_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/09/arts/video-games/09SUELLENTROP1_SPAN/09SUELLENTROP1_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/09/arts/video-games/09SUELLENTROP1_SPAN/09SUELLENTROP1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/09/arts/video-games/09SUELLENTROP1_SPAN/09SUELLENTROP1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url':