, 'snippet': 'Sara Errani, a semifinalist at the U.S. Open, has had to face questions about her connection to the Spanish doctor Luis Garcia del Moral, who recently was barred by the United States Anti-Doping Agency as part of the case against Lance Armstrong.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Reaching the singles semifinals and women’s doubles final in New York continues a career season for Sara Errani, who was also a finalist at the French Open. But she has had to face questions about her connection to the Spanish doctor Luis Garcia del Moral, who recently was barred by the United States Anti-Doping Agency as part of the case against Lance Armstrong, a punishment recognized by the International Tennis Federation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Errani Tries to Distance Herself From Barred Spanish Doctor', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'del Moral, Luis Garcia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Errani, Sara', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Tennis Federation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Anti-Doping Agency', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-06T19:16:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Rothenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rothenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7677eaeb-f5a7-5e4a-9412-0467897fe943', 'word_count': 519, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7677eaeb-f5a7-5e4a-9412-0467897fe943'}, {'abstract': 'Maimuna Abdi Yussuf, a Somali student