hone 5 Video and Apple TV Delay', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-06T22:08:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9da4e91d-6bfc-58fc-937b-043b9b33eae5', 'word_count': 125, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9da4e91d-6bfc-58fc-937b-043b9b33eae5'}, {'abstract': 'The reality show “Cheer” on CMT focuses more on cheerleaders than on their parents, and their leader doesn’t veer into abusiveness for the benefit of the cameras.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/07/arts/television/cheer-on-cmt-follows-central-jersey-allstars.html', 'snippet': 'The reality show “Cheer” on CMT focuses more on cheerleaders than on their parents, and their leader doesn’t veer into abusiveness for the benefit of the cameras.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Take the nastiness and willful boorishness out of a certain breed of reality show, and what do you have? A series you can actually bear to watch.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/07/arts/07CHEER_SPAN/07CHEER_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 369, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/07/arts/07CHEER_SPAN/07CHEER_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 369}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/07/arts/07CHEER_SPAN/CHEER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/07/arts/07CHEER_SPAN/