77de9e'}, {'abstract': '“Island Night,” a 12-hour overnight walk on Fire Island, hosted by the arts group Elastic City, is part philosophic dialogue, part poetic reverie and part nature walk.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/07/nyregion/island-night-a-walk-across-fire-island.html', 'snippet': '“Island Night,” a 12-hour overnight walk on Fire Island, hosted by the arts group Elastic City, is part philosophic dialogue, part poetic reverie and part nature walk.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EVERY summer thousands of New Yorkers go to Fire Island, a narrow barrier island off the South Shore of Long Island, in search of sun, sand, sex and sea breezes. But this year, on the last weekend in August, a motley group of nine disembarked at the Pines, the famous gay resort at the island’s midpoint, hellbent on Socratic dialogue.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/07/arts/07ISLAND1_SPAN/07ISLAND1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/07/arts/07ISLAND1_SPAN/07ISLAND1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/07/arts/07ISLAND1_SPAN/07ISLAND-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/07/arts/07ISLAND1_SPAN/07ISLAND-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/07/arts/07ISLAND1_SPAN/07ISLAND1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType':