ynskey.html', 'snippet': 'A 19-year-old actor’s passionate, late-adolescent restlessness awakens some of a 30-something divorced woman’s dormant enthusiasm for life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The ostensibly grown-up man residing in the parental nest — usually in a boyhood bedroom full of movie posters, video games and action figures — is a staple of American comedy. He is a figure to be pitied and ridiculed, but also envied, since he still dwells in a juvenile paradise that the rest of us, with our jobs and kids and dreary domestic routines, supposedly long to recapture.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/07/arts/07HELLO_SPAN/07HELLO_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/07/arts/07HELLO_SPAN/07HELLO_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/07/arts/07HELLO_SPAN/HELLO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/07/arts/07HELLO_SPAN/HELLO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/07/arts/07HELLO_SPAN/07HELLO_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/07/arts/07HELLO_SPAN/07HELLO_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'im