6/black-white-kindles-are-here-to-stay/', 'snippet': 'Jeff Bezos, Amazon’s chief executive, believes that black-and-white e-readers will always have a home in the e-reader family. The new Kindle Paperwhite is the latest evidence of this belief.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You would think that to announce a black-and-white e-reader in 2012 would be to invite ridicule. Yet when Jeff Bezos, Amazon’s chief executive, showcased an updated black-and-white e-ink Kindle on Thursday, called the Kindle Paperwhite, people clapped with\xa0excitement. There were even a few “oohs” and “ahhs” from the assembled crowd.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Black and White Kindles Are Here to Stay', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Amazon Kindle', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Books and Readers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bezos, Jeffrey P', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMAZON.COM INC', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-07T00:30:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Bilton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bilton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/47c5d5c3-53d8-5915-8365-6b79fe30dd55', 'word_count': 213, 'uri': 'nyt://article/47c5d5c3-53d8-5915-8365-6b79fe30dd55'}, {'abstract': 'Dennis M. Walcott, New York City’s schools chancellor, is not only an alumnus of Public School 36 in Queens, he is also a grandfather of one of its students, and thus a frequent visitor.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/07/nyregion/at-his-alma-mater-in-queens-chancellor-dennis-walcott-is-poppy-to-students.html', 'sni