theater/reviews/forbidden-broadway-alive-kicking-at-47th-street-theater.html', 'snippet': 'That hard-hitting satirical revue of Broadway musicals, “Forbidden Broadway,” is back with new routines and targets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pssst. Hey, buddy. Yeah, you with the double-breasted pinstripes and the clueless expression. You in the market for the ultimate cheat sheet on Broadway musicals? You know, something that’ll let you join the conversation and sound supersmart when your girlfriend (oh, sorry, dude, boyfriend) starts talking about these silly singing shows that put you to sleep?', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/07/arts/07FORBIDDEN/07FORBIDDEN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 582, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/07/arts/07FORBIDDEN/07FORBIDDEN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1572, 'width': 894, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/07/arts/07FORBIDDEN/07FORBIDDEN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/07/arts/07FORBIDDEN/07FORBIDDEN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/07/arts/07FORBIDDEN/07FORBIDDEN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 149, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Don’t Cry for Them; It’s All in Nasty Fun', 'kicker': 'Theater Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Don’t Cry for Them; It’s All in Nasty Fun', 'name': N