/', 'snippet': 'Roy Hodgson’s philosophy may take some time to filter through the English system. The question is whether the country will wait.', 'lead_paragraph': 'England Manager Roy Hodgson doesn’t come across as a natural leader. In fact, he doesn’t really come across as a soccer coach, since not many in his vocation have confessed to being partial to Czech literature and opera. But Hodgson’s appointment was never based on appearances, nor on how he spends his free time.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hodgson’s England: A 10-Year Plan for a Win-Now Job', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hodgson, Roy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Football Assn', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-07T07:00:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Graham Ruthven', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Graham', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ruthven', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7b6c05ba-70d0-567e-a473-aeb21da37700', 'word_count': 865, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7b6c05ba-70d0-567e-a473-aeb21da37700'}, {'abstract': 'The pop stars were among a handful of winners on Thursday night at the MTV Video Music Awards, which handed out just six awards in two hours.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/08/arts/music/rihanna-chris-brown-and-drake-triumph-at-video-music-awards.html', 'snippet': 'The pop stars were among a handful of winners on Thursday night at the MTV Video Music Awards, which handed out just six awards in two hours.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Broadcast live on MTV on Thursday night from the Staples C