California court decision has resulted in an important clarification, determining that Medicare beneficiaries and their survivors have a right to appeal the denial of services by a hospice provider.', 'web_url': 'https://newoldage.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/07/court-affirms-right-to-appeal-medicare-decisions-about-hospice-services/', 'snippet': 'A California court decision has resulted in an important clarification, determining that Medicare beneficiaries and their survivors have a right to appeal the denial of services by a hospice provider.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Emily Back lay dying and in excruciating pain, her hospice made a decision that her husband couldn’t accept. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Court: You Can Appeal Medicare Decisions About Hospice Services', 'kicker': 'The New Old Age', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicare', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Center for Medicare Advocacy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-07T09:53:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Judith Graham', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Judith', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Graham', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/612073d5-e9b0-5aad-ac45-3833941e00c7', 'word_count': 813, 'uri': 'nyt://article/612073d5-e9b0-5aad-ac45-3833941e00c7'}, {'abstract': 'The author, a director of college counseling, shares lessons learned about transitions after her mother joined the Peace Corps.', 'web_url': 'https://thechoice.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/07/on-going-to-college-and-saying-goodbye/', 'snippet': 'The author, a director of college counseling, shares lessons learned about transitions after her mother joined the Peace Corps.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Marie Bigham is the director of college counseling at Greenhill School in Addison, Tex.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'On Going to College, and Saying Goodbye', 'kicker': 'The Choice', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Peace Corps', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-07T09:56:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Marie Bigham', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Marie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bigham', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6987ad3d-5d94-540e-9f8e-bcd8d61b0a33', 'word_count': 722, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6987ad3d-5d94-540e-9f8e-bcd8d61b0a33'}, {'abstract': 'Through five matches, Serena Williams had done nothing to change the perception that she is the favorite to win the title.', 'web_url': 'https://straightsets.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/07/what-to-watch-on-friday-3/', 'snippet': 'Through five matches, Serena Williams had done nothing to change the perception that she is the favorite to win the title.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Serena Williams entered the United States Open as the hands-down favorite to win her fourth title here, and first since 2008. Through five matches, the Wimbledon champion and Olympic gold medalist has done nothing to change that perception.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What to Watch on Friday', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub':