 at the same time.', 'web_url': 'https://scientistatwork.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/07/gone-fishin/', 'snippet': 'An abundance of fossil tracks reveals footprints that show crocodilians and small dinosaurs inhabited the same environments at the same time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Randall Irmis, curator of paleontology at the Natural History Museum of Utah and an assistant professor at the University of Utah, is investigating the rise of dinosaurs in southeastern Utah.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gone Fishin’', 'kicker': 'Scientist at Work', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fossils', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Natural History Museum of Utah', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Utah', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-07T11:02:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By Randall Irmis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Randall', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Irmis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/830e39c2-68a5-54d6-aa2e-6f69a765936f', 'word_count': 513, 'uri': 'nyt://article/830e39c2-68a5-54d6-aa2e-6f69a765936f'}, {'abstract': 'Rimsha Masih has been detained in a high-security prison since mid-August, when Muslim neighbors accused her of burning a textbook used to teach the Koran to children.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/08/world/asia/girl-is-granted-bail-in-pakistan-blasphemy-case.html', 'snippet': 'Rimsha Masih has been detained in a high-security prison since mid-August, when Muslim neighbors accused her of burning a textbook used to teach the Koran to children.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ISLAMABAD, Pakistan —  A \xa0Christian girl accused of\xa0burning a religi