': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a80048a8-c686-518f-ab2e-0b9c7fdda0ab', 'word_count': 114, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a80048a8-c686-518f-ab2e-0b9c7fdda0ab'}, {'abstract': 'Rescue teams searched the waters off a southern Italian islet for survivors of a boat that ran into trouble a day earlier while crossing from Africa.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/08/world/europe/dozens-of-migrants-said-to-be-missing-from-boat-near-italian-coast.html', 'snippet': 'Rescue teams searched the waters off a southern Italian islet for survivors of a boat that ran into trouble a day earlier while crossing from Africa.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ROME — Rescue teams on Friday were searching the waters off a southern Italian islet for survivors of a boat loaded with migrants that apparently ran into difficulties a day earlier while crossing from Africa.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dozens of Migrants Said to Be Missing From Boat Near Italian Coast', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Italy: Dozens Missing After Migrants’ Boat Sinks', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Maritime Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Italy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-07T11:59:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabetta Povoledo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elisabetta', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Povoledo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d4584b25-1920-559c-b883-f05500b105dd', 'word_count': 313, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d4584b25-1920-559c-b883-f05500b105dd'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama’s acceptance speech on Thursday was the cautious declaration of a chastened husband who has been to couples counseling.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/08/us/politics/obamas-acceptance-speech-tries-to-save-the-marriage-tv-watch.html', 'snippet': 'President Obama’s acceptance speech on Thursday was the cautious declaration of a chastened husband who has been to couples counseling.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Obama’s acceptance speech on Thursday wasn’t a sweeping romantic overture, it was the cautious declaration of a chastened husband trying to save a troubled marriage. He doesn’t want to lose the electorate — he’s been to couples counseling, he’s learned to listen, and he knows what to say, and most of all, what not to say.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/07/us/subDEMS/subDEMS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/07/us/subDEMS/subDEMS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/07/us/subDEMS/subDEMS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/07/us/subDEMS/subDEMS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/07/us/subDEMS/subDEMS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/07/us/subDEMS/subDEMS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight'