te connection between digital media and the devices that play them was in full effect on Thursday, as the online store Amazon.com announced a range of new Kindles for reading, listening and watching. Also on Thursday, it was learned that Apple was working on adding an Internet radio service to its devices, along the lines of Pandora.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Breakfast Meeting: New Amazon Devices, and Apple’s Plans for Digital Radio', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-07T13:22:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Noam Cohen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Noam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cohen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/21a90e30-9f14-54e1-b957-495fae30f320', 'word_count': 516, 'uri': 'nyt://article/21a90e30-9f14-54e1-b957-495fae30f320'}, {'abstract': 'Scenes from the New York fashion week photo diary of Alfredo Piola.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/07/photos-of-the-moment-creatures-of-the-wind/', 'snippet': 'Scenes from the New York fashion week photo diary of Alfredo Piola.', 'lead_paragraph': 'var data;function jsonSlideshowCallback(response){data = response;}NYTD.options = {source: data,cropType: \'blog480\',appendTo: \'fullScreenSlideShow\',showHeadLine: \'false\', renderstyle: "embeddedSlideShowTmag"}', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Photos of The Moment | Creatures of the Wind', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-07T13:35:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alfredo Piola', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alfredo', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Piola', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0664f5eb-2c4d-5777-b99c-880c8f9b6760', 'word_count': 37, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0664f5eb-2c4d-5777-b99c-880c8f9b6760'}, {'abstract': 'A collection of links from the reporters and editors of the Dining section.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/07/what-were-reading-516/', 'snippet': 'A collection of links from the reporters and editors of the Dining section.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Twitter: Even Keith Richards has to eat. At least, he did in 1975. Here’s proof. — Julia Moskin', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What We’re Reading', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-07T13:41:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0f2e511f-f19d-5d92-9498-8bc631a76f2d', 'word_count': 409, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0f2e511f-f19d-5d92-9498-8bc631a76f2d'}, {'abstract': 'Cate Blanchett will star with Isabelle Huppert in a new production of “The Maids” for Sydney Theater Company before she leaves her job as co-artistic director. Her husband, Andrew Upton, will stay on alone as artistic director for another term.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/07/before-blanchett-leaves-sydney-theater-post-some-housekeeping/', 'snippet': 'Cate Blanchett will star with Isabelle Huppert in a new production of “The Maids” for Sydney Theater Company before she leaves her job as co-artistic director. Her husband, Andrew Upton, will stay on alone as artistic director for another term.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cate Blanchett will bid farewell to her role as co-artistic director of Sydney Theater Company by starring with Isabelle Huppert in a new production of “The Maids” as part of the company’s 2013 season, it was announced on Thursday. The Jean Genet play, about a pair of house servants with murderous designs on their employer, will be directed by Benedict Andrews, who previously directed Ms. Blanchett in “Gross und Klein (Big and Small)” and “The War of the Roses” for Sydney Theater Company. Its new translation is by Mr. Andrews and Andrew Upton, Ms. Blanchett’s husband and co-artistic director. At the start of the year Ms. Blanchett and Mr. Upton said they would step down from their posts at Sydney Theater Company, after presenting several internationally acclaimed productions including “A Streetcar Named Desire” (which starred Ms. Blanchett as Blanche DuBois) and “Uncle Vanya” (which featured her as Yelena). But last month the theater company said it had appointed Mr. Upton to stay on alone in a new term that begins next year.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Before Blanchett Leaves Sydney Theater Post, Some Housekeeping', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Blanchett and Huppert Play ‘The Maids’ in Sydney', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blanchett, Cate', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Huppert, Isabelle', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Minchin, Tim', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Upton, Andrew', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weaving, Hugo', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sydney Theater Co', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-07T13:45:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/89bfe2b2-68d1-5553-b354-b7d2b4540226', 'word_count': 243, 'uri': 'nyt://article/89bfe2b2-68d1-5553-b354-b7d2b4540226'}, {'abstract': 'Former Governor of Michigan, Jennifer Granholm, gives a fiery address at the Democratic National Convention.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/us/politics/100000001766065/jennifer-granholms-speech.html', 'snippet': 'Former Governor of Michigan, Jennifer Granholm, gives a fiery address at the Democratic National Convention.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Former Governor of Michigan, Jennifer Granholm, gives a fiery address at the Democratic National Convention.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/06/us/politics/video-dnc-day3-7pm-granholm/video-dnc-day3-7pm-granholm-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/06/us/politics/video-dnc-day3-7pm-granholm/video-dnc-day3-7pm-granholm-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/06/us/politics/video-dnc-day3-7pm-granholm/video-dnc-day3-7pm-granholm-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/06/us/politics/video-dnc-day3-7pm-granholm/video-dnc-day3-7pm-granholm-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': "Jennifer Granholm's Speech", 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo':