, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c34d0fd4-67d6-559b-a1e8-3d638b9d8ca1', 'word_count': 148, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c34d0fd4-67d6-559b-a1e8-3d638b9d8ca1'}, {'abstract': 'Secretary of State Hillary Rodham Clinton signed an order designating the network, responsible for some of the deadliest attacks against American troops in Afghanistan, a terrorist organization.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/08/world/asia/state-department-blacklists-militant-haqqani-network.html', 'snippet': 'Secretary of State Hillary Rodham Clinton signed an order designating the network, responsible for some of the deadliest attacks against American troops in Afghanistan, a terrorist organization.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ISLAMABAD, Pakistan — Pakistani officials reacted cautiously on Friday to news that the United States had designated the Taliban-affiliated Haqqani network as a terrorist group, allaying fears that the move could drive a fresh wedge between the two uneasy allies.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/08/world/haqqani/haqqani-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 817, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/08/world/haqqani/haqqani-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1635, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Blacklists Militant Haqqani Network', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Blacklists Militant Haqqani Network', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value