{'abstract': 'A quick rundown of what’s being offered by some space salespeople.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2012/09/09/travel/space-graphic-mckinley.html', 'snippet': 'A quick rundown of what’s being offered by some space salespeople.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A quick rundown of what’s being offered by some space salespeople.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Very, Very High Season', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Private Spaceflight', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-07T15:17:00+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/1cd2c3a2-2426-578c-8364-6a182959d7c6', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/1cd2c3a2-2426-578c-8364-6a182959d7c6'}, {'abstract': 'Officials call the facility the first specifically designed to serve commercial space companies, and they hope to draw as many as 200,000 visitors a year to see the spaceport.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/09/travel/spaceport-america-eyes-the-near-future.html', 'snippet': 'Officials call the facility the first specifically designed to serve commercial space companies, and they hope to draw as many as 200,000 visitors a year to see the spaceport.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AS you approach from the west, the Spaceport America main terminal looks like a gigantic moth, its rounded wings outspread against the arid, reddish-brown dirt of southern New Mexico.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/09/travel/09SPACE2/09SPA