ren easier. But are they best for children?', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/07/on-whether-to-use-allowance-tracking-web-sites/', 'snippet': 'Sites like Tykoon, Three Jars, FamZoo and others make tracking allowance for children easier. But are they best for children?', 'lead_paragraph': 'In this weekend’s Your Money column, I write about Tykoon, the newest of a group of Web sites and apps that help parents dole out allowances, track chores and encourage saving.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'On Whether to Use Allowance-Tracking Web Sites', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Personal Finances', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-07T17:46:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ron Lieber', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ron', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lieber', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d969f5fe-77eb-5620-9801-61aca2ca2d75', 'word_count': 163, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d969f5fe-77eb-5620-9801-61aca2ca2d75'}, {'abstract': 'Richard Chai, Futura and Supreme kicked off New York Fashion Week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/09/07/fashion/Scene-City-NYFW-906.html', 'snippet': 'Richard Chai, Futura and Supreme kicked off New York Fashion Week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Richard Chai, Futura and Supreme kicked off New York Fashion Week.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/07/fashion/Scene-City-NYFW-906-slide-TBUD/Scene-City-NYFW-906-slide-TBUD-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width':