ore Apple, Nokia had the chance to put on a bold and confident performance with its demonstration of new smartphones. Instead, a misleading promotional video has left the company looking a little desperate.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Taking the stage a week before Apple, Nokia had the chance to put on a bold and confident performance with its demonstration of new smartphones. Instead, a misleading promotional video has left the company looking a little desperate. Its underwhelming presentation and a big drop in its stock price added up to a less than stellar week for Nokia.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/05/technology/bits-nokia920/bits-nokia920-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/05/technology/bits-nokia920/bits-nokia920-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Nokia’s Misleading Video Dents Lumia’s Image', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smartphones', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nokia Oyj', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-07T18:26:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian X. Chen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': 'X.', 'lastname': 'Chen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fe045131-fe18-5165-ae8a-ddd871c1b5cc', 'word_count': 506, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fe045131-fe18-5165-ae8a-ddd871c1b5cc'}, {'abstract': 'A look at the new network series debuting this fall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2012/09/07/a