act': 'The Potomack Company auction house has listed the small pastel-colored painting as Renoir’s “Paysage Bords de Seine” and is scheduled to auction off the work on Sept. 29.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/07/a-possible-renoir-surfaces-at-a-virginia-flea-market/', 'snippet': 'The Potomack Company auction house has listed the small pastel-colored painting as Renoir’s “Paysage Bords de Seine” and is scheduled to auction off the work on Sept. 29.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Calling “Antiques Roadshow.” It was a Paul Bunyan doll that captured her eye, but the Virginia flea market buyer, who paid less than $50 for the box lot that held it, also purchased what could turn out to be a painting by the French artist Pierre-Auguste Renoir.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Possible Renoir Surfaces at a Virginia Flea Market', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-07T19:07:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patricia Cohen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patricia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cohen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6c0edaad-231d-5359-8172-510e72f2092a', 'word_count': 336, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6c0edaad-231d-5359-8172-510e72f2092a'}, {'abstract': 'The share of people who are not in the labor force but say they still want a job has generally been rising since the recession began almost five years ago.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/07/not-looking-but-still-wanting-to-work/', 'snippet': 'The share of people who are not in the labor force but say they still want a job has generally been rising since the recession began almost five years ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The number of 