s://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/12/dining/fattoush-a-middle-eastern-bread-salad-is-the-product-of-summers-labor.html', 'snippet': 'Fattoush, the Lebanese bread salad, is made with crisp toasted stale pita or other Arab flatbread; tomatoes, peppers and cucumbers; and an olive oil dressing with lots of sweet herbs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LABOR DAY is long past, but I’m not ready to say goodbye to summer, and I’m certainly not ready to give up on late-summer produce, most of which is still quite glorious. It would be a shame to fast-forward prematurely into autumn fare.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/12/dining/12KITCH/12KITCH-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/12/dining/12KITCH/12KITCH-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/12/dining/12KITCH/12KITCH-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/12/dining/12KITCH/12KITCH-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/12/dining/12KITCH/12KITCH-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/12/dining/12KITCH/12KITCH-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/12/dining