 on display this month at the Paris auto show, are bound to influence cars sold in the American market. Expect to see more daring colors.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/09/automobiles/small-cars-are-changing-will-they-fit-in-the-us.html', 'snippet': 'Trends in small-car style in Europe and Asia, which will be on display this month at the Paris auto show, are bound to influence cars sold in the American market. Expect to see more daring colors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CARS have scale; they look different depending on the background they are set against. The Smart that seemed dashing when driven around Paris by Tom Hanks may look like a recycling container in the setting of a Montana highway. ', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/09/automobiles/09mercedes-aclass/09mercedes-aclass-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/09/automobiles/09mercedes-aclass/09mercedes-aclass-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/09/automobiles/09mercedes-aclass/09mercedes-aclass-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/09/automobiles/09mercedes-aclass/09mercedes-aclass-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1361, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/09/automobiles/09mercedes-aclass/09mercedes-aclass-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard',