of-saints-in-bounty-scandal.html', 'snippet': 'The decision was a victory, for now, for the players, but it did not affect the punishments given to Saints coaches or the general manager.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Four players suspended by the N.F.L. for their roles in what the league said was a bounty program conducted by members of the New Orleans Saints had their suspensions vacated by an appeals panel Friday, allowing them to rejoin their teams and play in season openers this weekend. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/08/sports/08bounty1/08bounty1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 771, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/08/sports/08bounty1/08bounty1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1543, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/08/sports/08bounty1/08bounty1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/08/sports/08bounty1/08bounty1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/08/sports/08bounty1/08bounty1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Suspensions Vacated for Players in Bounty Case', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Suspensions Vacated for Players in Bounty Case', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Payton, Sean', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'