ers, Pre-Snap Read‘s Paul Myerberg and Robert Weintraub of Football Outsiders, \xa0get together over e-mail to discuss the \xa0biggest games and story lines around the country.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'College Letter Men Look Back and Ahead', 'kicker': 'The Quad', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'College Letter Men', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barkley, Matt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kelly, Chip', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martinez, Taylor', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Robinson, Denard', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Saban, Nick', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'East Carolina University', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Southeastern Conference', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Texas A&M University', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Alabama', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Georgia', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Michigan', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Oregon', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Southern California', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-08T00:35:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Myerberg and Robert Weintraub', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Myerberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weintraub', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bd2cd491-59b3-5ba6-aff1-da95d48446bf', 'word_count': 666, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bd2cd491-59b3-5ba6-aff1-da95d48446bf'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Hilfiger’s snappy show distracted the editors from the celebrities in attendance as models wearing suits in vibrant preppy stripes appeared on the runway.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/07/whos-that-handsome-man-at-tommy-hilfiger/', 'snippet': 'Mr. Hilfiger’s snappy show distracted the editors from the celebrities in attendance as models wearing suits in vibrant preppy stripes appeared on the runway.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sitting in the open-air cabanas at the Maritime Hotel, waiting for the Tommy Hilfiger men’s show to start Friday afternoon, several editors kept an eye on the seats reserved for celebrities. There was a very tall, handsome man, clearly someone famous, wearing a navy suit and blue shirt, but no one could quite put a finger on his name.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Who’s That Handsome Man at Tommy Hilfiger?', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits (Apparel)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Adrian, Nathan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hilfiger, Tommy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-08T00:38:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Wilson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wilson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_materia