nt. Then she replaces the bandage above her left knee. Her bullet wound. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/07/18/multimedia/author-michael-wilson/author-michael-wilson-articleLarge.png', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/07/18/multimedia/author-michael-wilson/author-michael-wilson-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/07/18/multimedia/author-michael-wilson/author-michael-wilson-jumbo.png', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/07/18/multimedia/author-michael-wilson/author-michael-wilson-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/07/18/multimedia/author-michael-wilson/author-michael-wilson-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/07/18/multimedia/author-michael-wilson/author-michael-wilson-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/07/18/multimedia/author-michael-wilson/author-michael-wilson-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Bullet Didn’t Leave the Only Scar', 'kicker': 'Crime Scene', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Bullet Didn’t Leave The Only Scar', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Empire State Building (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-08T00:45:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Wilson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wilson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/21f328bb-574a-5e41-ab46-39f74e153667', 'word_count': 797, 'uri': 'nyt://article/21f328bb-574a-5e41-ab46-39f74e153667'}, {'abstract': 'The police said that as Reynaldo Cuevas, 20, fled a robbery in progress at the bodega where he worked in the Bronx, he was accidentally and fatally shot when he collided with an officer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/08/nyregion/police-bullet-kills-bronx-bodega-worker-fleeing-robbery.html', 'snippet': 'The police said that as Reynaldo Cuevas, 20, fled a robbery in progress at the bodega where he worked in the Bronx, he was accidentally and fatally shot when he collided with an officer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the early hush of Friday morning, the manager and his young employee had finished another long shift, shuttered their Bronx bodega and headed home. But the young assistant had forgotten to grab a bar of soap that he needed. They went back, and when they unlocked the door, the thing so feared by those who work in neighborhoods contaminated by crime followed them in.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/08/nyregion/BODEGA1/BODEGA1-articleLar