d.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the world of health care, Nintendo Wii golf is more than a high-tech toy. The video game has become a tool in physical, occupational and neurological rehabilitation.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Physical Therapists Turn to Wii Golf', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Therapists Say Patients&#8217; Balance and Motion Improve With Help of Wii Golf', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Therapy and Rehabilitation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wii (Video Game System)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Physical Therapy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computer and Video Games', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-08T22:11:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lisa D. Mickey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lisa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c53e136b-95ad-5300-88d3-eef9feb08547', 'word_count': 882, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c53e136b-95ad-5300-88d3-eef9feb08547'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Bygraves’s easy singing and humor — a signature phrase was “I wanna tell you a story” — led to a long career of radio and stage shows, music and films.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/09/arts/music/max-bygraves-jovial-british-entertainer-is-dead-at-89.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Bygraves’s easy singing and humor — a signature phrase was “I wanna tell you a story” — led to a long career of radio and stage shows, music and films.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Max Bygraves, whose smart-alecky humor, Cockney charm and myriad renditions of