', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2ef8c8f4-b152-5d2c-9b99-e5bc917a4231', 'word_count': 827, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2ef8c8f4-b152-5d2c-9b99-e5bc917a4231'}, {'abstract': 'Andy Murray defeated Tomas Berdych in four sets, but severe weather conditions caused the day’s other two big matches — the second men’s semifinal and the women’s final — to be postponed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/09/sports/tennis/andy-murray-advances-to-us-open-final-amid-weather-delays.html', 'snippet': 'Andy Murray defeated Tomas Berdych in four sets, but severe weather conditions caused the day’s other two big matches — the second men’s semifinal and the women’s final — to be postponed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Super Saturday at the United States Open, weather dominated instead of Serena Williams. This included torrential downpours, wind gusts so powerful they picked up chairs, a postponed women’s final, a postponed men’s semifinal and even an evacuation for an impending tornado.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/09/sports/men1/men1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/09/sports/men1/men1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/09/sports/men1/men1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 877, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/