d_paragraph': 'Mitt Romney, in an appearance on “Meet the Press” to be aired on Sunday morning, praised former President Bill Clinton’s speech at the Democratic National Convention, suggesting that his performance outshone President Obama’s speech accepting his party’s renomination. He also criticized Mr. Obama and Congressional Republicans for agreeing to automatic cuts in defense spending as a way to force a deal on deficit reduction, in a process called sequestration.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Romney to Appear on ‘Meet the Press’', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Democratic National Convention', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Bill', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Defense Department', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-09T02:58:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Parker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc6faa08-de07-5036-ac1b-a2399754fd21', 'word_count': 261, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc6faa08-de07-5036-ac1b-a2399754fd21'}, {'abstract': 'Like a number of designers this season, Mr. Altuzarra has taken a fancy to pencil-striped cotton, men’s shirting and work wear classics like a railroad engineer’s jacket. And like other designers, he is interested in lightness.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/08/altuzarra-stoking-the-engine/', 'snippet': 'Like a number of designers this season, Mr. Altuzarra has taken a fancy to pencil-striped cotton, men’s shirting and work wear classics like a railroad engineer’s jacket. And like other designers, he is interested in lightness.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Before the start of Joseph Altuzarra’s show, at Industria Superstudio, the buzz was all about the front row — Kate Bosworth, Mamie Gummer, Jessica Chastain and Tyson Chandler, the Knicks center, who hit several shows on Saturday. But within minutes, attention shifted to the clothes — and the fantastically loopy boots — as editors began raving on Twitter. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Altuzarra: Stoking the Engine', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Fashion Week', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Altuzarra, Joseph', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-09T03:04:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cathy Horyn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cathy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Horyn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e364d3ed-0723-50d2-b382-165e1a8da1cd', 'word_count': 327, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e364d3ed-0723-50d2-b382-165e1a8da1cd'}, {'abstract': 'New York', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/09/08/fashion/runway-womens/monique-lhuillier-spring-2013-rtw.html', 'snippet': 'New York', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/201