l live blog the men’s semifinal match between David Ferrer and Novak Djokovic at the United States Open.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Defending champion Novak Djokovic of Serbia has advanced to his third consecutive United States Open final with a 2-6, 6-1, 6-4, 6-2 win over David Ferrer of Spain. Djokovic, the No. 2 seed, will play No. 3 Andy Murray of Great Britain in the Monday final, which will begin at 4 p.m. E.S.T.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Djokovic Defeats Ferrer to Advance to Final', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Azarenka, Victoria', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Djokovic, Novak', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ferrer, David', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Serena', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-09T14:49:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Rothenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rothenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a3dcc5e1-9cc6-5783-8381-4e1c8e2d0704', 'word_count': 1738, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a3dcc5e1-9cc6-5783-8381-4e1c8e2d0704'}, {'abstract': 'The Federal Aviation Administration has agreed to study the safety of portable electronics usage on planes during takeoff and landing. Allowing reading devices during those times is gaining the support of the devices makers, airlines and others.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/09/teaching-the-f-a-a-that-dogs-dont-buckle-up/', 'snippet': 'The Federal Aviation Administration has agreed to study the safety of portable electronics usage on planes during takeoff and landing. Allowing reading devices during those times is gaining the support of the devices makers, airlines and others.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you’ve ever flown Virgin America, you will have seen the cartoonlike safety video that plays before the flight takes off.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/10/business/10disrupt-pic/10disrupt-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 693, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/10/business/10disrupt-pic/10disrupt-pic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1386, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/10/business/10disrupt-pic/10disrupt-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/10/business/10disrupt-pic/10disrupt-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/10/business/10disrupt-pic/10disrupt-pic-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Teaching the F.A.A. That Dogs Don’t Buckle Up', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Teaching the F.A.A. Dogs Don’t Buckle Up', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electronics', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'