 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/10/health/research/for-a-lung-cancer-drug-treatment-may-be-within-reach.html', 'snippet': 'Research on a common lung cancer could foretell a type of treatment in which drugs — many of which are in the pipeline already — are chosen to match the genetic mutation in each patient.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The first large and comprehensive study of the genetics of a common lung cancer has found that more than half the tumors from that cancer have mutations that might be treated by new drugs that are already in the pipeline or that could be easily developed.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/10/us/LUNG/LUNG-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/10/us/LUNG/LUNG-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/10/us/LUNG/LUNG-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 724, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/10/us/LUNG/LUNG-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1448, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cancer Study Points to Tighter Pairing of Drugs and Patients', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Study of Lung Cancer’s Genetics Suggests a More Tailored Treatment', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cancer Genome Atlas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Institutes of Health', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lung Cancer', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name':