fter-reinjuring-calf/', 'snippet': 'Mark Teixeira was not in the lineup for Sunday’s series finale against the Baltimore Orioles, and he probably will not play in the three-game series against the Boston Red Sox this week, either.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BALTIMORE — Mark Teixeira was not in the lineup for Sunday’s series finale against the Baltimore Orioles, and he probably will not play in the three-game series against the Boston Red Sox this week, either. Beyond that, there is no telling when he will return.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Teixeira Out Indefinitely After Reinjuring Calf', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Teixeira, Mark', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-09T18:56:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f4b7d0fa-2b30-515b-934b-f6ca22710254', 'word_count': 272, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f4b7d0fa-2b30-515b-934b-f6ca22710254'}, {'abstract': 'New York', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/09/09/fashion/runway-womens/derek-lam-spring-2013-rtw.html', 'snippet': 'New York', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/09/fashion/runway-womens/dereklam_spring13app-slide-CLAD/dereklam_spring13app-slide-CLAD-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 60