 back at political opponents who mocked his latest stunt: flying a motorized glider to help lead endangered cranes from Siberia on their migration south.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/10/world/10russia1_span/10russia1_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/10/world/10russia1_span/10russia1_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/10/world/10russia1_span/10russia1_span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/10/world/10russia1_span/10russia1_span-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1356, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/10/world/10russia1_span/10russia1_span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/10/world/10russia1_span/10russia1_span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/10/world/10russia1_span/10russia1_span-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Putin, a Flight of Fancy at a Summit Meeting’s Close', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Putin, a Flight of Fancy at a Summit Meeting’s Close', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Vladivostok (Russia)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Putin, Vladimir V', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-09T20:46:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By David M. Herszenhorn and Steven Lee Myers', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a268de27-1fa1-554d-a07c-9253c7ec5003', 'word_count': 1177, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a268de27-1fa1-554d-a07c-9253c7ec5003'}, {'abstract': 'One night in 1928, when he was topping the bill at the Earl Carroll Theater on Seventh Avenue, W.C. Fields was hauled before a judge after his show and charged with torturing a canary.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/09/before-chickadee-fame-fields-had-canary-trouble/', 'snippet': 'One night in 1928, when he was topping the bill at the Earl Carroll Theater on Seventh Avenue, W.C. Fields was hauled before a judge after his show and charged with torturing a canary.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The scene unfolded like something out of one of W.C. Fields’ movies. A quick-handed, wisecracking entertainer wowed a packed house, only to find himself grabbed by two police officers after the show, paraded before the flashbulbs,\xa0and hauled before a judge, where he was charged with torturing a canary.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia'