rs of my life.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/education/envpls13-will/envpls13-will-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 597, 'width': 670, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/education/envpls13-will/envpls13-will-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 597, 'width': 670, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/education/envpls13-will/envpls13-will-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/03/education/envpls13-will/envpls13-will-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/education/envpls13-will/envpls13-will-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Never Cured Cancer or Built a Spaceship, But Trying to Capture a University’s Attention', 'kicker': 'The Choice', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADMISSIONS STANDARDS', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cleveland (Ohio)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-10T10:01:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Will Walker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Will', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Walker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6d7f1f71-dfe8-5425-8025-653e1c95da0f', 'word_count': 668, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6d7f1f71-dfe8-5425-8025-653e1c95da0f'}, {'abstract': 'The British police on Monday evacuated an area around the home of a British-Iraqi family targeted in last week’s killing in the French Alps.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/11/world/europe/british-police-evacuate-area-around-home-of-alps-murder-victims.html', 'snippet': 'The British police on Monday evacuated an area around the home of a British-Iraqi family targeted in last week’s killing in the French Alps.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CLAYGATE, England — In a further twist to a story of murder and mystery that has seized headlines for days in France and Britain, the British police summoned an army bomb squad on Monday to search a work shed at the home of a British-Iraqi family targeted in last week’s killing in the French Alps. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'British Bomb Squad Visits Home of Murder Victims', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'British Bomb Squad Visits Home of Murder Victims', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Evacuations and Evacuees', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'French Alps', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bombs and Explosives', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-10T10:24:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sandy Macaskill and John F. Burns', 'person': [{'