h’s New Jersey comic-book shop. But the day unfolded differently than he expected.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/10/stan-lee-still-a-true-believer-spends-a-day-on-amcs-comic-book-men/', 'snippet': 'Stan Lee, the venerated Marvel Comics writer and editor, thought he was making a quick cameo on the reality series set at Kevin Smith’s New Jersey comic-book shop. But the day unfolded differently than he expected.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RED BANK, N.J. – Friday seemed like a special morning in the life of Jack Davis, a towheaded boy who had been granted entry to Jay and Silent Bob’s Secret Stash, a comic-book store here. Though a familiar sign in the window said “I Assure You We’re Open,” the shop was in fact closed for a taping of “Comic Book Men,” the AMC reality series about its proprietors.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Stan Lee, Still a True Believer, Spends a Day on AMC’s ‘Comic Book Men’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Visit From a Real, Live Comic Book Hero', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Comic Books and Strips', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lee, Stan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Marvel Comics', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Red Bank (NJ)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-10T12:32:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/78eed230-25dd-5d33-926d-f229da2cb59e', 'word_count': 1025, 'uri': 'nyt://article/78eed230-25dd-5d33-926d-f229da2cb59e'}, {'abstract': '