tical-royalty-celebrates-a-birthday/', 'snippet': 'The Hell’s Kitchen Democratic club still evokes the Tammany Hall era, and an annual gathering honoring James McManus, its fourth-generation leader, drew a crowd.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It had the feel of a nominating convention, or an Election Day victory party. The big-name Manhattan politicians were there, and so were hundreds of rank-and-file voters. Hundreds of balloons lined the ceiling, the food and drink were free, and a jazz combo belted out “Happy Days Are Here Again.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Member of Manhattan Political Royalty Celebrates a Birthday', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Organizations, Societies and Clubs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McManus, Jim', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tammany Hall', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': "Hell's Kitchen (NYC)", 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-10T19:11:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Corey Kilgannon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Corey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kilgannon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/869bd39b-0ce6-58ef-8a9a-ab50144fe652', 'word_count': 784, 'uri': 'nyt://article/869bd39b-0ce6-58ef-8a9a-ab50144fe652'}, {'abstract': 'Ask about ways to avoid default, pay off student loans or try to expunge student loans through bankruptcy court.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/10/ask-about-navigating-student-debt/', 'snippet': 'Ask about ways to avoid default, pay off student loans or try to ex