'', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8955a3f8-45a7-5c55-9740-140c9525f64d', 'word_count': 263, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8955a3f8-45a7-5c55-9740-140c9525f64d'}, {'abstract': 'A dispute over a strike clause is holding up an agreement.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/10/stagehands-and-merkin-concert-hall-wrangle-over-contract/', 'snippet': 'A dispute over a strike clause is holding up an agreement.', 'lead_paragraph': ' The stagehands union and Merkin Concert Hall are close to sealing their first contract, but a dispute over the language in a strike clause has kept the two sides apart. The union, Local One of the International Alliance of Theatrical Stage Employees, said it would set up picket lines and inflatable rats on Tuesday and Wednesday mornings. Merkin has already begun paying stagehands at the higher negotiated rates and put in place new work rules. But a final agreement remains elusive after nearly a year of negotiations.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Stagehands and Merkin Concert Hall Wrangle Over Contract', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Strikes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Alliance of Theatrical Stage Employees', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Merkin Concert Hall', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-10T19:32:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daniel J. Wakin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniel', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Wakin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b99b1815-83cd-5f96-b5dd-1b7cd33e73a0', 'word_count': 325, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b99b1815-83cd-5f96-b5dd-1b7cd33e73a0'}, {'abstract': 'A combination of disorders that increases the risk of cardiovascular disease and diabetes and is associated with cognitive deficiencies in adults now shows a similar effect in teenagers.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/10/metabolic-syndrome-and-the-teenage-brain/', 'snippet': 'A combination of disorders that increases the risk of cardiovascular disease and diabetes and is associated with cognitive deficiencies in adults now shows a similar effect in teenagers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Metabolic syndrome, the combination of disorders that increases the risk of cardiovascular disease and diabetes, is known to be associated with brain changes and cognitive deficiencies in adults. Now a new study, published online in Pediatrics, has found a similar effect in teenagers with the disorder.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/05/21/health/well_patterns/well_patterns-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 214, 'width': 215, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/05/21/health/well_patterns/well_patterns-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 214, 'width': 215, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/05/21/health/well_patterns/well_patterns-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/05/21/health/well_patterns/well_patterns-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/05/21/health/well_patterns/well_