e that Robert Sietsema may be behind the anonymous Twitter account, the Village Voice food critic continued to deny the rumor.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/10/ruth-bourdain-remains-at-large/', 'snippet': 'Despite fresh evidence that Robert Sietsema may be behind the anonymous Twitter account, the Village Voice food critic continued to deny the rumor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No, really, Robert Sietsema, a restaurant critic for The Village Voice since 1993, wants everyone to know, flat out and categorically, that he is not Ruth Bourdain. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ruth Bourdain Remains at Large', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-10T20:31:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Glenn Collins', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Glenn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Collins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7ffe234d-cef5-5632-b8bd-b4b6792ded77', 'word_count': 291, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7ffe234d-cef5-5632-b8bd-b4b6792ded77'}, {'abstract': 'New York', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/09/10/fashion/runway-womens/donna-karan-spring-2013-rtw.html', 'snippet': 'New York', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/10/fashion/runway-womens/donnakaran_spring13app-slide-LG9B/donnakaran_spring13app-slide-LG9B-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/10/fashion/runway-womens/donnakaran_spring13app-slide-LG9B/donnakaran_spring13app-slide-LG9B-article