rchill-heads-to-auction/', 'snippet': 'The 1954 Series I Land Rover was used on Churchill’s 300-acre estate, according to the consignor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the eternal question of what to purchase a prime minister on the occasion of his 80th birthday, Winston Churchill might have offered this counsel: a customized 1954 Series I Land Rover. The proto-S.U.V., said to have chauffeured Churchill around his estate in his later years, is scheduled to hit the auction block on Oct. 20 in Sutton, near Cambridge, England.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Land Rover That Ferried Winston Churchill Heads to Auction', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Collectors and Collections', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Churchill, Winston Leonard Spencer', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Land Rover', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'England', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-10T21:39:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Azadeh Ensha', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Azadeh', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ensha', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c6552cc3-8c57-5d72-8243-7b8df718f9b2', 'word_count': 257, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c6552cc3-8c57-5d72-8243-7b8df718f9b2'}, {'abstract': 'John C. Liu and a top aide, Mei-Hua Ru, were targets of electronic surveillance by the government over 18 months in 2010 and 2011.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/11/nyregion/us-authorities-began-wiretapping-new-york-city-comptroller-in-2010.html', 'snippet': 'John C. Liu and a top aide