Bomb Girls,” a Canadian series set in 1942, delves into the dramas behind Rosie the Riveter’s world.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/11/arts/television/bomb-girls-canadian-series-has-debut-on-reelzchannel.html', 'snippet': '“Bomb Girls,” a Canadian series set in 1942, delves into the dramas behind Rosie the Riveter’s world.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Bomb Girls” has a serviceable premise: a group of women bond while working at a Canadian munitions factory in the early years of World War II. It promises emotion and uplift along the lines of “The Life and Times of Rosie the Riveter” or “Swing Shift,” but with the added suspense of wondering whether everyone is going to be blown to smithereens.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/11/arts/BOMB/BOMB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/11/arts/BOMB/BOMB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/11/arts/BOMB/BOMB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 718, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/11/arts/BOMB/BOMB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1437, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/11/arts/BOMB/BOMB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/11/arts/BOMB/BOMB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'capti