al involving Assemblyman Vito J. Lopez, asked people to take a deep breath before criticizing the state panel already investigating it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/11/nyregion/cuomo-says-hes-open-to-tweaks-in-ethics-panel.html', 'snippet': 'Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo, who threatened a new inquiry into the scandal involving Assemblyman Vito J. Lopez, asked people to take a deep breath before criticizing the state panel already investigating it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALBANY — Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo said Monday that he would be open to seeking changes in one of the signature achievements of his time as governor, a new state ethics commission, as a former member of the panel warned of “possible illegality and corruption” and other commissioners worried that the body was losing its credibility.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Cuomo Is Open to ‘Tweaks’ in Ethics Panel', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cuomo Is Open to ‘Tweaks’ in Ethics Panel', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lopez, Vito J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Batra, Ravi', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Joint Commission on Public Ethics (NYS)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Silver, Sheldon', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-11T01:17:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas Kaplan and Danny Hakim', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaplan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Danny', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hakim'