bstract': 'With Marc Jacobs’s new collection, for the first time in a while, a designer has successfully pushed the sex button in a compelling way.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/10/marc-jacobs-sex-talk-in-a-straight-package/', 'snippet': 'With Marc Jacobs’s new collection, for the first time in a while, a designer has successfully pushed the sex button in a compelling way.', 'lead_paragraph': '“There’s nothing sexier than a girl covered up,” Marc Jacobs said on Monday night after his spring show, which featured a spree of suits with below-the-knee skirts worn low on the hips, leaving a vast expanse of midriff. Many of these outfits came in wide vertical stripes — black, maroon, taupe — with matching purses and dippy little shoes with low heels. Conventional office attire. The models’ hair was ratted at the crown and pulled into a low ponytail. Their eyebrows were penciled thick, and they wore an insolent pout. The music was from The Fall, the British post-punk band.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Marc Jacobs: Sex Talk in a Straight Package', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Fashion Week', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jacobs, Marc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-11T03:30:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cathy Horyn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cathy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Horyn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e57f7fa7-c187-57fa-b7e6-bbc98879828d', 'word_count': 344, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e57f7fa7-c187-57fa-b7e6-bbc98879828d'}, {'abstract': 'Forming a wall of players in front of the goal remains a common but imperfect way to defend free kicks, as the United States learned in its World Cup qualifier loss to Jamaica.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/11/sports/soccer/soccers-not-so-great-wall-to-defend-free-kicks.html', 'snippet': 'Forming a wall of players in front of the goal remains a common but imperfect way to defend free kicks, as the United States learned in its World Cup qualifier loss to Jamaica.', 'lead_paragraph': 'COLUMBUS, Ohio — It happens in soccer matches everywhere, from park games in front of soccer moms to packed-stadium internationals before flag-waving fans: a player is fouled not far from goal, the referee’s whistle blows and suddenly, a cluster of defenders jam together to form a human wall, as if attached at the shoulder by Velcro. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/11/sports/YJPSOCCER/YJPSOCCER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/11/sports/YJPSOCCER/YJPSOCCER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/11/sports/YJPSOCCER/YJPSOCCER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/11/sports/YJPSOCCER/YJPSOCCER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1370, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/11/sports/YJPSOCCER/YJPSOCCER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'cr