ours to Victory', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Djokovic, Novak', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Murray, Andy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-11T04:07:07+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/66064130-7bb4-5b98-a36c-aeb907621009', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/66064130-7bb4-5b98-a36c-aeb907621009'}, {'abstract': 'Alex Zanardi, a former IndyCar racer who lost his legs in a crash in Germany in 2001, won two handcycling gold medals at the Paralympic Games, which ended Sunday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/11/sports/olympics/for-handcyclist-paralympics-are-stirring-triumph.html', 'snippet': 'Alex Zanardi, a former IndyCar racer who lost his legs in a crash in Germany in 2001, won two handcycling gold medals at the Paralympic Games, which ended Sunday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRANDS HATCH, England — He averaged just a fraction under 20 miles per hour for the two-hour handcycle road race, and he reached a maximum speed, running downhill, of 46 m.p.h. He did it on this track famous for the Grand Prix races run here in the years before he became a marquee name in Formula One and IndyCar racing.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/11/sports/PARALYMPICS-FLOATER/PARALYMPICS-FLOATER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/11/sports/PARALYMPICS-FLOATER/PARALYMPICS-FLOATER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/11/sports/PARALYMPICS-FLOATER/PARALYMPICS-FLOATER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/11/sports/PARALYMPICS-FLOATER/PARALYMPICS-FLOATER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Handcyclist, Paralympics Are a Stirring Triumph', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zanardi, Alex', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paralympic Games', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traffic Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Racing', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-11T05:06:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Olympics', 'byline': {'original': 'By John F. Burns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': 'F.', 'lastname': 'Burns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/33bb41d5-1d35-58a7-991f-43109840ee4d', 'word_count': 1303, 'uri': 'nyt://article/33bb41d5-1d35-58a7-991f-43109840ee4d'}, {'abstract': 'In his five-set win over Novak Djokovic, Andy Murray had myriad foes to defeat in this final, most significantly the expectations put upon him in Britain.', 'web_url': 'https://straightsets.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/11/murray-battling-more-than-djokovic-clears-all-obstacles/', 'snippet': 'In his five-set win over Novak Djokovic, Andy Murray had myriad foes to defeat in this final, most significantly the expectations put upon him in Britain.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Shakespeare’s quote “Sweet are the uses of adversity” is what came to mind as I watched Andy Murray triumph over his longtime nemesis Novak Djokovic in five grueling sets to win the United States Open, his first Grand Slam, and the first for a British man since Fred Perry in 1936. Murray had myriad foes to defeat in this final, most significantly the expectations put upon him in Britain, where his every match is an indicator of national well-being. This victory comes on the heels of his breakthrough win over Roger Federer on Centre Court at Wimbledon in the gold medal match of the London Olympics.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Murray, Battling More Than Djokovic, Clears All Obstacles', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Djokovic, Novak', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Murray, Andy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-11T05:09:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Geoff Macdonald', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Geoff', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Macdonald', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d39caad0-4a80-5fdf-93eb-6f810b20464e', 'word_count': 865, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d39caad0-4a80-5fdf-93eb-6f810b20464e'}, {'abstract': 'See what you know about the news of the day.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/11/news-quiz-september-11-2012/', 'snippet': 'See what you know about the news of the day.', 'lead_paragraph': 'See what you know about the news below. To prepare, you might scan the articles or summaries on today’s paper. Good luck!', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'News Quiz | September 11, 2012', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-11T06:00:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anastasia Economides', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anastasia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Economides', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a9904b26-53cb-53e0-9d48-275a5552ccfc', 'word_count': 22, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a9904b26-53cb-53e0-9d48-275a5552ccfc'}, {'abstract': 'We’re turning 125 and we want you to be a part of the celebration by telling us about your IHT moments or sharing a picture of you and your IHT — past or present.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/11/show-us-your-iht/', 'snippet': 'We’re turning 125 and we want you to be a part of the celebration by telling us about your IHT moments or sharing a picture of you and your IHT — past or present.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The International Herald Tribune will celebrate its 125th anniversary in October and we’d love for you to be a part of the party.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/07/blogs/ihtrdv-clooney-125post/ihtrdv-clooney-125post-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 660, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/07/blogs/ihtrdv-cloon