 continue to remember the anniversary of Sept. 11?', 'web_url': 'https://publiceditor.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/11/how-to-cover-the-11th-anniversary-of-911/', 'snippet': 'The pain continues, but the journalism comes to an end. How does The Times continue to remember the anniversary of Sept. 11?', 'lead_paragraph': 'The pain, the outrage, the loss – these never fade. The amount of journalism, however, must. This is the 11th anniversary of Sept. 11, 2001 – that infamous date in the history of New York, the nation and the world. Last year, on the 10th anniversary, The Times produced a huge special treatment – an elaborate Web presence and an ambitious special section, along with major stories on the days leading up to the anniversary.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How to Cover the 11th Anniversary of 9/11?', 'kicker': 'The Public Editor&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'September 11 (2001)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ryan, Carolyn', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-11T12:00:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Margaret Sullivan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Margaret', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sullivan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6c4ca03d-dd70-5404-9c4b-97bf9561c2b9', 'word_count': 781, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6c4ca03d-dd70-5404-9c4b-97bf9561c2b9'}, {'abstract': 'The designer Umit Benan Sahin describes a few of his favorite spots in the city by the Bosporus.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012