entless pursuit of details of the Kennedy assassination to the fictional hunt for a white whale.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/12/us/gaeton-fonzi-76-investigated-kennedy-assassination.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Fonzi was called Ahab by colleagues who likened his relentless pursuit of details of the Kennedy assassination to the fictional hunt for a white whale.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gaeton Fonzi was one of the most relentless investigators on the House Select Committee on Assassinations in the late 1970s, remembered by former colleagues with both awe and echoes of the impatience he inspired with his pursuit of the full story behind the assassination of President John F. Kennedy. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/12/sports/fonzi1/fonzi1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 815, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/12/sports/fonzi1/fonzi1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1629, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/12/sports/fonzi1/fonzi1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/12/sports/fonzi1/fonzi1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/12/sports/fonzi1/fonzi1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Gaeton Fonzi, Investigator of Kennedy Assassination, Dies at 76', 'kicker': None, 'content_k