 still looks compelling.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/11/tory-burchs-slice-of-american-pie/', 'snippet': 'For spring, Tory Burch went for a “prep remix,” which meant pulling disparate ideas together in a way that still looks compelling.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good news, shoppers: This has been a great season for daywear, the category most often overlooked by designers of runway fashion. In fact, it’s been such a commercial-friendly spring season in New York that even Marc Jacobs is making what could be described as somewhat office-friendly attire. Of course, that is Tory Burch’s forte, and it was clear at her show this morning that she’s not about to give up any ground.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tory Burch’s Slice of American Pie', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Fashion Week', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Burch, Tory', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-11T16:43:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Wilson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wilson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d6a1b343-cd52-5c16-a3ac-21149e580195', 'word_count': 163, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d6a1b343-cd52-5c16-a3ac-21149e580195'}, {'abstract': 'The short list for the prize, the most significant literary award in Britain, includes Hilary Mantel and Will Self.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/11/six-finalists-for-man-booker-prize-are-named/', 'snippet': 'The short list for the prize, the most significant literary award in Britain, includes Hilary Mantel and Will Self.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Six authors were named on Tuesday to the annual shortlist of candidates for the Man Booker Prize for Fiction, the most significant literary award in Britain.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Six Finalists for Man Booker Prize Are Named', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hilary Mantel and Will Self Among Six on Booker Prize Fiction Shortlist', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Man Booker Prize', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Levy, Deborah', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mantel, Hilary', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Moore, Alison', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Self, Will', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tan Twan Eng', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thayil, Jeet', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-11T16:43:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Bosman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bosman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/82839fe3-8415-5913-bdbf-060acc25c035', 'word_count': 139, 'uri': 'nyt://article/82839fe3-8415-5913-bdbf-060acc25c035'}, {'abstract': 'GoDaddy, the Web services company, said that its extensive technical problems on Monday were a result of internal issues, not an attack by a supporter of Anonymous, the loose confederation of rogue hackers.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/11/godaddy-denies-