3-e6f5-52fb-ac73-fee50283000c'}, {'abstract': 'The Ford Motor Company’s board will meet this week to consider possible succession plans for the company’s chief executive, Alan R. Mulally.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/12/business/ford-considers-succession-plans-for-chief-executive.html', 'snippet': 'The Ford Motor Company’s board will meet this week to consider possible succession plans for the company’s chief executive, Alan R. Mulally.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DETROIT — The Ford Motor Company’s board will meet this week to consider possible succession plans for the company’s chief executive, Alan R. Mulally, a person with knowledge of the meeting said on Tuesday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Refining Succession Plans, Ford May Name a New No. 2', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Refining Succession Plans, Ford May Name a New No. 2', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boards of Directors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fields, Mark', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ford Motor Company', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mulally, Alan R', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-12T00:31:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Vlasic', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vlasic', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2c584261-7e8f-59ec-9858-685452ee8a1f', 'word_count': 533, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2c584261-7e8f-59ec-9858-685452ee8a1f'}, {'abstract': 'The East River Ferry service is in the second year of a $9 million subsidies contract with New York City, but questions remain about its chances for profitability.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/12/nyregion/east-river-ferry-service-hopes-lovely-commute-brings-it-self-reliance.html', 'snippet': 'The East River Ferry service is in the second year of a $9 million subsidies contract with New York City, but questions remain about its chances for profitability.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Titania Inglis, a 33-year-old fashion designer who wears her own flouncy avant-garde creations, likes to take the East River Ferry from Greenpoint, Brooklyn, where she keeps her work samples, to the East 34th Street slip in Manhattan and then bicycle to the garment center. Indeed, Ms. Inglis, who lives in Williamsburg, Brooklyn, can wax rhapsodic about the pleasures of sailing on a swift tidal river glistening with sunlight.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/12/nyregion/FERRY1/FERRY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 271, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/12/nyregion/FERRY1/FERRY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 271}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/12/nyregion/FERRY1/FERRY1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 523, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/12/nyregion/FERRY1/FERRY1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1046, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/12/n