0e'}, {'abstract': 'A group of activists who set off a confrontation between China and Japan by sailing to disputed islands last month said Wednesday that a return trip was complicated by legal and financial barriers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/13/world/asia/activists-face-barriers-in-return-to-disputed-islands.html', 'snippet': 'A group of activists who set off a confrontation between China and Japan by sailing to disputed islands last month said Wednesday that a return trip was complicated by legal and financial barriers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — Ending the immediate likelihood that they would repeat their visit to disputed islands last month and worsen a confrontation between China and Japan, a group of activists revealed Wednesday that their vessel was not seaworthy enough for a return to the islands and that they faced legal and financial barriers to fixing it.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hong Kong Impedes Trip to Islands, Activists Say', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hong Kong Impedes Trip To Islands, Activists Say', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Japan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Senkaku Islands', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'East China Sea', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Action Committee for Defending the Diaoyu Islands', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-12T09:44:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Keith Bradsher', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Keith', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bradsher', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 