passenger aircraft, says it is in merger talks with its British rival, BAE Systems.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/09/12/bae-systems-and-eads-say-they-are-in-merger-talks/', 'snippet': 'The aerospace giant EADS, which manufactures Airbus passenger aircraft, says it is in merger talks with its British rival, BAE Systems.', 'lead_paragraph': '8:28 p.m. | Updated ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'BAE Systems and EADS Say They Are in Merger Talks', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Europe’s Air and Military Companies in Merger Talks', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Aeronautic Defense and Space Co', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-12T16:13:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicola Clark', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicola', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Clark', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3755a2b0-38b4-537f-934f-91f39d8934f8', 'word_count': 793, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3755a2b0-38b4-537f-934f-91f39d8934f8'}, {'abstract': 'Programs for your smartphone can recreate favorite computer games from your childhood, apply nostalgic effects to your photos and even turn your MP3 collection into a virtual stack of vinyl records.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/13/technology/personaltech/apps-that-recall-a-time-before-there-were-apps.html', 'snippet': 'Programs for your smartphone can recreate favorite computer games from your childhood, apply nostalgic effects to your photos and even turn your MP3 collection into a virtual stack of vinyl records.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Haven’t we all at some time been struck by such an overwhelming sense of nostalgia that we wished we could take a time machine to a moment in our past? Perhaps it’s a scent that reminds us of previous romances, or as we get older, the sights and sounds that take us back to a childhood time when everything was simpler.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/13/business/13SMART1/13SMART1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 788, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/13/business/13SMART1/13SMART1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1575, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/13/business/13SMART1/13SMART1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/13/business/13SMART1/13SMART1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/13/business/13SMART1/13SMART1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Apps That Recall a Time Before There Were Apps', 'kicker': 'App Smart', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Apps That Recall a Time Before There Were Apps', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-12T16:15:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kit Eaton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kit', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eaton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7b70f71a-5473-533d-8b31-28c226dd57e2', 'word_count': 847, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7b70f71a-5473-533d-8b31-28c226dd57e2'}, {'abstract': 'A New Yorker moves to Texas and learns to barbecue pork ribs, but he doesn’t forget his beloved Giants.', 'web_url': 'https://thequad.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/12/tailgating-recipes-holy-smoke-ribs/', 'snippet': 'A New Yorker moves to Texas and learns to barbecue pork ribs, but he doesn’t forget his beloved Giants.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We could open tailgating season with a gentle dip or some basic nachos, but much in the same way the college football season had Alabama-Michigan and the N.F.L. season had Cowboys-Giants on the opening schedule, we thought we would give you something meatier. Enter Ricardo Vera’s ribs. Vera tends to use pork spare ribs but said the recipe could be used with baby back ribs or even pork butt or shoulder.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/11/sports/ncaafootball/2012tailgating-pic1/2012tailgating-pic1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 542, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/11/sports/ncaafootball/2012tailgating-pic1/2012tailgating-pic1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 542, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/11/sports/ncaafootball/2012tailgating-pi