 confrontation with her attacker about a week and half ago, when she took a photograph of him masturbating in the park.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated, 4:48 p.m. Thursday | A 42-year-old drifter with a long prison record, David Albert Mitchell, was arrested Sept. 13 for the daylight rape and beating of a 73-year-old woman in Central Park the day before, the police said. Read the full article about Mr. Mitchell and his arrest here. Below is the original Sept. 12 article about the attack.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Woman, 73, Raped in Central Park in Broad Daylight', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Woman, 73, Is Raped in Central Park', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'CENTRAL PARK (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-12T18:39:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Wendy Ruderman and Andy Newman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Wendy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ruderman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Andy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Newman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/98e7e66d-24ea-5c44-8f65-d36fee448ea7', 'word_count': 807, 'uri': 'nyt://article/98e7e66d-24ea-5c44-8f65-d36fee448ea7'}, {'abstract': 'Sarah Palin issued a ridiculous statement on the attacks in Libya. But John McCain, John Boehner and others handled the situation well.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/12/the-good-the-bad-and-the-palin/', 'snippet': 'Sarah Palin issued a ridiculous statement on the attacks in Libya. But John McCain, John Boehner and others handled the situation well.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I didn’t think any Republican leader could react to the riots in North Africa in a more blindly partisan, inappropriate way than Mitt Romney. (Click the link to see my previous post on the subject.) But I forgot to take Sarah Palin into account.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Good, the Bad, and the Palin', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCain, John', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Palin, Sarah', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-12T18:43:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Rosenthal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenthal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8eca140a-83df-5396-bb07-b6ea092cbfc3', 'word_count': 505, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8eca140a-83df-5396-bb07-b6ea092cbfc3'}, {'abstract': 'If the aerospace giants agree to a transaction, the two companies would not actually combine. Instead, they would probably enter into a complex, dual-listed company structure.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/09/12/the-many-complexities-of-any-eads-bae-merger/', 'snippet': 'If the aerospace giants agree to a transaction, the two companies would not actually combine. Instead, they would probably enter into a complex, dual-listed company structure.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The bombshell announcement of a possible tie-up between EADS and BAE Systems is only that – a possibility. Before a deal can be reached, the intense national issues surrounding this merger sti