s.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/12/a-touch-of-fetish/', 'snippet': 'Restraint was the message on some New York runways. Er, make that restraints.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Restraint was the message on some New York runways. Er, make that restraints. Taking a page from “Fifty Shades of Grey,” E.L. James’s dubious hymn to the joys of submission, with a nod as well to Helmut Newton’s chilly dominas, a handful of designers trotted out the kink this week, injecting their collections with the straps, cuffs, leather bras and other fetishy touches more commonly found in the city’s premier sex shops.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Touch of Fetish', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Leather and Leather Goods', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Altuzarra, Joseph', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wang, Alexander', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wu, Jason', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rodarte', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Fifty Shades of Grey (Book)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-12T19:06:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ruth La Ferla', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ruth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'La Ferla', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c7181549-e1e9-56af-8791-4acde7b2b353', 'word_count': 277, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c7181549-e1e9-56af-8791-4acde7b2b353'}, {'abstract': 'Map and images of the damage to the American post in Benghazi, Libya', 'web_url': 'https: