d seasonal fruits and vegetables like blueberries and cucumbers.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/13/business/subMcDonalds/subMcDonalds-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 284, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/13/business/subMcDonalds/subMcDonalds-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 284}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/13/business/subMcDonalds/subMcDonalds-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 485, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/13/business/subMcDonalds/subMcDonalds-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 970, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'McDonald’s Menu to Post Calorie Data', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'McDonald’s Menu to Post Calorie Data', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': "McDonald's Corporation", 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Calories', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fast Food Industry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labeling and Labels', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-12T19:08:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephanie Strom', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephanie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Strom', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1335bca0-dc2b-593d-bddb-8883b2f505f2', 'word_count': 641, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1335bca0-dc2b-593d-bddb-8883b2f505f2'}, {'abstract': 'The new version also requires a new connector cord — and a new adapter to make it work with existing accessories.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/13/technology/apple-introduces-a-new-iphone-with-a-larger-screen-and-more-powerful-chip.html', 'snippet': 'The new version also requires a new connector cord — and a new adapter to make it work with existing accessories.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — The new iPhone that Apple unveiled on Wednesday does not have the biggest screen of any smartphone on the market, nor is it the first to offer Internet access over the latest, speediest wireless networks. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/13/business/0913BIZAPPLE/0913BIZAPPLE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 649, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/13/business/0913BIZAPPLE/0913BIZAPPLE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1298, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Apple Unveils an iPhone That Is Lighter and More Powerful', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Apple Unveils an iPhone That Is Lighter and More Powerful', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Apple Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'iPhone', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smartphones', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'iPod', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-12T19:09:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': '