itt Romney in the Middle East.', 'web_url': 'https://keller.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/12/mitt-and-bibi-diplomacy-as-demolition-derby/', 'snippet': 'A review of the latest foreign policy missteps of Bibi Netanyahu and Mitt Romney in the Middle East.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It turns out Bibi Netanyahu and Mitt Romney have more in common than a background in management consulting and an unswerving devotion to the security of Israel. When it comes to international diplomacy, we are reminded this week, both have the subtle grace of cattle on loco weed. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mitt and Bibi: Diplomacy as Demolition Derby', 'kicker': 'Bill Keller', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Netanyahu, Benjamin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stevens, J Christopher', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'State Department', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-12T20:56:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Keller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Keller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/605ad53c-6f15-5724-9092-e42803ee1386