r Michael R. Bloomberg’s ban on large sodas is expected to be approved by New York City’s Board of Health on Thursday — for now.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/13/nyregion/in-soda-ban-soft-drink-industry-braces-for-a-long-fight.html', 'snippet': 'Soft-drink officials concede that Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg’s ban on large sodas is expected to be approved by New York City’s Board of Health on Thursday — for now.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fearful that stricter limits on soda sales in New York City could incite a national trend — and a long-term erosion of profits — the nation’s sweetened-beverage companies plan to continue campaigning against Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg’s restrictions on large sodas, even after the plan’s expected approval on Thursday by the Board of Health.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Soda Fight, Industry Focuses on the Long Run', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Soda Fight, Industry Focuses on the Long Run', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New Yorkers for Beverage Choices', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soft Drinks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Board of Health (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-13T01:52:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael M. Grynbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/26e7284b-ec04-53c7-8ae9-3bd6a4699a7b', 'word_count': 740, 'uri': 'nyt://article/26e7284b-ec04-53c7-8ae9-3bd6a4699a7b'}, {'abstract': 'The defendant provided a DNA sample after a recent conviction, and evidence from the murder was already in a DNA database.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/13/nyregion/man-accused-of-1993-manhattan-murder-based-on-dna-evidence.html', 'snippet': 'The defendant provided a DNA sample after a recent conviction, and evidence from the murder was already in a DNA database.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It took nearly two decades, but the trail of blood down the stairs outside a Manhattan apartment where a social worker was stabbed to death in 1993 led to a man the authorities say was the killer.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/13/nyregion/DNA-sub/DNA-sub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 972, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/13/nyregion/DNA-sub/DNA-sub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1697, 'width': 1610, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Man Is Charged With a 1993 Manhattan Murder, Based on DNA Evidence', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Man Is Charged With a 1993 Manhattan Murder, Based on DNA Evidence', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hawkins, James', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Francis, Gordon', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'DNA (Deoxyribonucleic Acid)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2