protesters) and intricately woven leather, finished with silver grommets or vividly colored nail heads.', 'lead_paragraph': '“How was it getting here?” Jack McCollough asked before the Proenza Schouler show on Wednesday. “Was it too far?”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Proenza Schouler: Modern Excavation', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hernandez, Lazaro', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCollough, Jack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Proenza Schouler', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-13T03:08:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cathy Horyn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cathy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Horyn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/61c31cf4-8cc8-5faa-b857-611e27ba3bdd', 'word_count': 303, 'uri': 'nyt://article/61c31cf4-8cc8-5faa-b857-611e27ba3bdd'}, {'abstract': 'If Congress fails to reach a deal, direct payments to farmers would still continue but nearly 40 other programs would not be financed after the end of this month.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/13/us/congressional-deal-on-a-farm-bill-appears-unlikely.html', 'snippet': 'If Congress fails to reach a deal, direct payments to farmers would still continue but nearly 40 other programs would not be financed after the end of this month.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Congressional agreement on a stalled farm bill seemed increasingly out of reach on Wednesday, as a few hundred farmers gathered near the Capitol to press for its passage. They were greeted by an unusually bipartisan group of lawmakers pushing for action in the House, where Republican leaders have declined to pursue legislation. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Deal on a Farm Bill Appears Unlikely', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Deal on a Farm Bill Appears Unlikely', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stabenow, Debbie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Farm Bill (US)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-13T03:09:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Steinhauer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Steinhauer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9b02cb97-ce91-5629-975f-a466df2cf462', 'word_count': 804, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9b02cb97-ce91-5629-975f-a466df2cf462'}, {'abstract': 'New York', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/09/12/fashion/runway-womens/proenza-schouler-spring-2013-rtw.html', 'snippet': 'New York', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/12/fashion/runway-womens/prnzaschouler_spring13app-slide-CNRS/prnzaschouler_spring13app-slide-CNRS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'