/2012/09/14/world/europe/support-for-the-euro-is-seen-in-dutch-election-results.html', 'snippet': 'Dutch voters appeared to give Prime Minister Mark Rutte a narrow victory, which will relieve European allies anxious about rising euro skepticism in the richer countries of the north.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AMSTERDAM — In a closely watched election, Dutch voters appeared on Wednesday to give Prime Minister Mark Rutte and his center-right Liberal Party a narrow victory over the center-left Labor Party, which will bring a sigh of relief to European allies anxious about rising euro skepticism in the richer countries of the north. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/13/world/dutch/dutch-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/13/world/dutch/dutch-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Support for the Euro Is Seen in Dutch Election Results', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Support for the Euro Is Seen in Dutch Election Results', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Netherlands', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rutte, Mark', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-13T10:21:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Erlanger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Erlanger', 'qualifier': None, 