 Jones and Robert Koehler to replace Richard Peña, who is stepping down after 25 years as the group’s programming director and chairman of the New York Film Festival selection committee.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/13/at-film-society-two-programmers-will-take-over-from-festival-veteran/', 'snippet': 'The Film Society of Lincoln Center named Kent Jones and Robert Koehler to replace Richard Peña, who is stepping down after 25 years as the group’s programming director and chairman of the New York Film Festival selection committee.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nearly a year after the longtime programming director of the New York Film Festival said he was stepping down, the organization that runs it has chosen not one but two replacements. The Film Society of Lincoln Center on Thursday announced the appointment of Kent Jones as director of programming for the festival and Robert Koehler as director of programming, year round.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At Film Society, Two Programmers Will Take Over From Festival Veteran', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A New Double Bill For the Film Society', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jones, Kent', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manus, Mara', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pena, Richard', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Scorsese, Martin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Film Forum', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Film Society of Lincoln Center', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'IFC Center (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lincoln Center for the Performing Arts', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Walter Rea