 theaters and donors in the United States. While no new National shows are in the immediate offing for Broadway, the executives said, the new office is poised to make the National even more of a force in American theater than it already is.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Britain’s National Theater To Open New York Office', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Britain’s National Theater Opens New York Office', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'War Horse (Play)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boyett, Bob', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lincoln Center Theater', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Theater Co', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-13T19:22:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/10e81ad3-b325-599a-b2cd-86a14640f050', 'word_count': 764, 'uri': 'nyt://article/10e81ad3-b325-599a-b2cd-86a14640f050'}, {'abstract': 'Florence Fabricant offers advice on what to do when a black-tie affair doesn’t live up to its billing.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/13/dear-flofab-black-tie-and-paper-plates/', 'snippet': 'Florence Fabricant offers advice on what to do when a black-tie affair doesn’t live up to its billing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Florence Fabricant gives advice on the fine points of entertaining at home and eatin