bly nothing was quite as impressive as his humanity.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/13/blogs/rdv-watkins-obit-f1/rdv-watkins-obit-f1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 733, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/13/blogs/rdv-watkins-obit-f1/rdv-watkins-obit-f1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1801, 'width': 1289, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/13/blogs/rdv-watkins-obit-f1/rdv-watkins-obit-f1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/13/blogs/rdv-watkins-obit-f1/rdv-watkins-obit-f1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/13/blogs/rdv-watkins-obit-f1/rdv-watkins-obit-f1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sid Watkins, Formula One Safety Pioneer, Dies at 84', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Racing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Formula One', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-13T22:14:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brad Spurgeon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Spurgeon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ed93a575-08e1-5735-bc59-2c06779bbf1c', 'word_count': 846, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ed93a575-08e1-5735-bc59-2c06779bbf1c'}, {'abstract': 'A selected, critical guide to comedy shows in the New York area.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/14/arts/comedy-listings-for-sept-14-20.html', 'snippet': 'A selected, critical guide to comedy shows in the New York area.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Comedy', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Comedy Listings for Sept. 14-20', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Listings', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Comedy and Humor', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-13T22:15:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/47423c60-7d47-5e8e-bc38-80595eba549e', 'word_count': 710, 'uri': 'nyt://article/47423c60-7d47-5e8e-bc38-80595eba549e'}, {'abstract': 'E-mails behind the controversy over Teresa Sullivan of the University of Virginia provided more than enough breadcrumbs to feed reporters, as well as conspiracy theorists who followed every stray reference, sometimes to questionable conclusions.', 'web_url': 'https://6thfloor.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/13/what-you-need-to-know-about-thousands-of-pages-of-uva-e-mails/', 'snippet': 'E-mails behind the controversy over Teresa Sullivan of the University of Virginia provided more than enough breadcrumbs to feed reporters, as well as conspiracy theorists who followed every stray reference, sometimes to questionable conclusions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The story of Teresa Sullivan’s resignation and reinstatement as president of the University of Virginia — which I wrote about for the cover article in the Education Issue — would have been a campus drama under any circumstances, but it probably would not have become a national news story if not for Virginia’s open-records laws, which have allowed news organizations an unusually complete view into the e-mail accounts of the major participants. The first batch of e-mails, obtained by the student-run Cavalier Daily in the midst of the leadership crisis, provided the tantalizing glimpses into what had been, up to that point, a decision shrouded in secrecy. While they didn’t provide definitive answers, the e-mails provided more than enough breadcrumbs to feed reporters, as well as conspiracy theorists who followed every stray reference, sometimes to questionable conclusions.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/magazine/16cover/16cover-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/16/magazine/16cover/16cover-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 681}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/magazine/16cover/16cover-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/magazine/16cover/16cover-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1500, 'width': 1125, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/magazine/16cover/16cover-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/16/magazine/16cover/16cover-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtyp