-8d73-df8f76831a5d'}, {'abstract': 'In the high school reunion comedy “10 Years,” some old classmates are struggling to grow up.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/14/movies/10-years-a-comedy-directed-by-jamie-linden.html', 'snippet': 'In the high school reunion comedy “10 Years,” some old classmates are struggling to grow up.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It takes a while to sort out who’s who in the gabby high school reunion comedy “10 Years.” But once you do, the movie that comes together is an unpretentious, well-acted ensemble piece that doesn’t aspire to be a portentous generational time capsule like “The Big Chill,” “American Graffiti” or “Diner.” But it has enough markers — a grown-up, married white rapper who break dances; a karaoke bar — to suggest an approximate date. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/arts/14TEN_SPAN/14TEN_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/14/arts/14TEN_SPAN/14TEN_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/arts/14TEN_SPAN/TEN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/arts/14TEN_SPAN/TEN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/arts/14TEN_SPAN/14TEN_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09