dar Patel Vidyalaya, in New Delhi, is one of eight high school seniors around the world blogging about their college searches for The Choice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nothing can quite convey the roller coaster of emotions of applying to college — bewilderment, elation, dejection, hope, fear — as powerfully as the voices of the applicants themselves. And so, as in years past, The Choice blog has selected eight high school seniors to tell their stories throughout the new school year as part of the latest installment of a first-person series we call “The Envelope, Please.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Searching U.S. Colleges, Doubt Creeps In Amid the Confidence', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Financial Aid (Education)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foreign Students (in US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Delhi (India)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-13T23:30:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sush Krishnamoorthy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sush', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krishnamoorthy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/14956fb1-8972-5945-97c5-484d02b5ec13', 'word_count': 765, 'uri': 'nyt://article/14956fb1-8972-5945-97c5-484d02b5ec13'}, {'abstract': 'Guidelines released this year stipulate that girls must be 16 to walk the runways. Is this an appropriate age? Or still too young?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/roomfordebate/2012/