', 'value': 'University of Arkansas', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-14T00:44:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'College Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tim Rohan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rohan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c1a9a5b9-993d-5874-9c0c-9681e7079451', 'word_count': 910, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c1a9a5b9-993d-5874-9c0c-9681e7079451'}, {'abstract': 'The suspect, David A. Mitchell, 42, recently arrived in New York after a string of incarcerations in the South for felonies including kidnapping, abduction and robbery.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/14/nyregion/drifter-is-charged-with-raping-73-year-old-woman-in-central-park.html', 'snippet': 'The suspect, David A. Mitchell, 42, recently arrived in New York after a string of incarcerations in the South for felonies including kidnapping, abduction and robbery.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A drifter who hailed from the South and spent most of his adult life in and out of prison on a grab bag of felonies, including kidnapping and abduction, was arrested on Thursday and charged with the rape, beating and robbery of a 73-year-old woman in Central Park.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/nyregion/RAPE-sub/RAPE-sub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 721, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/nyregion/RAPE-sub/RAPE-sub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1443, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Drifter Known for Menace Is Charged With Raping Woman, 73, in Central Park', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Drifter Known for Menace Is Charged With Raping Woman, 73, in Central Park', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mitchell, David Albert', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'CENTRAL PARK (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-14T00:53:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Wendy Ruderman and Nate Schweber', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Wendy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ruderman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Nate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schweber', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/22e9740b-02b6-5b16-9912-c98828663f87', 'word_count': 797, 'uri': 'nyt://article/22e9740b-02b6-5b16-9912-c98828663f87'}, {'abstract': 'In political debates, getting the facts right doesn’t guarantee a valid argument.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/13/facts-arguments-and-politics/', 'snippet': 'In political debates, getting the facts right doesn’t guarantee a valid argument.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Emotions drive politics. So why all the concern about facts and fact-checking? Because, among the whirl of our feelings, there is a desire for our beliefs to be rational, to have support from the facts. We’re uneasy if we can’t make a plausible case that what we say is true. Notice that political campaigns do all they can to undermine the analyses of the fact-checkers who award them “Pinocchios.” At a minimum, citing the facts is one important rhetorical ploy. I recall hearing of a university administrator who allegedly admitted, “Sometimes telling the truth is the best way to get people to do what you want.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Facts, Arguments and Politics', 'kicker': 'The Stone', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philosophy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Speeches and Statements', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-14T01:00:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gary Gutting', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gutting', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/49242bc2-7c1f-524c-9632-1b6ef7144d2a', 'word_count': 1088, 'uri': 'nyt://article/49242bc2-7c1f-524c-9632-1b6ef7144d2a'}, {'abstract': 'Mitt Romney’s words about the attack in Benghazi were all too revealing.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/13/egan-the-burden-of-speech/', 'snippet': 'Mitt Romney’s words about the attack in Benghazi were all too revealing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A fanatic makes a hate movie, filled with wild claims about the founder of one of the world’s major religions. Fanatics of another sort are inflamed by the crude film, crying blasphemy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Burden of Speech', 'kicker': 'Timothy Egan', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diplomat