ry — mustache in the days leading up to a preseason game late last month.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/14/sports/football/giants-deal-with-loss-of-kevin-gilbrides-longtime-mustache.html', 'snippet': 'Kevin Gilbride, the Giants’ offensive coordinator, inadvertently cut off half his longtime — and legendary — mustache in the days leading up to a preseason game late last month.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — Kevin Gilbride’s mustache, a legendary lip adornment that won two Super Bowl championships and was respected as one of the most enduring examples of responsible facial hair in sports, died last month in a shaving accident at the Giants’ practice facility here. It was believed to be about 41. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/sports/y-jp-giants-1/y-jp-giants-1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/sports/y-jp-giants-1/y-jp-giants-1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Giants Deal With Loss: Assistant’s Mustache', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Giants Deal With Loss: Assistant’s Mustache', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beards and Mustaches', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gilbride, Kevin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-14T01:18:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name':