cle/a258264b-756e-5a56-8f77-1292e7165320'}, {'abstract': 'In “Snowman’s Land,” Jürgen Rissmann plays a two-bit hit man who, in need of a break, takes what seems like an easy job, protecting a twisted mobster’s wife in a mountain getaway.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/14/movies/snowmans-land.html', 'snippet': 'In “Snowman’s Land,” Jürgen Rissmann plays a two-bit hit man who, in need of a break, takes what seems like an easy job, protecting a twisted mobster’s wife in a mountain getaway.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With his ill-fitting puffy coat and curtain of greasy hair, Walter (Jürgen Rissmann), a two-bit German hit man, seems as burned out as any wage slave in a depressed economy. So when a botched assignment in a public restroom necessitates some off-the-grid R&R, he accepts his temporary banishment with customary resignation.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/arts/14RDP_SNOW_SPAN/14RDP_SNOW_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/14/arts/14RDP_SNOW_SPAN/14RDP_SNOW_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/arts/14RDP_SNOW_SPAN/14RDP_SNOW_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 441, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/arts/14RDP_SNOW_SPAN/14RDP_SNOW_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 883, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/arts/14RDP_SNOW_SPAN/14RDP_SNOW_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg