rlfriend. So his father finds him a job as a kindergarten teacher.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/14/movies/the-stand-up.html', 'snippet': 'In “The Stand Up,” Jonathan Sollis is a stand-up comic who is in a deep funk over the death of his girlfriend. So his father finds him a job as a kindergarten teacher.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Commend David Wexler for not going where you expect in “The Stand Up,” an oaf-in-kiddieland story, or at least not lingering there when he does. It’s too bad that he didn’t bring a little more creativity to the predictable tale he does fashion, though.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/arts/14RDP_STAND_SPAN/14RDP_STAND_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/14/arts/14RDP_STAND_SPAN/14RDP_STAND_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/arts/14RDP_STAND_SPAN/14RDP_STAND_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/arts/14RDP_STAND_SPAN/14RDP_STAND_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1067, 'width': 1600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/arts/14RDP_STAND_SPAN/14RDP_STAND_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/14/arts/14RDP_STAND_SPAN/14RDP_STAND_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0,