'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/14/friday-reading-would-you-take-a-pregnancy-test-in-a-bar/', 'snippet': 'Taking a pregnancy test in a bar, new PCs that were shipped pre-infected with a virus, the most confusing cities and other consumer-focused news from The New York Times.', 'lead_paragraph': ' A variety of consumer-focused articles appears daily in The New York Times and on our blogs. Each weekday morning, we gather them together here so you can quickly scan the news that could hit you in your wallet.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Friday Reading: Would You Take a Pregnancy Test in a Bar?', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-14T12:05:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ac51d9a5-ab69-5a98-8ebe-37aad4e816e5', 'word_count': 135, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ac51d9a5-ab69-5a98-8ebe-37aad4e816e5'}, {'abstract': 'Boomers love their bikes. But then it gets hard to stay on the Harley.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/14/booming/14wheels.html', 'snippet': 'Boomers love their bikes. But then it gets hard to stay on the Harley.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Boomers love their bikes. First it was those little red tricycles with the fringe hanging from the handle grips. Then the 18-inchers with the training wheels. Then the banana seats and the baseball cards attached to the back wheel to making a flapping noise. Then the cruisers, with their thick tires, the Raleighs with the hand brakes and the racing bikes with the handlebars bent down.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/booming/14wheels/14wheels-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 340, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/14/booming/14wheels/14wheels-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 340}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/booming/14wheels/14wheels-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 603, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/booming/14wheels/14wheels-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1206, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/booming/14wheels/14wheels-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/14/booming/14wheels/14wheels-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/booming/14wheels/14wheels-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Tricycle-Harley-Tricycle Cycle', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Motorcycles, Motor Bikes and Motorscooters', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baby Boomers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-14T12:13:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Booming', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Winerip', 'person': [{'firstn