-his-favorite-poems/', 'snippet': 'The poet and poetry critic describes what he loves about “Hospital Parking Lot, April,” and “Ignatz Aubade” in words those who are unfamiliar with poetry can understand.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I asked Stephen Burt, the poet and poetry critic, to comment on two favorite poems, which accompany my profile of him. “Why do you like them?” I asked. “Can you help the reader unfamiliar with poetry understand them?” His answers are below.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/magazine/14-stephen-burt-spread/14-stephen-burt-spread-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 624, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/magazine/14-stephen-burt-spread/14-stephen-burt-spread-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1247, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/magazine/14-stephen-burt-spread/14-stephen-burt-spread-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/14/magazine/14-stephen-burt-spread/14-stephen-burt-spread-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/magazine/14-stephen-burt-spread/14-stephen-burt-spread-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Stephen Burt Explains His Favorite Poems', 'kicker': 'The 6th Floor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-14T17:19