mployees the choice of a monthly payout for their pension or a lump sum in cash or to roll into a retirement plan.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/14/times-co-offers-former-employees-lump-sum-option-for-pension/', 'snippet': 'The New York Times Company, trying to contain pension costs, is offering former employees the choice of a monthly payout for their pension or a lump sum in cash or to roll into a retirement plan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The New York Times Company, which like many of the nation’s newspaper publishers is dealing with large pension obligations, is offering former employees the option of taking a lump sum payment for their pensions instead of a monthly payout.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Times Co. Offers Former Employees Lump Sum Option for Pension', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newspapers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pensions and Retirement Plans', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Retirement', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times Company', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-14T18:09:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christine Haughney', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Haughney', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/688eb102-849e-53ee-b9b8-d0662d3e4b71', 'word_count': 197, 'uri': 'nyt://article/688eb102-849e-53ee-b9b8-d0662d3e4b71'}, {'abstract': 'Economists said the Federal Reserve’s plan to buy mortgage-backed securities and other assets was a sign of its confidence in a nascent housing recovery.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/15/business/economy/fed-may-have-limited-effect-at-best-on-real-estate.html', 'snippet': 'Economists said the Federal Reserve’s plan to buy mortgage-backed securities and other assets was a sign of its confidence in a nascent housing recovery.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Federal Reserve’s ambitious effort to spur the recovery by aiding the housing market is likely to have a modest effect on home sales, given the pervasive weakness in the real estate market and the economy, analysts said Friday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/15/business/15mortgage/15mortgage-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/15/business/15mortgage/15mortgage-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/15/business/15mortgage/15mortgage-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 634, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/15/business/15mortgage/15mortgage-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1268, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/15/business/15mortgage/15mortgage-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/15/business/15mortgage/15mortgage-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image',