the plight of the modern gay Christian.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/16/fashion/matthew-vines-wont-rest-in-defending-gay-christians.html', 'snippet': 'Matthew Vines, 22, uses a widely seen video and speeches to plead with others to consider the plight of the modern gay Christian.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ONE year after Matthew Vines was forced to leave the Wichita, Kan., church he had attended since birth — not because he is gay, but because he tried to convince people there was nothing wrong with that — he was sitting facing a crowd of 235\xa0Christians, most of them gay or lesbian, at the Marble Collegiate Church on Fifth Avenue in Manhattan.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/fashion/16VINES/16VINES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 660, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/fashion/16VINES/16VINES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1320, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/fashion/16VINES/16VINES-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/16/fashion/16VINES/16VINES-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/fashion/16VINES/16VINES-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Turned Away, He Turned to the Bible', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Turned Away, He Turned To the Bible', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vines, Matthew (1990- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bible', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'YouTube.com', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings and Downloads', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christians and Christianity', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Marble Collegiate Church', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-14T22:51:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Douglas Quenqua', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Douglas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Quenqua', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a9ebeda2-19c3-5eb4-9ce0-c70e9e8f84ef', 'word_count': 1796, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a9ebeda2-19c3-5eb4-9ce0-c70e9e8f84ef'}, {'abstract': 'Bobby McFerrin opened the Jazz at Lincoln Center Orchestra’s 25th-anniversary season with a program of works special to him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/15/arts/music/bobby-mcferrin-and-the-jazz-at-lincoln-center-orchestra.html', 'snippet': 'Bobby McFerrin opened the Jazz at Lincoln Center Orchestra’s 25th-anniversary season with a program of works special to him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The brassiest moment in “My Audio Biography,” Bobby McFerrin’s collaboration with the Jazz at Lincoln Center Orchestra, running through Saturday at the Rose Theater, subjects a hallowed text to some studious whimsy. It’s the third movement of Beethoven’s Seventh Symphony, arranged for big band by Jazz at Lincoln Center’s artistic director, Wynton Marsalis. With its galloping triplets, the arrangement move