yme and basil within snipping distance of the kitchen. Inside, the mood is immediately ebullient. New arrivals are greeted with hugs as they make their way among the crowd of tables; does everyone in here know one another, or does it just seem that way? If the bread and olive oil on the table are any indication, it is going to be a fine night.', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16DINENJ1/16DINENJ1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16DINENJ1/16DINENJ1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16DINENJ1/16DINENJ1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16DINENJ1/16DINENJ1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16DINENJ1/16DINENJ1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'House-Made Pasta, and Gifts From Mom', 'kicker': 'New Jersey Dining | Rumson', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'House-Made Pasta, And Gifts From Mom', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ristorante Giorgia (Rumson, NJ)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value