h got its start in 1912 in Fort Lee, moved most of its production to California in 1915, but its 100th birthday is being celebrated here. The 11-year-old  Fort Lee Film Commission has planned a variety of events to mark the centennial and “to make people aware they’re in a special place,” according to its executive director, Tom Meyers.', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16SPOTNJ_SPAN/16SPOTNJ_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16SPOTNJ_SPAN/16SPOTNJ_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16SPOTNJ_SPAN/16SPOTNJ_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16SPOTNJ_SPAN/16SPOTNJ_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1638, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16SPOTNJ_SPAN/16SPOTNJ_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16SPOTNJ_SPAN/16SPOTNJ_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16SPOTNJ_SPAN/16SPOTNJ_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Not Hollywood, but Once Famous for Movies', 'kicker': 'Spotlight | Fort Lee', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Not Hollywood, but Once Famous for Movies', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fort Lee Film Commission', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Fort Lee (NJ)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fort Lee Museum', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Universal Studios Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-14T23:43:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tammy La Gorce', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tammy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'La Gorce', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8402d60a-86b3-55f8-98a3-ab62ee2b3f19', 'word_count': 340, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8402d60a-86b3-55f8-98a3-ab62ee2b3f19'}, {'abstract': 'With only about a 50-50 chance of a first marriage lasting, there seems to be a societal desire to commemorate, and even celebrate, what has become an increasingly common milestone in people’s lives.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/16/fashion/the-unbridled-shower-celebrating-divorce-not-with-a-whimper-but-a-bang.html', 'snippet': 'With only about a 50-50 chance of a first marriage lasting, there seems to be a societal desire to commemorate, and even celebrate, what has become an increasingly common milestone in people’s lives.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’M not divorced. Yet. But when my husband tosses criticisms at me like wedding rice, divorce, were it to assume a human form, begins to look a lot like Channing Tatum. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'sub