ps://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/14/battle-renewed-between-sabathia-and-price/', 'snippet': 'If it seems as if the Yankees’ ace and the Rays’ ace face each other a lot, it’s because they do.', 'lead_paragraph': 'C.C. Sabathia often says he prefers not to pay much attention to the starting pitcher he’s facing on a given night. When the opponent is the Tampa Bay Rays, however, it’s a good bet Sabathia already knows who is on the mound against him.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Battle Renewed Between Sabathia and Price', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Girardi, Joe', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jeter, Derek', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lowe, Derek', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nova, Ivan', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Price, David Taylor', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sabathia, C C', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tampa Bay Rays', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-14T23:51:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Zach Schonbrun', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zach', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schonbrun', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/53336ba3-c9b5-5d5c-a10d-cd36df0ef9b1', 'word_count': 781, 'uri': 'nyt://article/53336ba3-c9b5-5d5c-a10d-cd36df0ef9b1'}, {'abstract': 'The play “Farragut North,” better known by its screen adaptation, “The Ides of March,” involving a spin doctor for a major presidential candidate, is at the Zella Fry Theater in Union.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/16/nyregion/a-review-of-farragut-north-at-the-zella-fry-theater.html', 'snippet': 'The play “Farragut North,” better known by its screen adaptation, “The Ides of March,” involving a spin doctor for a major presidential candidate, is at the Zella Fry Theater in Union.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A contemporary drama about a young political spin doctor who spins out of control on the campaign trail, “Farragut North” is better known today as “The Ides of March.” The screen adaptation of Beau Willimon’s play, which was released last year under that title, starred Ryan Gosling as the press secretary and George Clooney as the governor he strives to elect as president.', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16ARTSNJ1/16ARTSNJ1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16ARTSNJ1/16ARTSNJ1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16ARTSNJ1/16ARTSNJ1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16ARTSNJ1/16ARTSNJ1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16ARTSNJ1/16ARTSNJ1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbL