-hall hostess who keeps falling for no-good men, is at the John W. Engeman Theater at Northport through Oct. 28.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pay attention to Charity Hope Valentine’s middle name. The heroine of the musical “Sweet Charity” is prone to wishful thinking. She’s also a giving person, and the object of her striving is love, so Charity and Valentine are also cleverly apt names. Or painfully obvious ones.', 'print_section': 'LI', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16ARTSLI1_SPAN/16ARTSLI1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16ARTSLI1_SPAN/16ARTSLI1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16ARTSLI1_SPAN/16ARTSLI1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 574, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16ARTSLI1_SPAN/16ARTSLI1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1148, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16ARTSLI1_SPAN/16ARTSLI1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16ARTSLI1_SPAN/16ARTSLI1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16ARTSLI1_SPAN/16ARTSLI1_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 151, 'width': 150, 'subType