': 'nyt://article/10638030-305c-5425-9a5c-49d615f7c723'}, {'abstract': 'In a meaningful departure from past policy, the Federal Reserve said it would focus on reducing unemployment at the risk of provoking higher inflation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/15/business/fed-chooses-jobs-over-fighting-inflation.html', 'snippet': 'In a meaningful departure from past policy, the Federal Reserve said it would focus on reducing unemployment at the risk of provoking higher inflation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — When the Federal Reserve’s vice chairman said in a 1994 speech that the central bank “had a role in reducing unemployment,” colleagues were publicly dismissive. The very word “employment” did not appear in a policy statement until 2008. The Fed was focused on inflation, officials said time and again.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fed Responds to a Grim Reality', 'kicker': 'News Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fed Responds to a Grim Reality', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bernanke, Ben S', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Reserve System', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Inflation (Economics)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-15T01:08:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Binyamin Appelbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Binyamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Appelbaum', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News Analysis', '_id': 'nyt://article/234dd92d-b070-5dbf-9662-78f57f6d023c', 'word_count': 1003, 'uri': 'nyt://article/234dd92d-b070-5dbf-9662-78f57f6d023c'}, {'abstract': 'On Long Island, beer gardens in Franklin Square and Farmingdale, longtime German favorites, are being joined by new ones in Stony Brook and Smithtown.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/16/nyregion/as-oktoberfest-beckons-feeling-the-oompah-of-long-island-beer-gardens.html', 'snippet': 'On Long Island, beer gardens in Franklin Square and Farmingdale, longtime German favorites, are being joined by new ones in Stony Brook and Smithtown.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FRANKLIN SQUARE, N.Y.', 'print_section': 'LI', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16DINELI4/16DINELI4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16DINELI4/16DINELI4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16DINELI4/16DINELI4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16DINELI4/16DINELI4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16DINELI4/16DINELI4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Feeling the Oompah as Oktoberfest Beckons', 'kicker': 'Long Island Dining | Beer Gardens', 'content_kick