ic hospital said on Friday that they had no indication that any of the children they served were harmed by a doctor who worked for both institutions and now stands accused of receiving child pornography.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'School Confronts Porn Arrest of Doctor', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'School Confronts Porn Arrest Of Doctor', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Keller, Richard', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Pornography', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Phillips Academy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Massachusetts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-15T02:56:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Pérez-Peña', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pérez-Peña', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/13a63c11-ce7b-5f5a-bed3-a40d140b73f0', 'word_count': 539, 'uri': 'nyt://article/13a63c11-ce7b-5f5a-bed3-a40d140b73f0'}, {'abstract': 'Next to “great shaving,” which allows him to “look in the mirror and get ideas,” the piano is Rabbi David M. Posner’s hobby.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/16/nyregion/on-sundays-rabbi-david-posner-skips-lunch-and-tickles-the-ivories.html', 'snippet': 'Next to “great shaving,” which allows him to “look in the mirror and get ideas,” the piano is Rabbi David M. Posner’s hobby.', 'lead_paragraph': 'David M. Posner is retiring next year as senior rabbi at  Temple Emanu-El on Fifth Avenue at 65th Street, a Reform Jewish synagogue that counts Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg among its 3,000 members. Rabbi Posner, 64, who grew up in Brownsville, Brooklyn, started there immediately after his ordination from Hebrew Union College in Cincinnati, in 1973. He lives with his wife and childhood sweetheart, Sylvia — he calls her Syl — in a building that is a 15-minute walk from work, and said he expected to feel both happiness and relief after delivering his last High Holy Days sermons beginning on Sunday. ', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16ROUTINE3_SPAN/16ROUTINE3_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16ROUTINE3_SPAN/16ROUTINE3_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16ROUTINE3_SPAN/16ROUTINE3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16ROUTINE3_SPAN/16ROUTINE3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16ROUTINE3_SPAN/16ROUTINE3_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16ROUTINE3_SPAN/16ROUTINE3_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/nyregion/16ROUTINE3_SPAN/16ROUTINE