ng to save lives through methods on and off the track.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/16/sports/autoracing/dr-sid-watkins-safety-innovator-in-formula-one-racing-dies-at-84.html', 'snippet': 'Dr. Watkins is credited with helping to save lives through methods on and off the track.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Formula One racing is one of the world’s fastest motorsports, and in the 1970s it was one of the most dangerous. Fiery crashes occurred so frequently that drivers were often seriously injured or killed.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/sports/dog-WATKINS1-obit/dog-WATKINS1-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 751, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/sports/dog-WATKINS1-obit/dog-WATKINS1-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1502, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/sports/dog-WATKINS1-obit/dog-WATKINS1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/16/sports/dog-WATKINS1-obit/dog-WATKINS1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/sports/dog-WATKINS1-obit/dog-WATKINS1-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sid Watkins, Safety Innovator in Formula One Racing, Dies at 84', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dr. Sid Watkins, 84, a Catalyst For Safer R