/16/sports/a-wide-open-field-and-the-nascar-chase-is-on.html', 'snippet': 'This season’s playoff field is as unpredictable as any, with no dominant driver through the regular season and with a few surprise entries in the mix.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Nascar driver Jeff Gordon vowed to grow a mustache if he managed to climb from deep in the standings to earn a berth in this year’s Chase for the Sprint Cup. After he eked out the final spot in the 12-car field in the last race of the regular season, Gordon’s stubble is showing heading into Sunday’s playoff opener at Chicagoland Speedway.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Wide-Open Field, and the Nascar Chase Is On', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Chase: 10 Races, No Clear Favorite', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Busch, Kyle', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Edwards, Carl (1979- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gordon, Jeff', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nascar Sprint Cup Series', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Assn of Stock Car Auto Racing', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Earnhardt, Dale Jr', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Racing', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Jimmie', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-15T16:04:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Viv Bernstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Viv', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bernstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f7c064df-099b-5f89-8710-7cc14e545d52', 'word_count': 856, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f7c064df-099b-5f89-8710-7cc14e545d52'}, {'abstract': 'Mira Nair discusses her film “The Reluctant Fundamentalist” at the Toronto International Film Festival.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/15/fundamentals-from-mira-nair/', 'snippet': 'Mira Nair discusses her film “The Reluctant Fundamentalist” at the Toronto International Film Festival.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TORONTO — The director Mira Nair has\xa0 comedies, multicultural dramas and period pieces in her filmography, but she hadn’t tackled the thriller genre until now. Her latest film, “The Reluctant Fundamentalist,” opened at the Venice Film Festival before playing here in a gala presentation. It was acquired by IFC Films this week for distribution. An adaptation of of Mohsin Hamid’s novel, the film follows a young Pakistani man (Riz Ahmed) who goes to the United States to pursue the American dream. But after the 9/11 attacks, the way he is perceived in the country, and subsequently the way he perceives the country, shifts. In the video above, Ms. Nair, who hails from India, speaks about the film and ways she hopes its subject will create both a dialogue and a bridge of understanding between the United States and Pakistan.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fundamentals From Mira Nair', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Toronto International Film Festival', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hamid, Mohsin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nair, Mira', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Toronto (Ontario)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-15T16:06:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mekado Murphy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mekado', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 