'uri': 'nyt://article/d5326453-a432-5c3b-bc76-fb1175f97cbd'}, {'abstract': 'Andy Murray’s victory in the United States Open capped a summer of accomplishment for British athletes, from tennis to the London Games to the golf course.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/16/sports/for-britain-a-good-sporting-summer-quite.html', 'snippet': 'Andy Murray’s victory in the United States Open capped a summer of accomplishment for British athletes, from tennis to the London Games to the golf course.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOYLAKE, England — British sports are in the midst of a glorious Indian summer, the tennis player Andy Murray’s victory in the United States Open final taking place on the same day Britain’s 65 Olympic medalists and 120 Paralympic medalists were honored in a London parade. Then the best golfers in the world descended on Royal Liverpool Golf Club for the Women’s British Open, the year’s final major. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/sports/YBRITISH3/YBRITISH3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 837, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/sports/YBRITISH3/YBRITISH3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1674, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Britain, a Stunner of a Summer, Quite', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Britain, a Stunner Of a Summer, Quite', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': "Women's British Open (Golf)", 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2012)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'ra