role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c8ef5099-de77-526d-9555-7a9d946617ed', 'word_count': 37, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c8ef5099-de77-526d-9555-7a9d946617ed'}, {'abstract': 'As tens of thousands take to the streets of Moscow, a Russian MP stripped of his office repudiates Putin’s system in a rare J’accuse from the floor of the Duma, .', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/16/russias-political-weekend-we-will-all-answer-for-this/', 'snippet': 'As tens of thousands take to the streets of Moscow, a Russian MP stripped of his office repudiates Putin’s system in a rare J’accuse from the floor of the Duma, .', 'lead_paragraph': 'The anti-Putin opposition was on the streets again on Saturday in Moscow, as our colleagues Ellen Barry, David Herszenhorn, James Hill and others documented in full. One of the people they quoted, Gennady Gudkov — described by Ellen as a rumpled veteran of Russia’s post-Communist fray — was stripped of his parliamentary seat on Friday. In this video of his farewell speech, in Russia (http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n8c_vqEdI0o&feature=youtu.be), he told the attentive if scant members of the Duma, Russia’s parliament, exactly what he thinks is going on behind the scenes in their country. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/blogs/rdv-russia-protests/rdv-russia-protests-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/16/blogs/rdv-russia-protests/rdv-russia-protests-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/16/blogs/rdv-russia-protests/rdv-russia-protests-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'cro