nthers game, had posted pictures of himself on his Facebook page in Saints apparel at a tailgate party during a preseason game.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/16/replacement-official-removed-from-crew-for-being-a-saints-fan/', 'snippet': 'Brian Stropolo, a side judge scheduled to work Sunday’s Saint-Panthers game, had posted pictures of himself on his Facebook page in Saints apparel at a tailgate party during a preseason game.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The N.F.L. said it has been generally pleased with the performance of replacement officials. They were not pleased Sunday, however, to see one of them wearing New Orleans Saints apparel on his Facebook page — hours before he was supposed to be part of the crew at the Saints’ game against the Carolina Panthers. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Replacement Official Removed From Crew for Being a Saints Fan', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Replacement Official Pulled for Being a Fan', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Officiating (Sports)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Football League', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New Orleans Saints', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-16T18:40:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Judy Battista', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Judy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Battista', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e4f73e9b-964f-5c11-920d-bee1da75dfe2', 'word_count': 192, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e4f73e9b-964f-5c11-920d-bee1da75dfe2'}, {'abstract': 'The estimated drop in corporate profits removes what had been an economic bright spot in an otherwise cloudy picture.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/17/business/earnings-outlook-in-us-dims-as-global-economy-slows.html', 'snippet': 'The estimated drop in corporate profits removes what had been an economic bright spot in an otherwise cloudy picture.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The boom in American corporate profits, which has far outpaced the gains in the broader economy since the end of the last recession, is faltering.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/17/business/jp-earnings2/jp-earnings2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 701, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/17/business/jp-earnings2/jp-earnings2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1402, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/17/business/jp-earnings2/jp-earnings2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/17/business/jp-earnings2/jp-earnings2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/17/business/jp-earnings2/jp-earnings2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Earnings in United States Are Beginning to Feel a Pinch', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Earnings Are Beginning To Feel a Pinch', 'name': Non