/2012/09/17/sports/baseball/martin-and-kuroda-help-yankees-maintain-slim-lead-in-east.html', 'snippet': 'Russell Martin hit a three-run homer and Hiroki Kuroda pitched six effective innings in a win over the visiting Rays that kept the Yankees a game ahead of the Orioles in the American League East.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was in Tampa Bay earlier this month that questions flared up regarding how the Yankees’ offense should play the rest of the season. Should they bunt more, as the hitting instructor Kevin Long initially advocated after a tough loss at Tropicana Field? Should they employ the small-ball tactics that Alex Rodriguez espoused a day later after a victory, or should they continue to play the way they had, slugging their way to victories as Manager Joe Girardi insisted they would?', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/17/sports/baseball/17yankees-pic/17yankees-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/17/sports/baseball/17yankees-pic/17yankees-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 390}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/17/sports/baseball/17yankees-pic/17yankees-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 760, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/17/sports/baseball/17yankees-pic/17yankees-pic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1520, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/17/sports/baseball/17yankees-pic/17yankees-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/17/sports/baseball/17yankees-pic/17yankees-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/17/sports/baseball/17yankees-pic/17yankees-pic-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Choosing All of the Above, the Yankees Stay on Top', 'kicker': 'Yankees 6, Rays 4', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Choosing All of the Above, the Yankees Stay on Top', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tampa Bay Rays', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martin, Russell', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kuroda, Hiroki', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-16T20:53:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ef2a9d30-b840-59b1-ba89-423a67aaf668', 'word_count': 942, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ef2a9d30-b840-59b1-ba89-423a67aaf668'}, {'abstract': 'London', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/09/16/fashion/runway-womens/mary-katrantzou-spring-2013-rtw.html', 'snippet': 'London', 'lead_paragraph': 'London', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'ur