ational Relations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-17T00:35:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matthew Rosenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matthew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e7bad60d-2037-5776-989a-972ddc976e87', 'word_count': 854, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e7bad60d-2037-5776-989a-972ddc976e87'}, {'abstract': 'Ralliers plan three days of events in Manhattan to highlight issues like risky speculation, foreclosures and corporate money in politics.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/17/nyregion/protests-planned-for-anniversary-of-occupy-wall-st.html', 'snippet': 'Ralliers plan three days of events in Manhattan to highlight issues like risky speculation, foreclosures and corporate money in politics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The crowd sat in a circle at the edge of Battery Park on Friday, as two young women held up a large map of the financial district that had been divided into sectors and marked with assembly points. They explained the plan for early Monday: protesters will gather at those points, then converge in an attempt to surround the New York Stock Exchange. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/17/nyregion/OWS/OWS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/17/nyregion/OWS/OWS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'cr