/sports/baseball/yankees-rafael-soriano-a-successful-fill-in-for-mariano-rivera.html', 'snippet': 'For a Yankees team likely to play into October, Rafael Soriano has proved more than able to fill the closer’s role that opened up when Mariano Rivera injured his knee.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It has been 140 days since Mariano Rivera last threw a pitch, and the unspoken reality is that the Yankees have not missed him. For all of Rivera’s brilliance, the Yankees could not have expected him to do more than his successor has done.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/17/sports/YKEPNER/YKEPNER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 738, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/17/sports/YKEPNER/YKEPNER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1475, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/17/sports/YKEPNER/YKEPNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/17/sports/YKEPNER/YKEPNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/17/sports/YKEPNER/YKEPNER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Big Void, and Closing It Well', 'kicker': 'On Baseball', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Big Void, and Closing It Well', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Soriano, Rafael', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N