7-9ec0-51ee-8ca9-10522186092c'}, {'abstract': 'The tangled controversy surrounding Assemblyman Vito Lopez has presented the ethics commission with its first big challenge.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/17/opinion/the-first-test-for-albanys-ethicists.html', 'snippet': 'The tangled controversy surrounding Assemblyman Vito Lopez has presented the ethics commission with its first big challenge.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More than a year ago, Gov. Andrew Cuomo and New York’s State Legislature passed a long-overdue ethics law to clean up Albany. The law contained one grave flaw, a supposedly independent Joint Commission on Public Ethics that is made up entirely of political appointees. The tangled controversy surrounding Assemblyman Vito Lopez has presented the commission with its first big test. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The First Test for Albany’s Ethicists', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The First Test for Albany’s Ethicists', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lopez, Vito J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Joint Commission on Public Ethics (NYS)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State Legislatures', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ethics (Institutional)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sexual Harassment', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Silver, Sheldon', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schneiderman, Eric T', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'DiNapoli, Thomas P', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_dat