bject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-17T01:26:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/48bf75e1-ee52-5648-8257-79914f645640', 'word_count': 477, 'uri': 'nyt://article/48bf75e1-ee52-5648-8257-79914f645640'}, {'abstract': 'When Tampa Bay eased up in the final two minutes, the Giants’ Andre Brown stopped short of the goal line, allowing time to wind down before he scored the winning touchdown.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/16/giants-waiting-game-is-a-work-in-progress/', 'snippet': 'When Tampa Bay eased up in the final two minutes, the Giants’ Andre Brown stopped short of the goal line, allowing time to wind down before he scored the winning touchdown.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — Seven months later, the Giants did better when it came to handling an opposing defense trying to let them score. But it still wasn’t perfect.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Giants’ Waiting Game Is a Work in Progress', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bradshaw, Ahmad', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Andre', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coughlin, Tom', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-17T01:27:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Borden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Borden', 'qualifier': 