ere the milliner was inspired, literally, by Michael Jackson’s stage wardrobe.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/17/a-fashion-week-homage-to-michael-jacksons-thriller/', 'snippet': 'Fashion week is well under way in London and one of the exciting highlights so far was Philip Treacy’s Sunday show where the milliner was inspired, literally, by Michael Jackson’s stage wardrobe.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Just the idea was a “Thriller”: linking Michael Jackson’s stage wardrobe, from the military buttoned jackets to his tiny-waisted trousers, with Philip Treacy, the milliner with an imagination as big as the late artist’s voice.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/17/blogs/rdv-treacy-london-show/rdv-treacy-london-show-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/17/blogs/rdv-treacy-london-show/rdv-treacy-london-show-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Fashion Week Homage to Michael Jackson’s Thriller', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Treacy, Philip', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-17T08:21:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Suzy Menkes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Suzy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Menkes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cbdf85d8-