Lakeside School in Seattle, is one of eight high school seniors around the world who are blogging about their college searches.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The sun is starting to withdraw from our usually gloomy Seattle skies. No more sweating in 80-degree weather and I finally get to take a breath from my rush of summer enrichment programs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Queen of Mediocrity’ Prepares to Present Herself to Colleges', 'kicker': 'The Choice', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-17T10:00:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thanh-Tran Nguyen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thanh-tran', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nguyen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/736f73db-843f-5f1e-9954-10bb21a8acdc', 'word_count': 566, 'uri': 'nyt://article/736f73db-843f-5f1e-9954-10bb21a8acdc'}, {'abstract': 'Political news from today’s Times, plus a look at what’s happening in Washington.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/17/the-early-word-fraud-fighters/', 'snippet': 'Political news from today’s Times, plus a look at what’s happening in Washington.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Today’s Times:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Early Word: Fraud Fighters', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-17T10:00:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emmarie Huetteman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emmarie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Huetteman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'o