ering that could raise around $5.1 billion.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/09/17/sberbank-of-russia-launches-5-1-billion-share-sale/', 'snippet': 'The Russian government has announced that it will sell a 7.6 percent stake in the country’s largest lender, Sberbank, in a rights offering that could raise around $5.1 billion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — The Russian government announced on Monday that it would sell a 7.6 percent stake in the country’s largest lender, Sberbank, in a rights offering that could raise around $5.1 billion.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sberbank of Russia Starts $5.1 Billion Share Sale', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Russia to Raise $5 Billion in Sberbank Stake Sale', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sberbank', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-17T10:12:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8bbbc6a5-9b8a-563a-8559-920764460b37', 'word_count': 372, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8bbbc6a5-9b8a-563a-8559-920764460b37'}, {'abstract': 'By listing the Lower Esopus Creek as “impaired,” the agency could force New York City to stop discharging turbid water into it.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/17/e-p-a-plans-crackdown-on-muddy-upstate-waterway/', 'snippet': 'By listing the Lower Esopus Creek as “impaired,” the agency could force New York City to stop discharging turbid water into it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The federal Environmental Protection Agency wants to list the Lower Esopus Creek in the Catskills region of New York as an “impaired” waterway. Such a step could force New York City to stop discharging muddy water into the creek from a reservoir that helps supply city’s drinking water.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'E.P.A. Plans Crackdown on Muddy Upstate Waterway', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Water Pollution', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Environmental Protection Agency', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lower Esopus Creek (NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ulster County (NY)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-17T10:59:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mireya Navarro', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mireya', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Navarro', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/21356ef9-69e4-5299-ba09-e8274e47a8b9', 'word_count': 665, 'uri': 'nyt://article/21356ef9-69e4-5299-ba09-e8274e47a8b9'}, {'abstract': 'The Fed makes a move, President Obama gets a Republican bear hug, and Latinos are starting up. Do you ever Bing it?', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/17/this-week-in-small-business-godaddy-goes-dark/', 'snippet': 'The Fed makes a move, President Obama gets a Republican bear hug, and Latinos are starting up. Do you ever Bing it?', 'lead_paragraph': 'What’s affecting me, my clients and other small-business owners t