1-f40d2aa610eb', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/84b9c7c1-39e7-5074-9b81-f40d2aa610eb'}, {'abstract': 'Twiggy turning 63 is the hardest to keep in my mind alongside the image of the 1960s pixie model who looked about 12.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/17/booming/17birthdays.html', 'snippet': 'Twiggy turning 63 is the hardest to keep in my mind alongside the image of the 1960s pixie model who looked about 12.', 'lead_paragraph': "Nothing makes the average baby boomer feel better than to know that a famous boomer is getting older, too. Of all the names on this week’s birthday list, I think Twiggy turning 63 is the hardest to keep in my mind alongside the image of the 1960s pixie model who looked about 12. Sept. 23 is Bruce Springsteen’s birthday. In an appreciation, Matt Richtel, a Times colleague, writes that one of the finest things about Mr. Springsteen’s music is his stories, which show, rather than tell. “He let me fill in the blanks, interpret, reach my own conclusions about life, keep my dignity intact,'’ Matt writes. “He turns 63 this week. A gift to us.”", 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/18/booming/18birthdays/18birthdays-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 966, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/18/booming/18birthdays/18birthdays-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1999, 'width': 1885, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Baby Boomers Who Celebrate Birthdays This Week', 'kicker': 'One Year Older', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baby Boomers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-17T17:00:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '