d_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/de9b367a-0762-54b1-9a66-08da805bf9e1'}, {'abstract': 'Weeks after his vacation, a park visitor frets while watching for symptoms of hantavirus infection.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/18/health/waiting-and-worrying-after-yosemite-hantavirus-outbreak.html', 'snippet': 'Weeks after his vacation, a park visitor frets while watching for symptoms of hantavirus infection.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bears were the only thing to worry about during our stay at a tent cabin in Yosemite National Park in August, or so my husband and I thought. We scrupulously emptied the car of food and anything a bear might mistake for food, including empty wrappers and scented items like soap. We cleaned every crumb of trail mix from our tent. We stashed everything that might attract a bear in metal lockers provided by the park. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/us/YOSEMITE-2/YOSEMITE-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/14/us/YOSEMITE-2/YOSEMITE-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/us/YOSEMITE-2/YOSEMITE-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 677, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/us/YOSEMITE-2/YOSEMITE-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1354, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/us/YOSEMITE-2/YOSEMITE-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/14/us/YOSEMITE-2/YOSEMITE-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/14/us/YOSEMITE-2/YOSEMITE-2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Long Wait and Worry for a Visitor to Yosemite', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Long Wait And Worry For a Visitor To Yosemite', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hantavirus', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Camps and Camping', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Yosemite National Park', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-17T18:55:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Jaret', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jaret', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3de7ffe5-3a8c-574c-9117-47ff213acaf8', 'word_count': 1139, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3de7ffe5-3a8c-574c-9117-47ff213acaf8'}, {'abstract': 'In “Joseph Anton” Salman Rushdie recounts the death threat against him and his years in hiding.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/18/books/in-joseph-anton-salman-rushdie-revisits-death-threat.html', 'snippet': 'In “Joseph Anton” Salman Rushdie recounts the death threat against him and his years in hiding.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 1989 the Ayatollah Ruhollah Khomeini declared that Salman Rushdie’s novel “The Satanic Verses” was offensive to Islam and issued a fatwa against the author, sentencing him to death. For nine years Mr. Rushdie lived under the shadow of assassination, deprived of the freedom of ordinary life and made to fear for himself and his family. It was a nightmare weirdly like something out of one of his own surreal novels, and underscored the very themes he’d been grappling with for years in his fiction: namely, the emotional costs of exile and being cut off from one’s past; the consequences of globalization and the cultural clash between East and West; and the increasingly phantasmagorical nature of contemporary history. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/18/arts/book/book-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 643, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/18/arts/book/book-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1286, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/18/arts/book/book-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/18/arts/book/book-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Rushdie Relives Difficult Years Spent in Hiding', 'kicker': 'Books of The Times', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rushdie Relives Difficult Years Spent in Hiding', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Joseph Anton: A Memoir (Book)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rushdie, Salman', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-17T19:01:23+0000