': 'nyt://article/e8338fb9-815c-521a-834f-0e7fcc4878df', 'word_count': 589, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e8338fb9-815c-521a-834f-0e7fcc4878df'}, {'abstract': 'A new boxed set of comedy DVDs, “Steve Martin: The Television Stuff,” illustrates his evolution from a comedian working in intimate settings to one playing to a mass audience.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/18/arts/television/steve-martin-the-television-stuff-a-comedians-evolution.html', 'snippet': 'A new boxed set of comedy DVDs, “Steve Martin: The Television Stuff,” illustrates his evolution from a comedian working in intimate settings to one playing to a mass audience.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No stand-up comic has arguably ever been bigger than Steve Martin. His albums sold in the millions. His act drew crowds in the tens of thousands. Critics adored him. Then, at the height of his success, he quit. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/18/arts/COMEDY-jp/COMEDY-jp-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 346, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/18/arts/COMEDY-jp/COMEDY-jp-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 346}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/18/arts/COMEDY-jp/COMEDY-jp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 593, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/18/arts/COMEDY-jp/COMEDY-jp-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1186, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/18/arts/COMEDY-jp/COMEDY-jp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subT