 into private equity firms and politically active tax-exempt groups.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Congressional Republicans Raise Questions About New York Investigations', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Private Equity', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Camp, David L', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hatch, Orrin G', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schneiderman, Eric T', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Internal Revenue Service', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-17T23:29:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Confessore', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Confessore', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fe8a4e73-9e0d-5b30-8166-904290540659', 'word_count': 472, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fe8a4e73-9e0d-5b30-8166-904290540659'}, {'abstract': 'The trench coat remains the main event at the British company.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/17/burberry-view-from-a-bridge/', 'snippet': 'The trench coat remains the main event at the British company.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Christopher Bailey may have opened the Burberry show with a creamy white cape over a pleated silk bodysuit — the perfect outfit for a bareback circus rider — but a trench coat remains the main event at the British company. In a collection called “Corsets and Capes,” Mr. Bailey gave a clean, tighter, sensual line to his many coats (including a style that bled from red into pink), cute satin shorts and handsome lace dresses. The winners were the sleek trenches in leather, satin or micropleated satin, though perhaps the optimistic colors — inky blue, fuchsia, copper, pink, lipstick red — were the centerpiece of a polished, newsy show. You half wondered if London, seen from a Thames River bridge at night, was the inspiration for the jewel palette. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Burberry: View From a Bridge', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'London Fashion Week', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bailey, Christopher', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Burberry', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-17T23:33:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cathy Horyn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cathy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Horyn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5147a734-fde6-5659-8dde-d89feb65d796', 'word_count': 130, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5147a734-fde6-5659-8dde-d89feb65d796'}, {'abstract': 'A list of Assembly expenditures included a settlement paid to two women who had accused Assemblyman Vito J. Lopez of sexual harassment.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/17/assembly-releases-documents-listing-sex-harassment-settlement/', 'snippet': 'A list of Assembly expenditures included a settlement paid to two women who had accused Assemblyman Vito J. Lopez of sexual harassment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALBANY — The State Assembly on Monday released a list of its 2012 expenditures from the part of its budget that was used to pay a secret sexual harassment settlement this summer.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Assembly Releases Documents Listing Sexual Harassment Settlement', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sexual Harassment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State Legislatures', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lopez, Vito J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-17T23:44:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Danny Hakim', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Danny', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hakim', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a4be4995-84c6-5ac5-afd4-9465cd3497e2', 'word_count': 291, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a4be4995-84c6-5ac5-afd4-9465cd3497e2'}, {'abstract': 'Prejudice against Muslim immigrants resembles the anti-Catholic views of 60 years ago.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/18/opinion/catholics-then-muslims-now.html', 'snippet': 'Prejudice against Muslim immigrants resembles the anti-Catholic views of 60 years ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Toronto', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Catholics Then, Muslims Now', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Catholi