h fierce opposition from the college administration.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/18/nyregion/college-english-dept-fights-class-time-cuts.html', 'snippet': 'Members of the English department at Queensborough Community College voted against a universitywide proposal and were met with fierce opposition from the college administration.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When members of the English department at Queensborough Community College voted last week against a plan to curtail their basic writing courses to three hours a week from four, they said they wanted to send the school a message: “We support our students,” Elise Denbo, a lecturer in the department, said Monday. “Sometimes they need extra time.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'College English Dept. Fights Class-Time Cuts', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'College English Dept. Fights Class-Time Cuts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Teachers and School Employees', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'City University of New York', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Reading and Writing Skills', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Queensborough Community College', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-18T01:53:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ariel Kaminer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ariel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaminer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f2e15985-d305-54bd-9d9f-f094a59d2208', 'word_count': 778, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f2e15985-d305-54bd-9d9f-f094a59d2208'}, {'abstract': 'Andy Pettitte’s scheduled start Tuesday against the Toronto Blue Jays will be his 42nd against a team he has beaten 21 times.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/18/sports/baseball/pettitte-rejoining-jeter-for-another-yankees-stretch-run.html', 'snippet': 'Andy Pettitte’s scheduled start Tuesday against the Toronto Blue Jays will be his 42nd against a team he has beaten 21 times.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the Yankees trotted onto the field to celebrate another victory in their ritual hand-slapping conga line on Sunday, Andy Pettitte grabbed Derek Jeter from behind in a bear hug, and the two players, both dealing with injured left ankles, laughed as they headed to the clubhouse.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/18/sports/YYANKEES/YYANKEES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 688, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/18/sports/YYANKEES/YYANKEES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1376, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/18/sports/YYANKEES/YYANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/18/sports/YYANKEES/YYANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/18/sports/YYANKEES/YYANKEES-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Pettitte Rejoins Jeter in Another Stretch Run', 'kicker': No