an Eli Manning’s 80-yard touchdown strike to Victor Cruz. Let’s take a closer look.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/18/breaking-down-victor-cruzs-80-yard-touchdown/', 'snippet': 'In the Giants’ 41-34 win over Tampa Bay, there was no play more vital than Eli Manning’s 80-yard touchdown strike to Victor Cruz. Let’s take a closer look.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Throughout the season, I’ll \xa0break down a big play from each week. In the Giants’ 41-34 win over Tampa Bay on Sunday, there was no play more vital than Eli Manning’s 80-yard touchdown strike to Victor Cruz. Let’s take a look.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Breaking Down Victor Cruz’s 80-Yard Touchdown', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cruz, Victor', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manning, Eli', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-18T09:15:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan Bales', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bales', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ba67d605-ffc6-5593-bfdd-c045fa67e23c', 'word_count': 794, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ba67d605-ffc6-5593-bfdd-c045fa67e23c'}, {'abstract': 'A spike in attacks on international troops by Afghan soldiers and police officers pushed the American-led military coalition to curb ground operations with its Afghan counterparts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/19/world/asia/nato-curbs-joint-operations-with-afghan-troops