iles and is segmented with baited hooks and buoys. They’ll let it float for a number of hours, hooking whatever swims along that has a taste for the bait. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Getting Bluefin Tuna Off the Hook', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Endangered and Extinct Species', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fishing, Commercial', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Research', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tuna', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pew Environment Group', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gulf of Mexico', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-18T14:35:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kelly Slivka', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kelly', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Slivka', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f365ce2e-97b0-5a47-a3cf-d7dc28832935', 'word_count': 952, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f365ce2e-97b0-5a47-a3cf-d7dc28832935'}, {'abstract': 'Canadian labor deal puts pressure on Chrysler and General Motors. | Debt collectors find a partner in prosecutors.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/business/100000001790753/business-day-live-september-18-2012.html', 'snippet': 'Canadian labor deal puts pressure on Chrysler and General Motors. | Debt collectors find a partner in prosecutors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Canadian labor deal puts pressure on Chrysler and General Motors. | Debt collectors find a partner in prosecut