-william-and-kate-visit-threatened-tuvalu/', 'snippet': 'Island youths plan to deliver a message about how their homes are threatened by rising sea levels.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Inhabitants of Tuvalu, an island country deeply threatened by rising seas, hope to convey their plight to the Duke and Duchess of Cambridge as they arrive on the final stop of their royal tour. [R.T.C.C.]', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'On Our Radar: William and Kate Visit Threatened Tuvalu', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Freedom of Information Act', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Greenhouse Gas Emissions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Natural Gas', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'McClatchy Co', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Virginia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'British Columbia (Canada)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tuvalu', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Virginia', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-18T15:54:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/68d480b7-32e3-57c6-90ce-31136ba58212', 'word_count': 195, 'uri': 'nyt://article/68d480b7-32e3-57c6-90ce-31136ba58212'}, {'abstract': 'Younger people are buying long-term care insurance, but there are many risks for those who are not certain they’re committed for the long haul.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/18/does-long-term-care-insurance-at-a-young-age-make-sense/', 'snippet': 'Younger people are buying long-term care insurance, but there are many risks for those who are not certain they’re committed for the long haul.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The average age of people buying long-term care insurance has been falling, as people seek to balance the possible need for nursing home or in-home care with the considerable cost of the insurance premiums. Even some very young people are buying the insurance, and a few of them are making claims under their policies, according to an industry group.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Does Long-Term Care Insurance at a Young Age Make Sense?', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Care Policies Bought Early', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Long-Term Care Insurance', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'American Association for Long-Term Care Insurance', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-18T16:00:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e5988e2e-23ab-5cf1-ae08-aee3ccf28965', 'word_count': 645, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e5988e2e-23ab-5cf1-ae08-aee3ccf28965'}, {'abstract': 'When Thomas Gibbons-Neff got back from Afghanistan and into Georgetown, he came to understand that the battle was not over.', 'web_url': 'https://atwar.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/18/for-a-student-veteran-graduation-is-the-next-mission/', 'snippet': 'When Thomas Gibbons-Neff got back from Afghanistan and into Georgetown, he came to understand that the battle was not over.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was the fall of 2011, and I was the quintessential fresh-out-of-the-fleet 23-year-old Marine. I was preparing for Georgetown University’s New Student Orientation, my first official re-entry into academia and a day of assemblies and awkward greetings with a bunch of kids who would have been barely teenagers when I was spending my first weeks in Afghanistan. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For a Student Veteran, Graduation Is the Next Mission', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veterans', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Georgetown University', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Marine Corps', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Helmand Province (Afghanistan)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-18T16:00:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas Gibbons-Neff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gibbons-Neff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3da70477-5239-5e76-a3c4-ee1d5d98defd', 'word_count': 894, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3da70477-5239-5e76-a3c4-ee1d5d98defd'}, {'abstract': 'A Presbyterian minister writes about reducing violence and rifts arising from religious differences. Readers are invited to respond.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/19/opinion/invitation-to-a-dialogue-the-faith-divide.html', 'snippet': 'A Presbyterian minister writes about reducing violence and rifts arising from religious differences. Readers a