', '_id': 'nyt://article/e9f573c0-f685-549b-9db2-f25d5cc2c2ae', 'word_count': 198, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e9f573c0-f685-549b-9db2-f25d5cc2c2ae'}, {'abstract': 'Turning the rich against the poor is Mr. Romney’s campaign tactic and his plan for governing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/19/opinion/mitt-romney-class-warrior.html', 'snippet': 'Turning the rich against the poor is Mr. Romney’s campaign tactic and his plan for governing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It turns out that Mitt Romney was right. There is class warfare being waged in the 2012 campaign. It is Mr. Romney who is waging it, not President Obama, and he’s stood the whole idea on its head.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mitt Romney, Class Warrior', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mitt Romney, Class Warrior', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mother Jones', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings and Downloads', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Tax', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-18T20:07:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/6c932458-b72a-541d-b5db-1954da811f63', 'word_count': 843, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6c932458-b72a-541d-b5db-1954da811f63'}, {'abstract': 'Accessories make the street-style look. So let’s pick up some of their tricks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/09/20/fashion/20120920_BROWSING.html', 'snippet': 'Accessories make t