 'Three dancers and a former Times critic will be honored in December.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dance Magazine has named the winners of its annual lifetime achievement awards. They are Julie Kent, a principal dancer at American Ballet Theater; Renee Robinson, a member of the Alvin Ailey company since 1981; the tap dancer Dianne Walker; and the former New York Times dance critic Anna Kisselgoff. The honors will be bestowed on Dec. 3 at the Ailey Citigroup Theater.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dance Magazine Names Lifetime Achievement Award Winners', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Dance Magazine', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-18T21:23:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daniel J. Wakin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniel', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Wakin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/57278f1d-4cbe-5e2b-8397-0ab2f1417b67', 'word_count': 62, 'uri': 'nyt://article/57278f1d-4cbe-5e2b-8397-0ab2f1417b67'}, {'abstract': 'A view of the day in sports, including an electrifying soccer match between Real Madrid and Manchester City and women’s cycling.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/09/18/sports/20120918photoreplay.html', 'snippet': 'A view of the day in sports, including an electrifying soccer match between Real Madrid and Manchester City and women’s cycling.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A view of the day in sports, including an electrifying soccer match between Real Madrid and Manchester City and women’s cycling.', 'source':