nd conceptual design.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A show featuring the work of Tobias Wong, a straddler between the worlds of art and conceptual design, will open Wednesday at the Museum of Vancouver, in British Columbia. Mr. Wong, who\xa0took his own life in 2010 in New York City at age 35, was born and\xa0raised in Vancouver. Several of his trademark provocative objects have been displayed\xa0at the Museum of Modern Art and the San Francisco Museum of Modern Art, but this\xa0will be the first exhibition devoted exclusively to his creations, said\xa0the show’s\xa0curator, Todd Falkowsky.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/18/garden/18showspic/18showspic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 367, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/18/garden/18showspic/18showspic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 367}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/18/garden/18showspic/18showspic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 661, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/18/garden/18showspic/18showspic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1322, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/18/garden/18showspic/18showspic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/18/garden/18showspic/18showspic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/18/garden/1