nt with the work of the replacement officials.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. – The N.F.L.’s lockout of its regular officials has not had any obvious impact on the outcome of a Giants game. That is not keeping the team’s players from becoming increasingly impatient with the use of replacements who have worked at lower levels and are not accustomed to the speed of the pro game.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Giants Criticize Replacement Officials', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-18T22:16:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tom Pedulla', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tom', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pedulla', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2c34f011-0031-5c84-8919-a6ab940b156a', 'word_count': 326, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2c34f011-0031-5c84-8919-a6ab940b156a'}, {'abstract': 'Kanye West is a busy guy, and the album “Cruel Summer” demonstrates the range of his distractions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/19/arts/music/kanye-west-and-the-album-cruel-summer.html', 'snippet': 'Kanye West is a busy guy, and the album “Cruel Summer” demonstrates the range of his distractions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Forgive Kanye West: he’s been terribly distracted. There’s the immersion in the fashion world: “Dinner with Anna Wintour/Racing with Anja Rubik.” There’s his sneaker line with Nike: “Hold up, I ain’t trying to stunt, man/But the Yeezys jumped over the Jumpman.” There’s the still unrealized creative aspirations: “I just meditate,” he raps, “about how I could build a new Rome in one day.” And of course, there’s the new girlfriend, Kim Kardashian: “My girl a superstar all from a home movie.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/19/arts/GOOD/GOOD-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 671, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/19/arts/GOOD/GOOD-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1342, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/19/arts/GOOD/GOOD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/19/arts/GOOD/GOOD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/19/arts/GOOD/GOOD-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Man Who’s Everywhere May Really Be Nowhere', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Man Who’s Everywhere May Really Be Nowhere', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rap and Hip-Hop', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'West, Kanye', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-18T22:19:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jon Caramanica', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Caramanica', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None,