lem.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/18/a-mood-of-gloom-afflicts-the-romney-campaign/', 'snippet': 'A dark mood descends on the Romney campaign as it lurches from problem to problem.', 'lead_paragraph': '8:42 p.m. | Updated SALT LAKE CITY – Mitt Romney’s traveling press secretary walked to the back of the candidate’s plane midflight on Tuesday and teasingly asked a pair of journalists in an exit row if they were “willing and able to assist in case of an emergency.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Mood of Gloom Afflicts the Romney Campaign', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings and Downloads', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-18T23:34:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Barbaro', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barbaro', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d652ac7f-ab0d-5c8b-ba95-6d9715aa1a69', 'word_count': 814, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d652ac7f-ab0d-5c8b-ba95-6d9715aa1a69'}, {'abstract': 'Eli Manning allowed himself only a few hours to celebrate Sunday’s victory against the Tampa Bay Buccaneers before focusing on Thursday’s game against the Carolina Panthers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/19/sports/football/eli-manning-moves-on-to-next-opponent.html', 'snippet': 'Eli Manning allowed himself only a few hours to celebrate Sunday’s victory against the Tampa Bay Buccaneers before focusing on Thursday’s game against the C