type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/80fb7daa-a6f9-5656-983d-f2d50d9fa4bb', 'word_count': 756, 'uri': 'nyt://article/80fb7daa-a6f9-5656-983d-f2d50d9fa4bb'}, {'abstract': 'Steve Sabol brought passion, detail and humor to his tales, whether he was explaining a shot or the fitting of Coach Hank Stram for a microphone during a Super Bowl.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/19/sports/football/nfl-loses-steve-sabol-its-loving-filmmaker.html', 'snippet': 'Steve Sabol brought passion, detail and humor to his tales, whether he was explaining a shot or the fitting of Coach Hank Stram for a microphone during a Super Bowl.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The death of Steve Sabol, the president of NFL Films, leaves us with one less storyteller. Yes, he was a cameraman, cinematographer, producer, editor, writer and director — encompassing skills that he and his father, Ed, employed to build a mythmaking apparatus better than the propaganda machines of most nations.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/19/sports/NFLFILMS/NFLFILMS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/19/sports/NFLFILMS/NFLFILMS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/19/sports/NFLFILMS/NFLFILMS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/19/sports/NFLFILMS/NFLFILMS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'N.F.L. Loses Storyteller Who Shaped Sport He Loved