ing scandal have revived the debate about the relationship between academics and athletics.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/19/sports/ncaabasketball/harvard-cheating-scandal-revives-debate-over-athletics.html', 'snippet': 'Reports implicating the co-captains of the school’s basketball team in a widespread cheating scandal have revived the debate about the relationship between academics and athletics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAMBRIDGE, Mass. — Six months ago, the Harvard men’s basketball team was a source of uncommon athletic pride on campus. The team was ranked among the nation’s top 25 for the first time, and when it earned the program’s first berth to the N.C.A.A. tournament in 66 years, students and players spilled into Harvard Square chanting and celebrating.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/19/sports/YJPHARVARD1/YJPHARVARD1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/19/sports/YJPHARVARD1/YJPHARVARD1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/19/sports/YJPHARVARD1/YJPHARVARD1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 699, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/19/sports/YJPHARVARD1/YJPHARVARD1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1398, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cheating Scandal Dulls Pride in Athletics at Harvard', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cheating Dulls Pride In Athletics At Harvard', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organiza