at sets London fashion apart.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Energy. Color. Pattern. These are all the things we’re seeing on the London runways,” says Suzy Menkes, the IHT’s fashion critic. “And what’s exciting here is the way that the prints are done up with digital work and with all sorts of modern techniques.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Suzy Menkes: London Is on a Fashion Roll', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-19T01:56:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By The International Herald Tribune', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The International Herald Tribune'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee636baf-1582-58b8-94bb-83d8e89c42fb', 'word_count': 148, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee636baf-1582-58b8-94bb-83d8e89c42fb'}, {'abstract': 'It’s rich. Mitt Romney thinks poor folks are on Easy Street.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/19/opinion/dowd-let-them-eat-crab-cake.html', 'snippet': 'It’s rich. Mitt Romney thinks poor folks are on Easy Street.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/02/opinion/maureen-dowd/maureen-dowd-articleLarge.png', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/02/opinion/maureen-dowd/maureen-dowd-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/02/opinion/maureen-dowd/maureen-dowd-jumbo.png', 'height': 512, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'ju