 standing as a filmmaking location, and is promoting the use of a local warehouse soundstage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'YONKERS — When it came time to make the movie based on the Neil Simon play “Lost in Yonkers,” the director bypassed the actual city and filmed it mostly in Ohio. But that setback, some 20 years ago, has not deterred officials from claiming that Yonkers is ready for its close-up.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/19/nyregion/YONKERS1/YONKERS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/19/nyregion/YONKERS1/YONKERS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/19/nyregion/YONKERS1/YONKERS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/19/nyregion/YONKERS1/YONKERS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When It Comes to Filmmaking, Yonkers Seeks a Bigger Part', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'When It Comes to Filmmaking, Yonkers Seeks a Bigger Part', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Yonkers Stage', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Spano, Michael J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Yonkers (NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-19T02:05:23+0000', 'docum