imes.com/2012/09/19/indians-clamor-for-credit-for-the-bose-in-boson/', 'snippet': 'Some Indians are asking, with a straight face, that the “boson” in “Higgs boson” be capitalized to honor the work of the Indian physicist Satyendra Nath Bose.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DELHI — Calcutta — or “Kolkata,” as we are now told to spell it — is the most self-consciously intellectual and parochial of Indian cities. Given that Indians in general live with a belief, often unsupported by empirical evidence, in their intellectual superiority, the subject of Bengali geniuses can be especially touchy. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Bose in the Boson', 'kicker': 'Latitude', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Higgs Boson', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Physics', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Science and Technology', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bose, Satyendra Nath', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Calcutta (India)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-19T08:15:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hartosh Singh Bal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hartosh', 'middlename': 'Singh', 'lastname': 'Bal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5729c295-e708-5c43-91cd-1972408fb404', 'word_count': 597, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5729c295-e708-5c43-91cd-1972408fb404'}, {'abstract': 'Can you calculate the amount of taxes paid by casinos in Louisiana if given the total revenue and percentage paid in taxes to the state and local governments?', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/19/test-yourself-math-sept-19-2012/', 'snippet': 'Can you calculate th