-48c6-5e32-ac85-9fbc8deb3e8b'}, {'abstract': 'Eli Manning may be the best in the league at throwing with a defender in his face. He loses none of his arm strength and accuracy under pressure.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/19/week-2-film-review-elis-toughness/', 'snippet': 'Eli Manning may be the best in the league at throwing with a defender in his face. He loses none of his arm strength and accuracy under pressure.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Andy Benoit takes a closer look at some games from Week 2, with the benefit of film analysis:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Week 2 Film Review: Eli’s Toughness', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manning, Eli', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-19T11:00:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andy Benoit', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Benoit', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1906e4db-a2b3-568b-90ab-15e07b44f8bc', 'word_count': 951, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1906e4db-a2b3-568b-90ab-15e07b44f8bc'}, {'abstract': 'Did Sean Tice and Kristy Hadeka make the right decision whey they refused to trade 5 percent of Brooklyn Slate for an appearance on the reality show?', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/19/passing-up-the-opportunity-to-appear-on-shark-tank/', 'snippet': 'Did Sean Tice and Kristy Hadeka make the right decision whey they refused to trade 5 percent of Brooklyn Slate for an appearance on the reality show?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last week, I met with two entrepreneurs from a growing company called Brooklyn Slate.\xa0Sean Tice and Kristy Hadeka, whose company makes cheese boards out of slate, shared their stories with me, and many of them\xa0 would have sounded familiar to anyone who has struggled to build a business. But there was one story that I had not heard. Mr. Tice and Ms. Hadeka had come close to appearing on the ABC reality show “Shark Tank,” where entrepreneurs pitch their companies to a group of wealthy investors, including\xa0Mark Cuban, the owner of the Dallas Mavericks.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Passing Up the Opportunity to Appear on ‘Shark Tank’', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Entrepreneurship', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Corcoran, Barbara', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuban, Mark', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brooklyn Slate Co', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-19T11:00:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ami Kassar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ami', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kassar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee141260-0c1f-50ea-9138-ed351b5b0af9', 'word_count': 940, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee141260-0c1f-50ea-9138-ed351b5b0af9'}, {'abstract': 'The Dutch brewer moved a step closer on Wednesday to securing the rights in Asia Pacific Breweries that it did not already own after a major shareholder backed the proposed $4.6 billion deal.', 'web_url': 'http