d\xa0clever execution, these two new picture books stand apart from the rest of the cat pack.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/20/books/20childrens/20childrens-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 367, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/20/books/20childrens/20childrens-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 367}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/20/books/20childrens/20childrens-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 791, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/20/books/20childrens/20childrens-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1583, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/20/books/20childrens/20childrens-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/20/books/20childrens/20childrens-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Two or Three Cats', 'kicker': "Children's Books", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Desmond, Jenni', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Cat Tale (Book)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Red Cat Blue Cat (Book)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-19T14:42:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Books