ney-says-he-can-help-the-poor/', 'snippet': 'The Republican candidate tries to confront the notion that he is not the candidate of the poor and others who are economically challenged.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATLANTA – Mitt Romney on Wednesday confronted the most damaging perception from a secretly taped video: that he had written off those who rely on government assistance.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Romney Says He Can Help the Poor', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-19T20:00:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Barbaro', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barbaro', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0888110c-0d5b-5c0b-8489-fd7a1ba41c66', 'word_count': 208, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0888110c-0d5b-5c0b-8489-fd7a1ba41c66'}, {'abstract': 'It is the band’s sixth consecutive studio album to debut at No. 1, and the first by any group to achieve such a run.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/19/dave-matthews-bands-latest-opens-at-no-1/', 'snippet': 'It is the band’s sixth consecutive studio album to debut at No. 1, and the first by any group to achieve such a run.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Dave Matthews Band leads a wave of new releases taking over the top slots