tract': 'Tim Burton discusses four of the less visible performers who have worked with him frequently over the years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2012/09/19/movies/burton-faces.html', 'snippet': 'Tim Burton discusses four of the less visible performers who have worked with him frequently over the years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tim Burton discusses four of the less visible performers who have worked with him frequently over the years.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Familiar Faces in the Burton House of Horror and Humor', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Burton, Tim', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Price, Vincent', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Elfman, Danny', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lee, Christopher (1922-2015)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-19T20:38:52+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Movies', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/76fe8c26-f9af-5fb7-ba29-d9b6d3a7eb94', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/76fe8c26-f9af-5fb7-ba29-d9b6d3a7eb94'}, {'abstract': 'In this lesson, students learn about a soldier undergoing experimental treatment to help him regrow muscle missing from his leg. Then, students build models to reinforce concepts surrounding cells, tissues, and organs.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/19/out-on-a-limb-building-muscle-models-in-science-class/', 'snippet': 'In this lesson, students learn about a soldier undergoing experimental treatment to help him regrow muscle missing from his leg. Then, students build models to reinforce concepts surrounding cells, tissues, and organs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Overview | Unlike some animals, we cannot regenerate diseased or missing body parts. Or can we? In this lesson, students learn about a soldier undergoing experimental treatment to help him regrow muscle missing from his leg. Then students build models to reinforce concepts surrounding cells, tissues and organs. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Out on a Limb: Building Muscle Models in Science Class', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-19T20:45:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alison Fromme', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alison', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fromme', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c31a157c-bba4-51d6-90fe-97197214b0b8', 'word_count': 1102, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c31a157c-bba4-51d6-90fe-97197214b0b8'}, {'abstract': 'On “Derek,” Mr. Gervais, a creator and star of comedies like “The Office” and “Extras,” and a three-time host of the Golden Globe Awards, plays its title character, a naively simple man who works in a nursing home.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/19/netflix-picks-up-new-ricky-gervais-series-derek/', 'snippet': 'On “Derek,” Mr. Gervais, a creator and star of comedies like “The Office” and “Extras,” and a three-time host of the Golden Globe Awards, plays its title character, a naively simple man who works in a nursing home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ricky Gervais has no need to fear offending viewers of traditional American television with his latest series, because it won’t be broadcast there: Netflix said on Wednesday that it had acquired the rights to show “Derek,” a new comedy program written, directed by and starring Mr. Gervais, following its run on Channel 4 in Britain.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/20/arts/20artsbeat-gervais/20artsbeat-gervais-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 802, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/20/arts/20artsbeat-gervais/20artsbeat-gervais-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1604, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/20/arts/20artsbeat-gervais/20artsbeat-gervais-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/20/arts/20artsbeat-gervais/20artsbeat-gervais-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/20/arts/20artsbeat-gervais/20artsbeat-gervais-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Netflix Picks Up New Ricky Gervais Series ‘Derek’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Netflix Picks Up New Gervais Series', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gervais, Ricky', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Netflix Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-19T20:47:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organizatio