'abstract': 'With mobile apps eliminating many of the obstacles to writing daily journal entries, there is no excuse for letting the past slip away.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/20/technology/personaltech/daily-journal-writing-without-the-inconvenience-app-smart.html', 'snippet': 'With mobile apps eliminating many of the obstacles to writing daily journal entries, there is no excuse for letting the past slip away.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Despite being a wordy sort of fellow, I’ve never put pen to paper daily to create a meaningful diary. I did make some tentative attempts when I was an adolescent, sure, but I never got hooked on a journal. With my sievelike memory, this means some precious moments of my past are now hazy. If I had a diary, I’d simply be able to look up what happened.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/20/business/SMART1/SMART1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 710, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/20/business/SMART1/SMART1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1420, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/20/business/SMART1/SMART1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/20/business/SMART1/SMART1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/20/business/SMART1/SMART1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 