hedule.', 'web_url': 'https://slapshot.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/19/exhibition-games-canceled/', 'snippet': 'The owners’ lockout has resulted in the cancellation of the first week of the N.H.L.’s exhibition schedule.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The National Hockey League announced the cancellation of the first week of the two-week exhibition schedule on Wednesday, the first games wiped out by the owners’ lockout imposed last Sunday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Exhibition Games Canceled', 'kicker': 'Slap Shot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sports Briefing | Hockey', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lockouts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Hockey League', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-19T23:07:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8f541432-4dda-5bb1-a7d5-4daf891e90f6', 'word_count': 242, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8f541432-4dda-5bb1-a7d5-4daf891e90f6'}, {'abstract': 'You don’t have to be gay to enjoy this club, just gay friendly.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/20/fashion/this-n-that-a-new-williamsburg-gay-bar.html', 'snippet': 'You don’t have to be gay to enjoy this club, just gay friendly.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NORTH Sixth Street in Williamsburg, Brooklyn, has undergone a remarkable transformation in the last decade, going from an industrial ghost town to a veritable runway of skinny jeans and European clubgoers. Now the latest change has arrived