4882d7'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Zuno was a central defendant in the 1985 torture and killing of Enrique Camarena Salazar, an American drug enforcement agent, in Mexico.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/20/world/americas/ruben-zuno-arce-guilty-in-drug-killing-dies-at-82.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Zuno was a central defendant in the 1985 torture and killing of Enrique Camarena Salazar, an American drug enforcement agent, in Mexico.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rubén Zuno Arce, a central defendant in the 1985 torture and killing of an American drug enforcement agent in Mexico, a crime that increased tension between Mexico and the United States in part because of Mr. Zuno’s ties to Mexican government officials, died on Tuesday in a federal prison in Coleman, Fla. He was 82. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/20/world/ZUNO-obit/ZUNO-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/20/world/ZUNO-obit/ZUNO-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1365, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Rubén Zuno Arce, Guilty in Drug Killing, Dies at 82', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rubén Zuno Arce, Guilty In Drug Killing, Dies at 82', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zuno Arce, Ruben', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mexico', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Drug Enforcement Administration', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Camarena, Enrique', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'n