i': 'nyt://article/32743f76-8077-5e33-bf51-912bc80d6436'}, {'abstract': 'Martellus Bennett, who joined the Giants in the off-season, is a skilled tight end whose talents off the field make him one of the most intriguing players in the N.F.L.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/20/sports/football/giants-martellus-bennett-is-a-tight-end-who-cuts-loose.html', 'snippet': 'Martellus Bennett, who joined the Giants in the off-season, is a skilled tight end whose talents off the field make him one of the most intriguing players in the N.F.L.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Since joining the Giants in the off-season, tight end Martellus Bennett has proved to be a singular character. An outspoken player on a roster known for being almost allergic to controversy, Bennett is also a key part of the Giants’ offensive plans. He is big and athletic and has the potential to become a favorite target for quarterback Eli Manning. But there are so many reasons beyond his raw talent that Bennett is one of the most intriguing players in the N.F.L. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/20/sports/Y-JP-GIANTS-1/Y-JP-GIANTS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/20/sports/Y-JP-GIANTS-1/Y-JP-GIANTS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/20/sports/Y-JP-GIANTS-1/Y-JP-GIANTS-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 751, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/20/sports/Y-JP-GIANTS-1/Y-JP-GIANTS-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1502, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo',