/us/rhode-island-central-falls-mayor-quits-and-is-to-plead-guilty-to-corruption.html', 'snippet': 'Prosecutors say that Mayor Charles D. Moreau directed work boarding up at least 167 properties in the city, buffeted by a wave of foreclosures in exchange for gifts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The mayor of the financially struggling city of Central Falls resigned Wednesday and agreed to plead guilty to federal corruption charges. Prosecutors say that Mayor Charles D. Moreau directed work boarding up at least 167 properties in the city, buffeted by a wave of foreclosures, to a friend and political supporter, Michael G. Bouthillette, in exchange for gifts. Mr. Moreau, a four-term Democrat, was given an advisory role when the city went into receivership in 2010. It went under bankruptcy protection last year, from which it is expected to emerge next month. Mr. Bouthillette was also charged. Prosecutors said they would seek prison time for both men, but did not specify how much.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/20/us/BRIEFS/BRIEFS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 808, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/20/us/BRIEFS/BRIEFS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1464, 'width': 1855, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/20/us/BRIEFS/BRIEFS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/20/us/BRIEFS/BRIEFS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2