orted', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/4fe66879-2230-5be8-b5dc-9da70a62181e', 'word_count': 479, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4fe66879-2230-5be8-b5dc-9da70a62181e'}, {'abstract': 'Charles M. Kavanagh, 75, says a news release by the archdiocese this May implied a pattern of sexual abuse accusations that he says never happened.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/20/nyregion/defrocked-monsignor-charles-kavanagh-sues-new-york-archdiocese-for-libel.html', 'snippet': 'Charles M. Kavanagh, 75, says a news release by the archdiocese this May implied a pattern of sexual abuse accusations that he says never happened.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A once-prominent Roman Catholic monsignor who was removed from the priesthood in 2010 for sexual abuse of a minor took the unusual step on Wednesday of filing a federal lawsuit against the New York Archdiocese, claiming he had been libeled in a church statement. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Defrocked Priest Sues New York Archdiocese for Libel Over Sexual Abuse Statement', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Defrocked Priest Sues New York Archdiocese for Libel Over Sexual Abuse', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Libel and Slander', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Priests', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kavanagh, Charles M', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Abuse and Neglect', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Donohue, Dan', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-20T02