poor got poorer last year as the poverty rate reached its highest point in more than a decade.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/20/nyregion/rich-got-richer-and-poor-poorer-in-nyc-2011-data-shows.html', 'snippet': 'Census figures released Thursday show that the rich got richer and the poor got poorer last year as the poverty rate reached its highest point in more than a decade.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The rich got richer and the poor got poorer in New York City last year as the poverty rate reached its highest point in more than a decade, and the income gap in Manhattan, already wider than almost anywhere else in the country, rivaled disparities in sub-Saharan Africa.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Income Data Shows Widening Gap Between New York City’s Richest and Poorest', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Income Data Shows Widening Gap Between New York City’s Richest and Poorest', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Census', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Inequality', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poverty', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-20T04:02:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Roberts', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Roberts', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b8f4443e-f1f8-5f82-b295-450f12a5e3a3', 'word_count': 601, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b8f4443e-f1f8-5f82-b295-450f12a5e3a3'}, {'abstract': 'The Democrats’ chances of controlling the S