ly-expect-your-business-to-get-you-through-retirement/', 'snippet': 'If so, you might want to consider these three strategies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’ve been speaking with and working with private business owners for more than 15 years. Most owners have a dream of running their business for their working career, finding a buyer and then riding off into the sunset with no other planning.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Do You Really Expect Your Business to Get You Through Retirement?', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Retirement', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Small Business Administration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-20T11:00:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Josh Patrick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Josh', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Patrick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6373b61c-d97f-52a3-931b-caf5c4b37497', 'word_count': 829, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6373b61c-d97f-52a3-931b-caf5c4b37497'}, {'abstract': 'Photographs from an island on the brink.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/09/23/magazine/cuba-andrew-moore.html', 'snippet': 'Photographs from an island on the brink.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Photographs from an island on the brink.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/23/magazine/23cuba_ss-slide-34