https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/20/on-our-radar-cuomos-fracking-deliberations/', 'snippet': 'A group seeks records from the New York State Department of Environmental Conservation and the governor’s office related to their decision-making process on the drilling.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An environmental group sues the Cuomo administration to secure the release of documents that would shed more light on how the state drafted its plan to permit high-volume hydraulic fracturing for shale gas. It wants full disclosure of public records on communications between the governor, six other senior officials and representatives of the oil and natural gas industry. [Environmental Working Group]', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'On Our Radar: Cuomo’s Fracking Deliberations', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Environment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hydraulic Fracturing', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Natural Gas', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Offshore Drilling and Exploration', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Public Broadcasting', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Muller, Richard', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Environmental Working Group', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mother Nature Network', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Public Broadcasting Service', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-20T11:49:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By Th