a, will be resolved on Friday at a public hearing without formal charges of wrongdoing, two parties with direct knowledge of the matter said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A long-running ethics investigation of Representative Maxine Waters, Democrat of California, will be resolved on Friday at a rare House ethics committee public hearing and two parties with direct knowledge of the matter said they expect it to conclude without formal charges of wrongdoing.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Waters Ethics Investigation Will Not Result in Formal Charges', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Waters Ethics Investigation Will Get a Public Hearing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ethics (Institutional)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Waters, Maxine', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House Committee on Ethics', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-20T19:24:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Lipton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lipton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/afb060a8-1f15-543a-ac83-1c29276e5d6c', 'word_count': 609, 'uri': 'nyt://article/afb060a8-1f15-543a-ac83-1c29276e5d6c'}, {'abstract': 'Darrelle Revis was cleared for contact Thursday after missing last week’s game with a concussion, but Jets coach Rex Ryan would not say if Revis would play Sunday against the Dolphins.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/21/sports/football/doctors-clear-jets-cornerback-darrelle-revis-for-contact.html', 'snippet': 'Darrelle Revis was cleared for contact Thursday after missing last week’s game with a concussion, but Jets coach Rex Ryan would not say if Revis would play Sunday against the Dolphins.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FLORHAM PARK, N.J. — Jets cornerback Darrelle Revis was cleared for contact Thursday, and his coaches and teammates all but had a party. He participated full-speed at practice, jamming receivers for the first time in 11 days — and enjoying it.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/21/sports/jets/jets-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 915, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/21/sports/jets/jets-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1936, 'width': 1729, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/21/sports/jets/jets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/21/sports/jets/jets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/21/sports/jets/jets-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Doctors Clear Jets Cornerback for Contact', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Doctors Clear Jets Cornerback for Contact', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Revis, Darrelle', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Concussions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ryan, Rex', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-20T19:27:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Caldwell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Caldwell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ab704fa0-8c51-5f90-9e07-2517a692e837', 'word_count': 699, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ab704fa0-8c51-5f90-9e07-2517a692e837'}, {'abstract': 'Danh Vo’s “We the People” project is a re-creation of the Statue of Liberty that is being displayed in Chicago.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/23/arts/design/danh-vos-we-the-people-project-in-chicago.html', 'snippet': 'Danh Vo’s “We the People” project is a re-creation of the Statue of Liberty that is being displayed in Chicago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OVER the past two years Danh Vo has been recasting a life-size Statue of Liberty from 30 tons of copper sheets the width of just two pennies — same as the original. Rather than assemble the hundreds of sections, Mr. Vo has shipped the giant elements — disorienting in their gleaming raw material and fragmentation — to some 15 sites around the world after they roll off the production line in China. Starting Sunday an ear, some hair, part of a heel and portions of drapery will be on view at the Art Institute of Chicago while more pieces that echo both minimalist sculptures and remnants from antiquity are scattered around the campus of the University of Chicago. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption