agraph': 'The mad dash by the world’s largest advertising holding groups to beef up their digital assets continued on Thursday as the Publicis Groupe, based in Paris, announced it had acquired\xa0 LBi, a big digital agency based in Amsterdam. In the all-cash deal, Publicis spent 416 million euros, or about $540 million, to buy the shares of LBi.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Publicis Groupe Buys LBi, and Another Digital Ad Agency Is Swallowed Up', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Levy, Maurice', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Publicis Groupe', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-20T21:01:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stuart Elliott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stuart', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Elliott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c73aac85-b123-55ad-be7d-cb1aa8b9a239', 'word_count': 240, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c73aac85-b123-55ad-be7d-cb1aa8b9a239'}, {'abstract': 'A selected, critical guide to plays running in New York, with special note of productions in previews or opening.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/21/theater/theater-listings-for-sept-21-27.html', 'snippet': 'A selected, critical guide to plays running in New York, with special note of productions in previews or opening.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Theater', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xl