 888, 'uri': 'nyt://article/29825b57-3116-5677-9053-e9eecd445c2e'}, {'abstract': 'Government restrictions on religion around the world were highest in the Middle East and North Africa, particularly in the period before the Arab Spring uprisings, a Pew study found.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/21/world/restrictions-on-religion-are-tightening-study-finds.html', 'snippet': 'Government restrictions on religion around the world were highest in the Middle East and North Africa, particularly in the period before the Arab Spring uprisings, a Pew study found.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DAKAR, Senegal — Government restrictions on religion around the world were highest in the Middle East and North Africa, particularly in the period before the Arab Spring uprisings, a new study has found, underscoring a factor that fueled hostilities in the region and led to the rise of political Islam after the revolts.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Restrictions on Religion Are Tightening, Study Finds', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Curbs Found Tightening On Religion', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pew Research Center', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Middle East', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Religion and Belief', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Religion-State Relations', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Yemen', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tunisia', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': '