ons', 'value': 'Immordino Vreeland, Lisa', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-21T00:06:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Manohla Dargis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Manohla', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dargis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/f8d596ce-76b2-560a-b587-f8c8b6909d76', 'word_count': 644, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f8d596ce-76b2-560a-b587-f8c8b6909d76'}, {'abstract': 'In a 5-to-2 vote, the Taxi and Limousine Commission adopted the standards for the Nissan NV200, which medallion owners will be required to buy beginning late next year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/21/nyregion/taxi-commission-passes-standards-for-new-type-of-cab.html', 'snippet': 'In a 5-to-2 vote, the Taxi and Limousine Commission adopted the standards for the Nissan NV200, which medallion owners will be required to buy beginning late next year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York’s Taxi and Limousine Commission approved a set of standards on Thursday governing its so-called Taxi of Tomorrow, the latest step toward a nearly uniform yellow-taxi fleet in the city. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Panel Approves Standards for City’s New Type of Taxi', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Panel Approves Standards For City’s New Type of Taxi', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxicabs and Taxicab Drivers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taxi and Limousine Commission', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nissan Motor Co', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-21T00:10:04+0