graphic film industry after she moves to San Francisco.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/21/movies/about-cherry-starring-james-franco-and-ashley-hinshaw.html', 'snippet': '“About Cherry” follows a California teenager who falls into the pornographic film industry after she moves to San Francisco.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An insider’s view of the pornographic film industry filtered through the perspective of Angelina (Ashley Hinshaw) — a beautiful, fresh-faced 18-year-old who moves from Long Beach, Calif., to San Francisco — “About Cherry” is eerily devoid of judgment or any kind of analysis. As “Cherry” (her screen name) advances from erotic photographs to girl-on-girl action to boy-girl films to director, she remains preternaturally blasé. “It’s my job,” she responds to all naysayers. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/21/arts/21ABOUTCHERRY_SPAN/21ABOUTCHERRY_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/21/arts/21ABOUTCHERRY_SPAN/21ABOUTCHERRY_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/21/arts/21ABOUTCHERRY_SPAN/ABOUTCHERRY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 950, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/21/arts/21ABOUTCHERRY_SPAN/ABOUTCHERRY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1965, 'width': 1823, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/21/arts/21ABOUTCHERRY_SPAN/21ABOUTCHERRY_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75,