or his portrayal of Mark Zuckerberg in “The Social Network,” will also star in the three-character play, which will be directed by Kip Fagan and staged by the Rattlestick Playwrights Theater. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Vanessa Redgrave to Star With Jesse Eisenberg in His New Play', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Vanessa Redgrave Joins ‘The Revisionist’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Eisenberg, Jesse', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Redgrave, Vanessa', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cherry Lane Theater', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-21T01:00:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4e0f979a-bb3b-5936-bd89-5a7c91fa2288', 'word_count': 246, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4e0f979a-bb3b-5936-bd89-5a7c91fa2288'}, {'abstract': 'What’s missing in New York City is a seasonal fog, the kind that foretells autumn.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/21/opinion/season-of-mists-if-not-in-manhattan.html', 'snippet': 'What’s missing in New York City is a seasonal fog, the kind that foretells autumn.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York City delivers plenty of weather, but never enough fog. Everything west of the Hudson sometimes blurs in a brown summer haze, and there is the steam that rises from rain falling on hot summer streets. But fog, not so much. We don’t mean an old-fashioned London fog, which must have felt like cold exhaust from some infernal smelter. Nor do we mean the soul-dampening eider-fog that blankets the coast of Maine or the banks of low battleship gray clouds that devour June in parts of Southern California. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Season of Mists, if Not in Manhattan', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Season of Mists, if Not in Manhattan', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Autumn (Season)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Seasons and Months', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weather', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-21T01:00:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/e8ee23bd-19b3-51e9-aad4-152c4c266739', 'word_count': 301, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e8ee23bd-19b3-51e9-aad4-152c4c266739'}, {'abstract': 'Italians who thought they had seen everything when it came to politics were taken aback when photographs were published of regional officials having a “return of Ulysses” party.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/21/world/europe/officials-toga-party-irks-scandal-weary-italians.html', 'snippet': 'Italians who thought they had seen everything when it came to politics were taken aback when photographs were published of regional officials having a “return of Ulysses” party.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ROME — In this ancient city, most citizens view their politicians with a time-honored, world-weary disdain. But this week, images of regional officials cavorting at a toga party with a “return of Ulysses” theme have tested the patience of even Europe’s most cynical voters.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For Scandal-Weary Italians, Another Scandal', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Scandal-Weary Italians, Another Scandal', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Italy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Rome (Italy)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Embezzlement', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-21T01:02:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rachel Donadio and Gaia Pianigiani', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rachel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Donadio', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Gaia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pianigiani', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/51ae5871-7946-5423-b5a2-9aacc80310fb', 'word_count': 643, 'uri': 'nyt://article/51ae5871-7946-5423-b5a2-9aacc80310fb'}, {'abstract': 'After the first round of the Tour Championship, Tiger Woods was tied for the lead with Justin Rose at four under par. The world No. 1 golfer, Rory McIlroy, trailed Woods by three strokes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/21/sports/golf/woods-leads-mcilroy-after-first-day-of-tour-championship.html', 'snippet': 'After the first round of the Tour Championship, Tiger Woods was tied for the lead with Justin Rose at four under par. The world No. 1 golfer, Rory McIlroy, trailed Woods by three strokes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATLANTA — The player with the swashbuckler’s walk was approaching the final green Thursday when a fan cried out, “Come on, Ray Lewis.” ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 