nyregion/midtown-rally-by-americans-for-prosperity-aims-at-occupy-wall-street.html', 'snippet': 'Americans for Prosperity, a group inspired by the Tea Party and founded by billionaires, rallied to defend the wealthy and call for change.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Three days after the Occupy Wall Street movement marked its first anniversary, a couple of dozen opponents responded on Thursday, staging a brief but rowdy morning rally on a sidewalk in Midtown Manhattan. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/21/nyregion/OWS/OWS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/21/nyregion/OWS/OWS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/21/nyregion/OWS/OWS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 988, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/21/nyregion/OWS/OWS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1975, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/21/nyregion/OWS/OWS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Midtown, Taking Aim at Occupy Wall St. and Obama', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Midtown, Taking Aim at Occupy Wall St. and Obama', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Occupy Wall Street', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Ri