5dee87'}, {'abstract': 'The Yankees still count on Mark Teixeira and C. C. Sabathia three years after they helped the team win the World Series. But neither, for the moment, is quite the same.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/21/sports/baseball/questions-surround-teixeira-and-sabathia-for-yankees.html', 'snippet': 'The Yankees still count on Mark Teixeira and C. C. Sabathia three years after they helped the team win the World Series. But neither, for the moment, is quite the same.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Look around baseball, and you appreciate more and more what the Yankees did in 2009. They spent big on three free agents before that season — C. C. Sabathia, Mark Teixeira and A. J. Burnett — and immediately won the World Series.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/21/sports/sub-y-kepner/sub-y-kepner-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/21/sports/sub-y-kepner/sub-y-kepner-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/21/sports/sub-y-kepner/sub-y-kepner-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 715, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/21/sports/sub-y-kepner/sub-y-kepner-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1430, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/21/sports/sub-y-kepner/sub-y-kepner-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/