aived by five N.F.L. teams but never wavered.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Andre Brown refused to take the hint. \xa0Teams kept saying goodbye, and he kept saying hello.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Giants’ Andre Brown Says Hello', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Andre', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-21T11:29:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Toni Monkovic', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Toni', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Monkovic', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4f7a7f15-7f42-5382-8f07-da01fb223529', 'word_count': 265, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4f7a7f15-7f42-5382-8f07-da01fb223529'}, {'abstract': 'Ajay Jakhar, a farmer in Punjab says India’s new retail policy does not do enough for farmers.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/21/indian-farmer-group-says-foreign-retailers-not-a-big-blessing/', 'snippet': 'Ajay Jakhar, a farmer in Punjab says India’s new retail policy does not do enough for farmers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Friday, a day after it formally allowed foreign retailers into the country, the Indian government took out full-page ads in many newspapers proclaiming that the move would result in “better prices to farmers,” or in other words higher farm incomes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Indian Farmer Group Says Foreign Retailers ‘Not a Big Blessing’', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo