t. That may sound small, but many New Yorkers already live quite contentedly in cubbyholes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/23/realestate/living-large-in-tiny-spaces.html', 'snippet': 'New York City will soon choose an architect to design micro-units of under 300 square feet. That may sound small, but many New Yorkers already live quite contentedly in cubbyholes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN July, when Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg announced his competition to create a building of residential “micro-units” in Manhattan, each ranging from 275 to 300 square feet, the plan ignited the imagination of countless architects and developers.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/23/realestate/23COVER1_SPAN/23-COVER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/23/realestate/23COVER1_SPAN/23-COVER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/23/realestate/23COVER1_SPAN/23-COVER1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/23/realestate/23COVER1_SPAN/23-COVER1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/23/realestate/23COVER1_SPAN/23-COVER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/23/realestate/23COVER1_SPAN/23-COVER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnail