, one is tired of life.) Abby and Jane prevailed, of course, and Tanvi Chheda was dispatched to produce a guide to the region. This August, as I drove up Highway 1, I followed Chheda’s suggestions to the word — and the olive oil and the apricot. It was a gift. I saw an area I have taken for granted my whole life (in that way natives do) in an utterly gorgeous, entirely new light.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/23/t-magazine/23edletter/23edletter-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 650, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/23/t-magazine/23edletter/23edletter-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1300, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/23/t-magazine/23edletter/23edletter-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/23/t-magazine/23edletter/23edletter-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/23/t-magazine/23edletter/23edletter-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Editor’s Letter', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Editor’s Letter', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-21T19:47:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sally Singer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sally', 'mid