', 'snippet': 'The Houston DJ and record executive OG Ron C gives Frank Ocean’s acclaimed debut album, “Channel Orange,” the chopped-and-screwed subgenre treatment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a new mixtape, the Houston DJ and record executive OG Ron C gives Frank Ocean’s acclaimed debut album, “Channel Orange,” the chopped-and-screwed subgenre treatment. Called “Channel Purple,” the remix slices and dices the music, slows it to a crawl and stretches it out like rubber. The artist Andrew Kuo charts his reaction. (Frank Ocean performs at the I’ll Be Your Mirror festival, presented by All Tomorrow’s Parties, at Pier 36 in New York on Friday night.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Charting OG Ron C on Frank Ocean', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ocean, Frank', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-21T20:45:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Kuo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kuo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ef491608-f48e-5a0e-a276-d035be5e1f94', 'word_count': 77, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ef491608-f48e-5a0e-a276-d035be5e1f94'}, {'abstract': 'The final debate between John McCain and Barack Obama. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/multimedia/100000001798786/final-debate-mccain-and-obama.html', 'snippet': 'The final debate between John McCain and Barack Obama. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'The final debate between John McCain and Barack Obama. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2008/10/15/multimedia/video-finaldebate/video-finaldebate-articleLarge.jpg