keep up with climate change.', 'web_url': 'https://dotearth.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/21/glacier-retreat-prompts-vatican-approval-of-new-alpine-ice-prayer/', 'snippet': 'Swiss villagers convinced the Vatican to allow them to change a glacier prayer to keep up with climate change.', 'lead_paragraph': '5:30 p.m. | Updated with a tweet |Jack Cushman, a Times journalist with a longstanding interest in the environment, just sent me a recent National Geographic web feature on a Vatican decision, prompted by the warming climate, to approve a change in a centuries-old annual Catholic ritual and prayer in a couple of villages high in the Swiss Alps. The longstanding rite was aimed at stopping the rapid advance of nearby glaciers during a period now called the Little Ice Age. Now, with the glaciers rapidly retreating, the revised prayer speaks of the value of the ice. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Glacier Retreat Prompts Vatican Approval of New Alpine Ice Prayer', 'kicker': 'Dot Earth', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'History (Academic Subject)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALPS MOUNTAINS', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Switzerland', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-21T21:09:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew C. Revkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Revkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/19ce1cdb-40a8-56a3-ae95-d2bae731054d', 'word_count': 556, 'uri': 'nyt://article