tml', 'snippet': 'According to the executive chef, Timothy Scott, Geronimo in New Haven serves the cuisine of Santa Fe, N.M., with Apache, Navajo, Mexican and Anglo-American influences.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE bar scene at Geronimo Tequila Bar and Southwest Grill in New Haven is exuberant. The restaurant sells more than 300 varieties of tequila and 27 of mezcal, and excellent margaritas are downed by the glass or the pitcher in a dizzying array of flavors and shades. A lively buzz spills from the spacious patio bar, and an arriving stranger — already cheery — greeted me with a hug as I departed one weekday evening. Can such a place also offer good food? Not every dish is a winner, but many are sensational.', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/23/nyregion/23DINECT1/23DINECT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/23/nyregion/23DINECT1/23DINECT1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/23/nyregion/23DINECT1/23DINECT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/23/nyregion/23DINECT1/23DINECT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/23/nyregion/23DINECT1/23DINECT1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Mix of Influences From the Southwest',