t': 'The lower house of Parliament approved the measure, which characterizes acts that undermine “constitutional order, sovereignty and territorial and state integrity” as high treason.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — Russia’s lower house of Parliament on Friday unanimously approved amendments substantially broadening the legal definition of high treason, so it applies not only to acts that jeopardize state security but also to those that undermine “constitutional order, sovereignty, and territorial and state integrity.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Russia Moves to Broaden Definition of High Treason', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Russia Moves to Redefine Treason', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Treason', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-21T23:37:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ellen Barry', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ellen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barry', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2244ecfd-afa5-5639-ac22-1b9ef38f7a9f', 'word_count': 292, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2244ecfd-afa5-5639-ac22-1b9ef38f7a9f'}, {'abstract': 'A few wines from Long Island are being sold in magnums, and one producer is bottling wine by the liter.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/23/nyregion/when-long-island-vintners-dare-to-go-with-bigger-bottles.html', 'snippet': 'A few wines from Long Island are being sold in magnums, and one producer is bottling wine by the liter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Most wines made on Long Island are sold in a standard 750-milliliter bottle; larger bottles are a low priority for most vintners there because they tend to be costly and sell slowly when they contain premium wines. A few wines made on the Island, however, are sold in magnums, which contain one and a half liters, and one producer is bottling wine by the liter. ', 'print_section': 'LI', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bigger Bottles Find Their Place', 'kicker': 'Long Island Vines', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bigger Bottles Find Their Place', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Long Island (NY)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wines', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-21T23:38:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Howard G. Goldberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Howard', 'middlename': 'G.', 'lastname': 'Goldberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/b0374806-6863-5635-bae3-f2674cb50703', 'word_count': 314, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b0374806-6863-5635-bae3-f2674cb50703'}, {'abstract': 'Four Long Island University basketball players, including last season’s Northeast Conference player of the year, have been suspended from the team indefinitely after being arrested Thursday night.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/22/sports/ncaabasketball/liu-players-suspended-after-being-accused-of-assault.html', 'snippet': 'Four Long Island University basketball players, including last season’s Northeast Conference player of the year, have been suspended from the team indefinitely after being arrested Thursday night.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Four Long Island University basketball players, including last season’s Northeast Confer