 had expected to peer behind the curtain and see an ill-tempered older man with thick glasses, a green eyeshade and a permanent scowl. I was wrong.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/21/a-reporter-friends-his-censor/', 'snippet': 'It was a surreal, Wizard of Oz moment — meeting the Burmese censor of my articles in the International Herald Tribune. I had expected to peer behind the curtain and see an ill-tempered older man with thick glasses, a green eyeshade and a permanent...', 'lead_paragraph': 'YANGON, Myanmar — During more than four years covering Myanmar I’ve always been curious about one particular building in Yangon, the office of the chief censor, a place of fear and mystique for Burmese journalists because they never quite knew what the censors would accept — and what would end up deleted with a thick red marker.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Reporter Meets His Censor', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Censorship', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Myanmar', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-22T00:00:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas Fuller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fuller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1871dbd8-dcde-5fa9-8a45-d18e8feecc82', 'word_count': 441, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1871dbd8-dcde-5fa9-8a45-d18e8feecc82'}, {'abstract': 'Mitt Romney’s 2011 tax returns show that his family trusts had invested in shares of a Chinese-owned state oil company but got rid of those investments this summer, as his anti-Chinese rhetoric heated up.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/21/romneys-family-trust-invested-in-chinese-oil-company/', 'snippet': 'Mitt Romney’s 2011 tax returns show that his family trusts had invested in shares of a Chinese-owned state oil company but got rid of those investments this summer, as his anti-Chinese rhetoric heated up.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On the campaign trail, Mitt Romney has become increasingly critical of China, saying the country is engaging in unfair trade practices and vowing to crack down on them in ways that are much more severe that the current administration.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Romney’s Family Trust Invested in Chinese Oil Company', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CNOOC Ltd', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Credit Suisse Group A.G', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'State Oil Company', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Japan', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-22T00:05:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Floyd Norris and Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Floyd', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Norris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qual