293612-ba10-5daa-afa3-6c6aa046a441'}, {'abstract': 'As Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo considers a 2016 presidential bid, the eyes of the Democratic Party are fixed on Secretary of State Hillary Rodham Clinton, who could count on broad support if she ran.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/22/nyregion/cuomos-presidential-dreams-and-a-clinton-in-the-way.html', 'snippet': 'As Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo considers a 2016 presidential bid, the eyes of the Democratic Party are fixed on Secretary of State Hillary Rodham Clinton, who could count on broad support if she ran.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Since taking office last year, Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo has done many things well, positioning himself for a possible presidential run. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/22/nyregion/CUOMO/CUOMO-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/22/nyregion/CUOMO/CUOMO-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/22/nyregion/CUOMO/CUOMO-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/22/nyregion/CUOMO/CUOMO-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/22/nyregion/CUOMO/CUOMO-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Ambitious Governor, a Clinton Stands in the Way', 'kicker': 'Political Memo', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Ambitious Governor, a Clinton Stands in the Way', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Bill', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-22T00:51:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Raymond Hernandez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Raymond', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hernandez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/97fc56e5-e1f8-5114-9eb9-e13e3f11eec7', 'word_count': 779, 'uri': 'nyt://article/97fc56e5-e1f8-5114-9eb9-e13e3f11eec7'}, {'abstract': 'The closing of Interstate 405 in Los Angeles last year did not result in the nightmare that was expected, but officials fear they will not be so lucky this time.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/22/us/los-angeles-prepares-for-carmageddon-sequel.html', 'snippet': 'The closing of Interstate 405 in Los Angeles last year did not result in the nightmare that was expected, but officials fear they will not be so lucky this time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — One year ago, a 10-mile stretch of Interstate 405 — the most heavily traveled highway in the nation, and the not-so-proud symbol of the Los Angeles traffic jam — was shut down for most of a weekend. The city went on full alert. Emergency worker