'snippet': 'A day after a 16-1 loss to the Phillies, the Mets beat the Marlins in a stumbling display of baseball that ended a 9-game home losing streak.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Miami Marlins came to Queens on Friday night a walking, stumbling example for anxious Mets fans of how much worse the game of baseball can be played. The Mets, enjoying a much-needed reprieve from major league competition, broke a streak of nine consecutive home losses with a 7-3 win.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/22/sports/citifielld/citifielld-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 922, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/22/sports/citifielld/citifielld-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1732, 'width': 1559, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/22/sports/citifielld/citifielld-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/22/sports/citifielld/citifielld-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/22/sports/citifielld/citifielld-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mets End Home Losing Streak ', 'kicker': 'Mets 7, Marlins 3', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mets End Home Losing Streak', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Miami Marlins', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value