 army of personal assistants to help with daily tasks. But this new on-demand economy is making one user a bit uncomfortable.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN San Francisco recently, I was running late for a meeting, desperate for a ride. But no buses or cabs were in sight.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/23/business/23-BITS/23-BITS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 779, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/23/business/23-BITS/23-BITS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1559, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/23/business/23-BITS/23-BITS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/23/business/23-BITS/23-BITS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/23/business/23-BITS/23-BITS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Commander of the Apps, Except the One for Guilt', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Commander of the Apps, Except the One for Guilt', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smartphones', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-22T18:36:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'SundayBusiness', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'origin