urs 43 minutes to complete.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/23/sports/baseball/yankees-defeat-athletics-in-14-weird-and-wild-innings.html', 'snippet': 'Eduardo Nunez hit a ground ball that was misplayed by the Athletics’ first baseman, allowing the winning run to score in a game that took 5 hours 43 minutes to complete.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the game seemed over, Ichiro Suzuki led off the bottom of the 13th inning with an infield single. A misty rain had begun to fall, like the soft spray in a carwash. The low sun through the clouds covered the stadium in a strange orange glow.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/23/sports/baseball/23yankees-1/23yankees-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 953, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/23/sports/baseball/23yankees-1/23yankees-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1906, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/23/sports/baseball/23yankees-1/23yankees-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/23/sports/baseball/23yankees-1/23yankees-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/23/sports/baseball/23yankees-1/23yankees-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Fighting for First, for as Long as It Takes', 'kicker': 'Yankees 10, Athletics 9, 14 Innings', 'con