f424-c5a3-56de-a0d7-602668a51807'}, {'abstract': 'At an event for Allan Houston’s Father Knows Best program, Iman Shumpert, who tore the anterior cruciate ligament and the lateral meniscus in his left knee last season, was not wearing a brace and said his rehabilitation was going well.', 'web_url': 'https://offthedribble.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/22/shumpert-walking-without-limp-says-he-is-feeling-fine/', 'snippet': 'At an event for Allan Houston’s Father Knows Best program, Iman Shumpert, who tore the anterior cruciate ligament and the lateral meniscus in his left knee last season, was not wearing a brace and said his rehabilitation was going well.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The first guest speaker for Allan Houston’s Five Borough Basketball Tour was Knicks guard Iman Shumpert. When he was introduced, Shumpert was cheered by more than 100 children who participated in the event in Brooklyn. Shumpert smiled. He didn’t have a brace on his left knee. And he walked without a limp. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Shumpert, Walking Without Limp, Says He Is Feeling Fine', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Houston, Allan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shumpert, Iman', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-23T00:23:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nate Taylor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Taylor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b99e4ceb-8c3a-5ddb-b9ea-0400e526