tml', 'snippet': 'The New Juilliard Ensemble, led by Joel Sachs, continues to provide important training for students. Saturday’s program dabbled in dissonance, sound art and an exploration of animated films.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the New Juilliard Ensemble made its debut in September 1993, Edward Rothstein, writing in The New York Times, described the splintered nature of the city’s new-music scene at the time and the intense competition for audiences and financing.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/arts/new/new-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 636, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/arts/new/new-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1272, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/arts/new/new-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/24/arts/new/new-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/arts/new/new-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Robust Cello and Viola, With a Few Whoops', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Robust Cello And Viola, With a Few Whoops', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New Juilliard Ensemble', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, 