ifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/23/nfl-networks-added-but-not-available-to-all/', 'snippet': 'Some Time Warner Cable customers did not get the NFL Network, or its companion service, NFL RedZone, by the time games began Sunday. A nine-year impasse between the companies ended Friday with a deal to carry both channels.', 'lead_paragraph': '7:12 p.m. | Updated ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'NFL Networks Added, but Not Available to All', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'N.F.L. Channels Delayed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NFL Network', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Time Warner Cable Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-23T20:50:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Sandomir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sandomir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5d678955-e18c-5574-9270-7e0263561be6', 'word_count': 275, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5d678955-e18c-5574-9270-7e0263561be6'}, {'abstract': '“Voices of Strength: Contemporary Dance & Theater by Women From Africa” at New York Live Arts explores the link between feminism and art.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/24/arts/dance/voices-of-strength-at-new-york-live-arts.html', 'snippet': '“Voices of Strength: Contemporary Dance & Theater by Women From Africa” at New York Live Arts explores the link between feminism and art.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Friday night at New York Live Arts the two-part “Voices of Strength: Contemporary Dance & Theater by Women From Africa” unveiled its second program, a shared evening of works by Maria Helena Pinto and Bouchra Ouizguen. These choreographic voices — the first from Mozambique, the second from Morocco — each had something to impart about the link between feminism and making art. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/arts/strength/strength-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 371, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/24/arts/strength/strength-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 371}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/arts/strength/strength-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/arts/strength/strength-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1437, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/arts/strength/strength-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/24/arts/strength/strength-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/arts/strength/strength-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When Silenced, They Speak Out in Art', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'When Silenced, They Speak Out in Art', 'name': None, '