fraud and other crimes, is set to take the stand in a perjury case.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bernard B. Kerik, the disgraced former police commissioner of New York, will return to the city in the coming days, though certainly not triumphantly, and not yet as a free man.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/nyregion/KERIK/KERIK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 580, 'width': 418, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/nyregion/KERIK/KERIK-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 580, 'width': 418, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/nyregion/KERIK/KERIK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/24/nyregion/KERIK/KERIK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/nyregion/KERIK/KERIK-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Kerik Is Leaving His Cell to Testify at a Bronx Trial', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Kerik Is Leaving His Cell to Testify at a Bronx Trial', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'DiTommaso, Peter', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kerik, Bernard B', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bronx (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'DiTommaso, Frank', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': '