More than 100 public television stations showed a seven-hour telethon on Saturday that asked viewers to work with community organizations to lower the nation’s high school dropout rate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/24/business/media/public-broadcasting-takes-role-in-improving-graduation-rates.html', 'snippet': 'More than 100 public television stations showed a seven-hour telethon on Saturday that asked viewers to work with community organizations to lower the nation’s high school dropout rate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More than 100 public television stations reaching two-thirds of the nation’s viewers turned over their air on Saturday to an unusual seven-hour telethon broadcast live from WNET-TV’s Lincoln Center studio in New York. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/business/24cpb2/24cpb2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 698, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/business/24cpb2/24cpb2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1396, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Public Television Takes Role in Curbing Dropout Rates', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Public Television Takes Role in Curbing Dropout Rates', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grants (Corporate and Foundation)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Public Broadcasting', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Corp for Public Broadcasting', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject'