ape of a young woman in Hudson River Park on Saturday only hardened the belief that the city can still be dangerous.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/24/nyregion/rape-in-hudson-river-park-is-latest-in-series-of-violent-crimes.html', 'snippet': 'For some, the rape of a young woman in Hudson River Park on Saturday only hardened the belief that the city can still be dangerous.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Just after 6 a.m. on Sunday, Georgie Lau cut a solitary figure as he walked down Harrison Street toward the Hudson River in Manhattan, a fishing rod in one hand and a bucket in the other. Before him was a patch of Hudson River Park where, little more than 24 hours earlier, a young woman had been raped after going to sit near the water by herself in the early morning. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/nyregion/RAPE/RAPE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/24/nyregion/RAPE/RAPE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/nyregion/RAPE/RAPE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/nyregion/RAPE/RAPE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/nyregion/RAPE/RAPE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Rape in Hudson River Park Is Latest in 