-16e95ed31e29'}, {'abstract': 'Gray-suited, meticulous and little known to the public, Tom Donilon is President Obama’s national security adviser and central figure in American foreign policy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/24/us/politics/tom-donilon-a-manager-of-overseas-crises.html', 'snippet': 'Gray-suited, meticulous and little known to the public, Tom Donilon is President Obama’s national security adviser and central figure in American foreign policy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — When President Obama flies to New York on Monday afternoon for the United Nations General Assembly, he will dispense with the usual battery of one-on-one meetings with world leaders so he can tape an appearance on “The View” and return by midweek to the battleground state of Ohio. Left to help smooth over any ruffled feathers will be Tom Donilon.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/us/politics/donilon/donilon-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 929, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/us/politics/donilon/donilon-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1857, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/us/politics/donilon/donilon-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/24/us/politics/donilon/donilon-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/us/politics/donilon/donilon-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height'