of covering President Vladimir Putin. This is one of those questions that presumes the respondent is guilty. It is also a question that has become central to Russian political rhetoric. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For the Love of Country', 'kicker': 'Latitude', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil Rights and Liberties', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Putin, Vladimir V', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-24T13:34:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Masha Gessen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Masha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gessen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2c31ecb9-43bd-5a63-bdc1-db4a01331f43', 'word_count': 560, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2c31ecb9-43bd-5a63-bdc1-db4a01331f43'}, {'abstract': 'The Jets need their defense to be special to have a memorable season, and it will be hard to be special without Darrelle Revis.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/24/can-jets-contend-without-revis/', 'snippet': 'The Jets need their defense to be special to have a memorable season, and it will be hard to be special without Darrelle Revis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Jets will soon learn the severity of the knee injury that cornerback Darrelle Revis sustained in a victory at Miami on Sunday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Can Jets Contend Without Revis?', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name':