ster’s Entertainment, the restaurant and arcade chain, is seeking to sell 7.7 million shares in its I.P.O. at $12 to $14 a share. At the midpoint of that range, the private equity-backed company is set to raise $100 million.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/09/24/dave-busters-sets-range-for-i-p-o/', 'snippet': 'Dave & Buster’s Entertainment, the restaurant and arcade chain, is seeking to sell 7.7 million shares in its I.P.O. at $12 to $14 a share. At the midpoint of that range, the private equity-backed company is set to raise $100 million.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dave & Buster’s Entertainment, the restaurant and arcade chain, announced on Monday that it was seeking to sell 7.7 million shares at $12 to $14 a share during its initial public offering. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dave & Buster’s Sets Range for I.P.O.', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Initial Public Offerings', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Dave & Buster's Inc", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Oak Hill Capital Partners', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Wellspring Capital Management', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-24T14:07:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Evelyn M. Rusli', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Evelyn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a581248d-0713-5aaa-92ae-790a48b2483b', 'word_count': 275, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a581248d-0713-5aaa-92ae-790a48b2483b'}, {'abstract': 'Milan', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/09/24/fashion/runway-womens/roberto-cavalli-spring-20