ted', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e683e330-5d71-5c21-bf1b-e22c88af374b', 'word_count': 437, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e683e330-5d71-5c21-bf1b-e22c88af374b'}, {'abstract': 'The Times Company bought About.com in 2005 for $400 million, and it helped increase profit through the lean years of the recession.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/24/times-completes-sale-of-about-com/', 'snippet': 'The Times Company bought About.com in 2005 for $400 million, and it helped increase profit through the lean years of the recession.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The New York Times Company, which has been trying to shed its assets and focus on its newspaper and Web site, announced Monday morning it had completed the sale of About Group for $300 million in cash to IAC/InterActiveCorp. The About Group includes the Web sites About.com, ConsumerSearch.com and CalorieCount.com.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Times Company Completes Sale of About.com', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newspapers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ABOUT.COM', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'IAC/InterActiveCorp', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times Company', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-24T15:31:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christine Haughney', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Haughney', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0c8f5681-7422-56ac-84e4-134a577234ac', 'word_count': 179, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0c8f5681-7422-56ac-84e4-134a577234ac'}, {'abstract': 'Fresh beets can be had for a few more months, but the time for making the most of their delicious and versatile greens is running out. Today: a beet greens frittata.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/24/health/nutrition/a-dynamic-duo-beets-and-beet-greens-recipes-for-health.html', 'snippet': 'Fresh beets can be had for a few more months, but the time for making the most of their delicious and versatile greens is running out. Today: a beet greens frittata.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The New York City Greenmarket Web site has a handy table that shows what’s available during each month of the year. It tells me, for example, that fresh beets are available from June through November (beets from storage are available through February), but that you can count on the greens only through September. That gives me this week to provide you with my annual set of beet and beet green recipes, one of my favorite subjects.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/health/nutrition/24recipehealth-frittata/24recipehealth-frittata-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/24/health/nutrition/24recipehealth-frittata/24recipehealth-frittata-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 395}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/health/nutrition/24recipehealth-frittata/24recipehealth-frittata-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 674, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/health/nutrition/24recipehealth-frittata/24recipehealth-frittata-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1348, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/health/nutrition/24recipehealth-frittata/24recipehealth-frittata-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/24/health/nutrition/24recipehealth-frittata/24recipehealth-frittata-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/24/health/nutrition/24recipehealth-frittata/24recipehealth-frittata-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Dynamic Duo: Beets and Beet Greens', 'kicker': 'Recipes for Health', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diet and Nutrition', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Eggs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recipes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-24T15:32:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'subsection_name': 'Fitness & Nutrition', 'byline': {'original': 'By Martha Rose Shulman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Martha', 'middlename': 'Rose', 'lastname': 'Shulman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'recipe', '_id': 'nyt://article/4118f73e-6cdd-53ec-97eb-4c040a9b62eb', 'word_count': 814, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4118f73e-6cdd-53ec-97eb-4c040a9b62eb'}, {'abstract': 'Germany’s Roman Catholic Bishops have decreed that those who leave the church may no longer qualify for religious ceremonies. Activist groups say the edict would deepen unease and anger within the ranks of Catholic churchgoers prompted by sexual abuse scandals and accusations of cover-ups.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/24/bishops-edict-angers-catholics-in-germany/', 'snippet': 'Germany’s Roman Catholic Bishops have decreed that those who leave the church may no longer qualify for religious ceremonies. Activist groups say the edict would deepen unease and anger within the ranks of Catholic churchgoers prompted by sexual a...', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERLIN — Matters of faith have been much on German minds in recent times with debate raging among its Muslim and Jewish minorities over a court’s challenge to the practice of infant circumcision and, as I wrote in my latest Page Two column, over the country’s response to the contentious, American-made video denigrating the Prophet Muhammad that has stirred anger across the Muslim world.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bishops’ Edict Angers Catholics in Germany', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-24T15:35:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Cowell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cowell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7f696dce-4968-5696-b122-3048537c0645', 'word_count': 331, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7f696dce-4968-5696-b122-3048537c0645'}, {'abstract': 'Must-see stops on the European dance circuit: New works by Alexei Ratmansky, Michael Clark and William Forsythe. And what 