ironment?', 'web_url': 'https://wordplay.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/24/numberplay-car/', 'snippet': 'Can a sports car be good for the environment?', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s time for a new car. Your current set of wheels — an old BMW Z3 roadster — is perfect for your job (pizza delivery) but has miserable fuel economy: 20 miles per gallon. You decide you no longer care about being cool. You care about the earth. You’re up for anything.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Can a Sports Car Be Green?', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electric and Hybrid Vehicles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Energy Efficiency', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mathematics', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Puzzles', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-24T16:00:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gary Antonick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Antonick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/34b81deb-df74-5223-8051-711e075a6f2e', 'word_count': 731, 'uri': 'nyt://article/34b81deb-df74-5223-8051-711e075a6f2e'}, {'abstract': 'The portrait of the former Texas governor will open at the Vivian Beaumont Theater in March.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/24/ann-holland-taylors-play-about-ann-richards-will-open-on-broadway/', 'snippet': 'The portrait of the former Texas governor will open at the Vivian Beaumont Theater in March.', 'lead_paragraph': ' “Ann,” a play based on the life of Ann W. Richards, the colorful Democratic governor of Texas who died in 2006, is coming to Broadway. The play will open on March 7, 2013, at Lincoln Center Theater’s Vivian Beaumont Theater, producers Bob Boyett and Harriet Newman Leve announced Monday.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Ann,’ Holland Taylor’s Play About Ann Richards, Will Open on Broadway', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ann Richards Story Is Set for Broadway', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boyett, Bob', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Richards, Ann', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Taylor, Holland', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Beaumont, Vivian, Theater', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lincoln Center Theater', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-24T16:03:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Felicia R. Lee', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Felicia', 'middlename': 'R.', 'lastname': 'Lee', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5ed60db8-88db-5c5b-be18-17a05676cda9', 'word_count': 194, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5ed60db8-88db-5c5b-be18-17a05676cda9'}, {'abstract': 'Angelica Palacios, who played soccer for Ouachita Baptist University, has joined the high-profile head injury lawsuit against the N.C.A.A., widening the group of plaintiffs beyond male football players.', 'web_url': 'https://thequad.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/24/former-soccer-player-joins-lawsuit-against-the-n-c-a-a/', 'snippet': 'Angelica Palacios, who played soccer for Ouachita Baptist University, has joined the high-profile head injury lawsuit against the N.C.A.A., widening the group of plaintiffs beyond male football players.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Angelica Palacios can still remember the concussion that ended her collegiate soccer career.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Former Soccer Player Joins Lawsuit Against N.C.A.A.', 'kicker': 'The Quad', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Concussions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sports Injuries', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Collegiate Athletic Assn', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-24T16:08:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mary Pilon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pilon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/156c1497-e119-5349-9593-8c06d88fd2cd', 'word_count': 698, 'uri': 'nyt://article/156c1497-e119-5349-9593-8c06d88fd2cd'}, {'abstract': 'President Mahmoud Ahmadinejad said Monday that Israelis have no historical roots in the Middle East and that the existence of Israel is just a passing phase in the region’s history.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/25/world/middleeast/irans-president-ahmadinejad-says-israelis-have-no-mideast-roots.html', 'snippet': 'President Mahmoud Ahmadinejad said Monday that Israelis have no historical roots in the Middle East and that the existence of Israel is just a passing phase in the region’s history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Mahmoud Ahmadinejad of Iran stoked the anger of Israel, the United States, Syrian insurgents and gay rights advocates on Monda