Bentley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chris', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bentley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0b985c36-9532-5622-a15c-e259595fbf44', 'word_count': 760, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0b985c36-9532-5622-a15c-e259595fbf44'}, {'abstract': 'A 1-minute-48-second video that gives a big-picture overview of what we do. We hope you’ll pair it with our more detailed post, 12 Ways to Use The Learning Network This School Year, and share both with other teachers.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/24/video-welcome-to-the-learning-network/', 'snippet': 'A 1-minute-48-second video that gives a big-picture overview of what we do. We hope you’ll pair it with our more detailed post, 12 Ways to Use The Learning Network This School Year, and share both with other teachers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Earlier this month we published a detailed list of 12 Ways to Use The Learning Network Blog This School Year. Now, we’re pleased to follow it with this 1-minute-48-second video that gives a big-picture overview of what we do.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video | Welcome to The Learning Network', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-24T16:54:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katherine Schulten and Tanya Abrams', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katherine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schulten', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Tanya', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Abrams', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://articl