he works.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/24/for-tig-notaro-an-album-and-book-deal-based-on-a-memorable-set/', 'snippet': 'The comedian Tig Notaro turned a year of tragedies, which included her mother’s unexpected death and learning she had breast cancer, into a memorable set. Now a book deal and album release are in the works.', 'lead_paragraph': ' 2:25 p.m. | Updated  For the comedian Tig Notaro, 2012 has been her “annus horribilis,” the year in which her mother died unexpectedly and Ms. Notaro learned she had breast cancer. But she turned the events into material for a stand-up routine last month in Los Angeles that quickly became one of the most-talked-about moments in the comedy world. Louis C.K. tweeted: “In 27 years doing this, I’ve seen a handful of truly great, masterful sets. One was Tig Notaro last night at Largo.” Now the set will live on in two forms: as an album online and as the basis of a book.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For Tig Notaro, an Album and Book Deal Based on a Memorable Set', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Book and Album From Tig Notaro', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'C K, Louis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Notaro, Tig', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'HarperCollins Publishers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-24T18:27:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Bosman and Jason Zinoman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bosman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Jason', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zinoman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'or