{'abstract': 'A panel of medical experts reaffirmed a recommendation intended to direct patients with risky drinking behaviors into counseling.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/25/health/doctors-reminded-to-screen-for-alcohol-problems.html', 'snippet': 'A panel of medical experts reaffirmed a recommendation intended to direct patients with risky drinking behaviors into counseling.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Primary care doctors and nurses should screen their adult patients to determine whether they are misusing alcohol, and provide counseling when risky behavior is detected, a panel of medical experts reaffirmed on Monday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Panel Reminds Doctors to Screen for Alcohol Misuse', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Doctors Reminded to Ask Patients About Alcohol Use', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Preventive Medicine', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nursing and Nurses', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Preventive Services Task Force', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Alcohol Abuse', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doctors', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-24T22:26:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sabrina Tavernise', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sabrina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tavernise', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f1c59166-2244-50cc-a835-186f3cca84d9', 'word_count': 688, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f1c59166-2244-50cc-a835-186f3cca84d9'}, {'abstract': 'The technology reporters and editors of The New York Times scour the Web for important and peculiar items. Monday’s selection includes a new look from MySpace, some predictions of a halt in growth for Research in Motion and a look at a former Morgan Stanley analyst who is now a venture capitalist.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/24/todays-scuttlebot-iphone-5-thieves-and-business-tech-start-ups/', 'snippet': 'The technology reporters and editors of The New York Times scour the Web for important and peculiar items. Monday’s selection includes a new look from MySpace, some predictions of a halt in growth for Research in Motion and a look at a former Morg...', 'lead_paragraph': ' Some interesting items that the tech reporters and editors of The New York Times found on the Web recently. See more here.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 500, 'width': 500, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Today’s Scuttlebot: iPhone 5 Thieves, and Business Tech Start-Ups', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-24T22:26:46+0000', 'document_t