ical finance scandal that includes accusations of the misuse of public money. The scandal has tainted several local politicians associated with former Prime Minister Silvio Berlusconi’s party and is another blow to the party’s waning fortunes. Ms. Polverini, who has not been implicated in the scandal, said Monday that her administration, elected in 2010, had governed well. “I leave with my head held high,” she said. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Italy: Regional Leader Resigns', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | Europe', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Italy: Regional Leader Resigns', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Italy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-25T00:33:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabetta Povoledo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elisabetta', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Povoledo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/c14c5fcb-6171-52b7-99d1-20ffe2eba2ef', 'word_count': 84, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c14c5fcb-6171-52b7-99d1-20ffe2eba2ef'}, {'abstract': 'The Marine Corps said Monday that two noncommissioned officers accused of urinating on the bodies of dead Taliban fighters in Afghanistan last year would be court-martialed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/25/world/americas/two-marines-face-charges.html', 'snippet': 'The Marine Corps said Monday that two noncommissioned officers accused of urinating on the bodies of dead Taliban fighters in Afghanistan last year would be court-martialed.', 'lead_paragraph': ' The Marine Corps said Monday that two noncommissioned officers accused of urinating on the bodies of dead Taliban fighters in Afghanistan last year would be court-martialed. The Marines, Staff Sgt. Joseph W. Chamblin and Staff Sgt. Edward W. Deptola, are based at Camp Lejeune, N.C. Three other Marines were disciplined last month for their roles in the episode, which provoked outrage in Afghanistan after a video of it became public. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Two Marines Face Charges', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | The Americas', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Two Marines Face Charges', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-25T00:36:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabeth Bumiller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elisabeth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bumiller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/e11f1e94-975b-53c3-91aa-a38622333332', 'word_count': 70, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e11f1e94-975b-53c3-91aa-a38622333332'}, {'abstract': 'The Ryder Cup golf tournament has become one of the most keenly anticipated team events in sports, but its origins are somewhat muddled.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/25/sports/golf/roots-of-ryder-cup-golf-tournament-involve-seed-company.html', 'snippet': 'The Ryder Cup golf tournament has become one of the most keenly anticipated team events in sports, but its origins are somewhat muddled.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Ryder Cup, which will be held for the 39th time this week at Medinah Country Club near Chicago, has become one of the most keenly anticipated team events in sports. But the origins of the event are somewhat muddled.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/sports/YRYDER2/YRYDER2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/25/sports/YRYDER2/YRYDER2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/sports/YRYDER2/YRYDER2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 785, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/sports/YRYDER2/YRYDER2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1570, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/sports/YRYDER2/YRYDER2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/25/sports/YRYDER2/YRYDER2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/sports/YRYDER2/YRYDER2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tracing the Root of the Ryder Cup Back to Its Seed', 'kicker': 'Ryder Cup', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tracing Ryder Cup Roots Back to Original Seed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ryder Cup (Golf)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-25T00:36:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article