hat makes the revolving door in Washington spin faster.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/09/24/about-face-for-bankers-new-lobbyist/', 'snippet': 'To say that the choice of Tim Pawlenty to represent the banking industry is odd would be an understatement, but his appointment is the clearest sign yet of the flexible ethic that makes the revolving door in Washington spin faster.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I went to Wall Street and told them to get their snout out of the trough because they are some of the worst offenders when it comes to bailouts and carve-outs and special deals.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'About-Face for Bankers’ New Lobbyist', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'About-Face For Bankers’ New Lobbyist', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-25T00:53:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Ross Sorkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': 'Ross', 'lastname': 'Sorkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c335f50f-1483-5bdb-a93e-b7c00f6925b9', 'word_count': 972, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c335f50f-1483-5bdb-a93e-b7c00f6925b9'}, {'abstract': 'What happens to a politician\xa0on the path to the presidency isn’t pretty.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/25/opinion/bruni-mitts-mortification.html', 'snippet': 'What happens to a politician\xa0on the path to the presidency isn’t pretty.', 'lead_paragraph': 'That bloodied appendage? The one riddled with holes?', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/frank-bruni/frank