im off the disabled list soon, but when and how he will be used is not clear.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/24/for-reliever-aardsma-two-year-wait-is-almost-over/', 'snippet': 'The pitcher David Aardsma, who had surgery on his hip and elbow, expects the Yankees to take him off the disabled list soon, but when and how he will be used is not clear.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MINNEAPOLIS — David Aardsma’s next major league pitch will be his first since Sept. 19, 2010, after having surgery on his left hip and right elbow. That pitch, however, will not come Monday night. Even though the Yankees flew Aardsma here from their training complex in Tampa, Fla., in time for the game against the Minnesota Twins — presumably to add an arm to their heavily used bullpen — they did not activate him.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/sports/baseball/25david/25david-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 803, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/sports/baseball/25david/25david-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1606, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/sports/baseball/25david/25david-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/25/sports/baseball/25david/25david-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/sports/baseball/25david/25david-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}