after he finds a box of letters that lead to a grandmother he had never known.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/25/theater/reviews/red-dog-howls-by-alexander-dinelaris.html', 'snippet': 'In “Red Dog Howls,” a New York man discovers a devastating family secret after he finds a box of letters that lead to a grandmother he had never known.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Generally speaking, when you hear a mournful folk melody played on a violin as the lights go down at the theater, it is wise to set aside any expectations of frothy pleasures — debonair quipping, pratfalling, tap-dancing chorus girls — and prepare for something more somber. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/arts/25RED/25RED-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 718, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/arts/25RED/25RED-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1437, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/arts/25RED/25RED-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/25/arts/25RED/25RED-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/arts/25RED/25RED-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Buried Family Secret, Not for the Faint of Heart', 'kicker': 'Theater Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Buried Family Secret, Not for the Faint of Heart', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dinelaris, Alexander', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chalfant, Kathleen', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Theater Workshop', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schmoll, Ken Rus', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Narciso, Alfredo', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Armenians', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lozano, Florencia', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-25T02:00:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'subsection_name': 'Theater Reviews', 'byline': {'original': 'By Charles Isherwood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Charles', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Isherwood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/de93e4e3-3916-5bf2-9176-e7d14d91be45', 'word_count': 1018, 'uri': 'nyt://article/de93e4e3-3916-5bf2-9176-e7d14d91be45'}, {'abstract': 'The Goodman Theater in Chicago has revived Tennessee Williams’s “Sweet Bird of Youth,” starring Diane Lane and Finn Wittrock.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/25/theater/reviews/sweet-bird-of-youth-revived-by-goodman-theater.html', 'snippet': 'The Goodman Theater in Chicago has revived Tennessee Williams’s “Sweet Bird of Youth,” starring Diane Lane and Finn Wittrock.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — First glimpsed writhing buglike beneath satin sheets, she looks awfully small to be a towering legend of the screen. Breakable, too, as if a pair of strong arms could crush those fine bones to dust, leaving behind only a trail of mascara and remnants of that last, botched appointment with the hairdresser. Hey, this dame can’t even breathe without the help of an oxygen mask.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/arts/SWEET/SWEET-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 692, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/arts/SWEET/SWEET-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1384, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/arts/SWEET/SWEET-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/25/arts/SWEET/SWEET-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/arts/SWEET/SWEET-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 149, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'She’s Old and Faded; He’s Young and Trapped', 'kicker': 'Theater Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'She’s Old and Faded; He’s Young and Trapped', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wittrock, Finn', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Tennessee', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lane, Diane', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Goodman Theater', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chicago (Ill)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cromer, David', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-25T02:00:31+0000', 'doc