None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f729bf47-f7db-5afe-bc27-6183392a24fb', 'word_count': 250, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f729bf47-f7db-5afe-bc27-6183392a24fb'}, {'abstract': 'Adam Jones went 4 for 4 to help Baltimore move within a half-game of the A.L. East by winning the first game of two on Monday against the Blue Jays.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/25/sports/baseball/mlb-wild-card-roundup.html', 'snippet': 'Adam Jones went 4 for 4 to help Baltimore move within a half-game of the A.L. East by winning the first game of two on Monday against the Blue Jays.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the baseball season moves into its final stretch, the story lines are becoming clearer. Three National League teams — San Francisco, Cincinnati and Washington — have clinched spots in the postseason, and Atlanta seems assured of joining them as a wild-card team. That leaves St. Louis fighting off Milwaukee and the Dodgers for the second wild-card slot. The Brewers’ loss to the Nationals on Monday afternoon made the Cardinals’ task a little easier.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/sports/YBATS/YBATS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/sports/YBATS/YBATS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With Doubleheader Split, The Orioles Lose Ground', 'kicker': 'Playoff Push', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Doubleheader Split, The Orioles Lose Ground', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value'