sday it was in deal talks with global alcohol giant Diageo in a notice to the Bombay Stock Exchange. United Spirits’ stock price rose on the news, to 1098.80 rupees a share at noon in India, up 3.6 percent for the day. United Spirits stock hit a 52 week high of 1,099.95 rupees a share on Monday on rumors deal talks were underway. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'UB Group Companies’ Stock Up on Deal Talk', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ALCOHOLIC BEVERAGES', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mallya, Vijay', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Diageo PLC', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kingfisher Plc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Spirits', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-25T07:44:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/18585562-d2ba-5a2e-85b7-07a892ba598c', 'word_count': 178, 'uri': 'nyt://article/18585562-d2ba-5a2e-85b7-07a892ba598c'}, {'abstract': 'What is white nose syndrome?', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/25/bat-cave-to-the-rescue/', 'snippet': 'What is white nose syndrome?', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHO is Cory Holliday?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bat Cave to the Rescue?', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': 