ns vying for that honor. The Mexican brother-sister pop duo Jesse & Joy followed with five Latin Grammy nominations, while the Colombian rocker Juanes, Guatemala’s Ricardo Arjona and the Brazilians Caetano Veloso and Ivete Sangalo were among the artists getting four.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/arts/25artsbeat-grammys/25artsbeat-grammys-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 702, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/arts/25artsbeat-grammys/25artsbeat-grammys-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1404, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/arts/25artsbeat-grammys/25artsbeat-grammys-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/25/arts/25artsbeat-grammys/25artsbeat-grammys-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/25/arts/25artsbeat-grammys/25artsbeat-grammys-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Juan Luis Guerra Tops List of Latin Grammy Nominations', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Latin Grammy Race', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grammy Awards', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Arjona, Ricardo', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': '