anks at the top of countries for freedom on the Internet, according to a survey by an American advocacy group.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What’s up with Estonia? The tiny Baltic nation affords its citizens the greatest measure of digital freedom as measured by Freedom House, a Washington \xa0advocacy group.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Estonia Gets Highest Marks for Internet Freedom', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Freedom House', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-25T21:45:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Somini Sengupta', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Somini', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sengupta', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8629440e-fc07-579c-acc9-5ef367ac6658', 'word_count': 319, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8629440e-fc07-579c-acc9-5ef367ac6658'}, {'abstract': 'Kimiko Ishizaka played Bach at the W.M.P. Concert Hall. The Talea Ensemble played three American premieres at the Bohemian National Hall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/26/arts/music/kimiko-ishizaka.html', 'snippet': 'Kimiko Ishizaka played Bach at the W.M.P. Concert Hall. The Talea Ensemble played three American premieres at the Bohemian National Hall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KIMIKO ISHIZAKA', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/26/arts/roundup1/roundup1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2