an served as an inspiration for his spring collection, which includes looks for all hours of the day.', 'lead_paragraph': 'var data;function jsonSlideshowCallback(response){data = response;}NYTD.options = {source: data,cropType: \'blog480\',appendTo: \'fullScreenSlideShow\',showHeadLine: \'false\', renderstyle: "embeddedSlideShowTmag"}', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In the Studio | Anthony Vaccarello', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-25T23:03:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephanie Lacava', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephanie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lacava', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ff695385-b8a1-5183-b724-7182d8ae191f', 'word_count': 572, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ff695385-b8a1-5183-b724-7182d8ae191f'}, {'abstract': 'The Mexican arm of Banco Santander priced the U.S. portion of its initial public offering at about $12.18 on Tuesday, according to a person briefed on the matter, within its expected price range as the lender held one of the biggest stock sales ever by a Mexican company.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/09/25/santanders-mexican-arm-said-to-price-its-i-p-o-at-12-18/', 'snippet': 'The Mexican arm of Banco Santander priced the U.S. portion of its initial public offering at about $12.18 on Tuesday, according to a person briefed on the matter, within its expected price range as the lender held one of the biggest stock sales ev...', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Mexican arm of Banco Santander priced the American portion of its initial public offering at $12.18 on Tuesday, within its expected price range, according to a person briefed on the matter who declined to be identified.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Santander’s Mexican Unit Sells U.S. Shares at $12.18 in Dual Listing', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Santander’s Mexican Unit Sells U.S. Shares at $12.18 in Dual Listing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Banco Santander S A', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-25T23:03:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/32426ed7-dd0b-539c-b660-93e59ea47103', 'word_count': 488, 'uri': 'nyt://article/32426ed7-dd0b-539c-b660-93e59ea47103'}, {'abstract': '“The Waiting Room” looks at health care and suffering in an emergency room in Oakland, Calif.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/26/movies/the-waiting-room-about-highland-hospital-by-peter-nicks.html', 'snippet': '“The Waiting Room” looks at health care and suffering in an emergency room in Oakland, Calif.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The crowded emergency room of Highland Hospital in Oakland, Calif., is the setting of Peter Nicks’s wrenching documentary “The Waiting Room.” Shot in 2010 over five months, the film, which has no narrator, titles, statistical analysis or overt editorializing, observes a composite day there during which nearly 250 patients — most of them uninsured — pour in. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/26/arts/26WAITING/26WAITING-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xl