s performance. How would the last three weeks have played out for the president?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama Without Romney', 'kicker': 'Campaign Stops', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-26T02:52:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ross Douthat', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ross', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Douthat', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/337706d1-7137-5497-acbc-5f6a34b823e6', 'word_count': 997, 'uri': 'nyt://article/337706d1-7137-5497-acbc-5f6a34b823e6'}, {'abstract': 'Anna Gristina, 45, who came to be called the Soccer Mom Madam, accepted a plea offer that will allow her to be released without additional jail time.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/26/nyregion/anna-gristina-pleads-guilty-in-prostitution-case.html', 'snippet': 'Anna Gristina, 45, who came to be called the Soccer Mom Madam, accepted a plea offer that will allow her to be released without additional jail time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A suburban New York mother who became a tabloid and television sensation after she was charged in February with running an Upper East Side brothel pleaded guilty on Tuesday to one count of promoting prostitution.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/26/nyregion/MADAM/MADAM-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType'