 'Nicolas Colsaerts’s road to the Ryder Cup was not a straight shot. He qualified for the European Tour at 18, then dropped to 1,305th in the world before becoming the first Belgian to qualify for this week’s tournament.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MEDINAH, Ill. — Of the 12 players on the European team this week, only one is a Ryder Cup rookie, Nicolas Colsaerts of Belgium. But that does not mean he is bereft of Ryder Cup experience.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/26/sports/YRYDER/YRYDER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 737, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/26/sports/YRYDER/YRYDER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1996, 'width': 1437, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/26/sports/YRYDER/YRYDER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/26/sports/YRYDER/YRYDER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/26/sports/YRYDER/YRYDER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Belgian Has Come a Long Way to Hit It a Long Way', 'kicker': 'Ryder Cup', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Belgian Has Come a Long Way to Hit It a Long Way in His First Ryder Cup', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ryder Cup (Golf)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Belgium', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Colsaerts, Nicolas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-26T06:25:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christopher Clarey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christopher', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Clarey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3f9eb9d4-12f7-5e8a-81b1-a71272a47609', 'word_count': 1308, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3f9eb9d4-12f7-5e8a-81b1-a71272a47609'}, {'abstract': 'Large explosions at a military site in the Syrian capital on Wednesday were followed by a gunfight that left an Iranian television correspondent dead, his station reported.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/27/world/middleeast/syria.html', 'snippet': 'Large explosions at a military site in the Syrian capital on Wednesday were followed by a gunfight that left an Iranian television correspondent dead, his station reported.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DAMASCUS, Syria — Suicide bombers struck a military headquarters in a busy square in central Damascus on Wednesday morning, the second insurgent assault on a government military installation in two days and the largest attack in the capital since July, when explosions killed several key aides to President Bashar al-Assad. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/27/world/middleeast/27syria_2/27syria_2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 694, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/27/world/middleeast/27syria_2/27syria_2-