'The Kennedy-Nixon debates began in 1960, and the Mariel boatlift ended in 1980.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/26/booming/26history-booming.html', 'snippet': 'The Kennedy-Nixon debates began in 1960, and the Mariel boatlift ended in 1980.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On this day in 1980 the Mariel boatlift came to an end. For me as a reporter, it is one of those events where life intersected with history. And it is the anniversary of the first Kennedy-Nixon debate, which began the ascent of television’s role in politics.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/26/booming/26history-booming/26history-booming-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/26/booming/26history-booming/26history-booming-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/26/booming/26history-booming/26history-booming-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/26/booming/26history-booming/26history-booming-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/26/booming/26history-booming/26history-booming-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/26/booming/26history-booming/26history-booming-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/26/booming/26history-booming/26history-booming-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An Election and Exiles', 'kicker': 'Remember This', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-26T09:00:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Booming', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Winerip', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Winerip', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4d875aa3-22ef-5d74-9e34-cfec1119c43f', 'word_count': 422, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4d875aa3-22ef-5d74-9e34-cfec1119c43f'}, {'abstract': 'From the law firm to the library, it’s important for women to remember that it’s not necessarily the size of the heel, but the coziness in the sole.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/26/booming/26story-booming.html', 'snippet': 'From the law firm to the library, it’s important for women to remember that it’s not necessarily the size of the heel, but the coziness in the sole.', 'lead_paragraph': 'All women love shoes. Except me. I’m a middle-aged, middle-class woman who doesn’t give a rip about footwear. I might be the only one.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/26/booming/26story-booming/26story-booming-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/26/booming/26story-booming/26story-booming-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/26/booming/