 and other consumer-focused news from The New York Times.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A variety of consumer-focused articles appears daily in The New York Times and on our blogs. Each weekday morning, we gather them together here so you can quickly scan the news that could hit you in your wallet.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wednesday Reading: Making Vegan Food the New Normal', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-26T13:00:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/504fa728-afd1-5960-90c9-e788038c18e2', 'word_count': 187, 'uri': 'nyt://article/504fa728-afd1-5960-90c9-e788038c18e2'}, {'abstract': 'Two new titles for the Xbox 360 Kinect video game system allow users to enter a scene from Sesame Street or Nat Geo TV.', 'web_url': 'https://gadgetwise.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/26/your-chance-to-appear-on-sesame-street/', 'snippet': 'Two new titles for the Xbox 360 Kinect video game system allow users to enter a scene from Sesame Street or Nat Geo TV.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Watching TV is old news. Now it can watch you back, provided you have one of two new titles in stores: Kinect Sesame Street TV or Kinect Nat Geo TV ($30 each, from Microsoft Studios). ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Your Chance to Appear on ‘Sesame Street’', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Put Yourself on ‘Sesame Street,’ or in the Wild', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computer and Vi