interconnections in ecosystems. Randy sees this film, describing the domino-like relationship of species in an ecosystem, as the best single video to emerge in his years-long coaching effort. I’d like to get your view, and I’m sure he would, too. Here’s his “Your Dot” post, along with a link to more on his blog, The Benshi: ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Domino Effect in Nature, and Visual Storytelling', 'kicker': 'Dot Earth', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Endangered and Extinct Species', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Environment', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-26T15:11:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew C. Revkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Revkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/84b54b6d-6802-51cf-b6e9-6cd65d8f2ffd', 'word_count': 774, 'uri': 'nyt://article/84b54b6d-6802-51cf-b6e9-6cd65d8f2ffd'}, {'abstract': 'Answers to readers’ questions about wedding-related matters.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/26/fashion/weddings/wedding-q-and-a.html', 'snippet': 'Answers to readers’ questions about wedding-related matters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Marrying First, Then Celebrating With a Ceremony Later', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/02/11/fashion/weddings/peggypost/peggypost-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 288, 'width': 288, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': No