ew report from the NPD Group, a market research company.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/26/more-are-watching-internet-video-on-actual-tvs-research-shows/', 'snippet': 'More people are now watching Internet video — everything from cat videos to streaming prime-time shows — on big-screen televisions than on computers, according to a new report from the NPD Group, a market research company.', 'lead_paragraph': ' No more squinting at YouTube videos or Hulu shows on a tiny laptop or desktop screen. More people are now watching Internet video — everything from cat videos to streaming prime-time shows — on big-screen televisions than on computers, according to a new report from the NPD Group, a market research company.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'More Are Watching Internet Video on Actual TVs, Research Shows', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Online Viewing Shifts to TV Sets', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-26T19:40:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jenna Wortham', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jenna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wortham', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/410d7da7-034d-5b8f-a342-746062ed1968', 'word_count': 259, 'uri': 'nyt://article/410d7da7-034d-5b8f-a342-746062ed1968'}, {'abstract': 'I found the Dries Van Noten show curious but interesting — mostly for its inky colors and plaids, but curious for its runny silhouette. Dare I say grunge?', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/26/paris-with-a-slouch-or-a-sashay/', 'snippet': 'I found the Dries Van Noten show curious but interesting — mostly for its inky colors and plaids, but curious for its runny silhouette. Dare I say grunge?', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York seems miles away as the Paris collections, the fourth and final stop of the spring 2013 shows, began in a downpour — a literal one, that is. People arrived at Rochas on Wednesday shaking like poodles, and left to face lagoons of water in the streets. One woman came prepared with a beige vinyl sou’wester that matched her skirt. I hugged the sidewalk on the Champs-Élysées, staying under the trees, and got back to my hotel just before it let loose again. I opened a bottle of red wine. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Paris, With a Slouch or a Sashay', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paris Fashion Week', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'van Noten, Dries', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rochas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-26T19:41:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cathy Horyn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cathy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Horyn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a6b68fee-89f7-50ea-a52e-419dfdb2c92f', 'word_count': 342, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a6b68fee-89f7-50ea-a52e-419dfdb2c92f'}, {'abstract': 'Dean Foods announced Wednesday that it was exploring the sale of its Morningstar unit as the company takes steps to reduce its debt.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/09/26/dean-foods-explores-sale-of-dairy-unit/', 'snippet': 'Dean Foods announced Wednesday that it was exploring the sale of its Morningstar unit 