, turned violent in the early afternoon when a small group of demonstrators threw Molotov cocktails at police officers and firebombs at government buildings near the Greek Parliament. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Images of Clashes at Anti-Austerity Protests in Europe', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Strikes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Athens (Greece)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Greece', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Madrid (Spain)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Spain', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-26T19:58:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d073ffb9-d982-5142-bba0-050ed6da71af', 'word_count': 384, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d073ffb9-d982-5142-bba0-050ed6da71af'}, {'abstract': 'A view of the day in sports included some dapper Ryder Cup fans and an interesting reward for a Sumo champion.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/09/26/sports/9_26_Replay.html', 'snippet': 'A view of the day in sports included some dapper Ryder Cup fans and an interesting reward for a Sumo champion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A view of the day in sports included some dapper Ryder Cup fans and an interesting reward for a Sumo champion.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 