items like hotel knives, coffee pots or perhaps ashtrays that left in guests’ luggage — no questions asked — it worked.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A silver coffee pot, a couple of knives, a fork, a coaster for a bottle of wine: the goods were spread out on the table the way the police would spread out guns or drugs hauled in from a raid that would make the 11 o’clock news. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/27/nyregion/waldorf3/waldorf3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/27/nyregion/waldorf3/waldorf3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/27/nyregion/waldorf3/waldorf3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/27/nyregion/waldorf3/waldorf3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/27/nyregion/waldorf3/waldorf3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dear Waldorf, Mummy Stole Your Teapot Back in 1935. So Sorry.', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dear Waldorf, Mummy Stole Your Teapot Back in 1935. So Sorry.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'HOTELS AND MOTELS', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Robberies and Thefts', 'rank': 2, 'major':