ri': 'nyt://slideshow/5bd0002a-624f-52af-9644-63c535157f4b'}, {'abstract': 'The style and heritage of the luxury automaker are reflected in a suite designed by the brand in tandem with the St. Regis hotel in Manhattan.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/26/for-10000-the-allure-of-bentley-with-room-service/', 'snippet': 'The style and heritage of the luxury automaker are reflected in a suite designed by the brand in tandem with the St. Regis hotel in Manhattan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The landmark St. Regis hotel in New York has opened its new Bentley suite, designed in a collaboration between the hotel and Bentley’s interior designers. It joins specialty suites at the hotel branded by Christian Dior and Tiffany. Like the cars that inspired it, the Bentley suite is not an inexpensive proposition; rates start at $9,500 a night, excluding taxes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For $10,000, the Allure of Bentley With Room Service', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'HOTELS AND MOTELS', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bentley Motors Ltd', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Midtown Area (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-26T20:48:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Phil Patton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Phil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Patton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7c75f0f0-6edd-57b3-886e-3460e130d3a8', 'word_count': 502, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7c75f0f0-6edd-57b3-886e-3460e130d3a8'}, {'abstract': 'Neither of the teenagers knew the windows broken were a politician’s, investigators say.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/26/2nd-youth-charged-in-vandalism-at-congressmans-campaign-office/', 'snippet': 'Neither of the teenagers knew the windows broken were a politician’s, investigators say.', 'lead_paragraph': '5:26 p.m. | Updated A second teenager was arrested on Wednesday and charged with vandalizing Representative Michael G. Grimm’s campaign headquarters on Staten Island over the weekend. The boy, Avery Gerena, 16, of Staten Island, told the police that he did not know the office was Mr. Grimm’s when he threw a rock through its window, according to a criminal complaint.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '2nd Youth Charged in Vandalism at Congressman’s Campaign Office', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grimm, Michael G', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Staten Island (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-26T20:59:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By William K. Rashbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': 'K.', 'lastname': 'Rashbaum', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/98362e86-942d-5ca3-bb77-0d5f8b3cf719', 'word_count': 280, 'uri': 'nyt://article/98362e86-942d-5ca3-bb77-0d5f8b3cf719'}, {'abstract': 'The model Zoe Colivas transforms with makeup by Lucia Pieroni for Clé de Peau and hair by Eugene Souleiman for Wella.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/26/model-morphosis-zoe-colivas-at-rochas/', 'snippet': 'The model Zoe Colivas transforms with makeup by Lucia Pieroni for Clé de Peau and hair by Eugene Souleiman for Wella.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The photog