d_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/c8c3dc93-f04a-5372-83e2-590b875e5eaf'}, {'abstract': 'Bank of America, JPMorgan Chase, Citigroup, U.S. Bancorp and PNC have been hit by cyberattacks that have caused Internet blackouts and delays to online banking sites by a group claiming Middle Eastern ties. The attacks, while a nuisance, were not technically sophisticated and did not affect companies’ computer network or funds, or customers’ bank accounts.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/26/american-banks-undamaged-by-cyberattacks/', 'snippet': 'Bank of America, JPMorgan Chase, Citigroup, U.S. Bancorp and PNC have been hit by cyberattacks that have caused Internet blackouts and delays to online banking sites by a group claiming Middle Eastern ties. The attacks, while a nuisance, were not ...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bank of America, JPMorgan Chase, Citigroup, U.S. Bancorp and PNC have been hit by a wave of cyberattacks that have caused Internet blackouts and delays on online banking sites.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/26/technology/26bits-attack/26bits-attack-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 197, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/26/technology/26bits-attack/26bits-attack-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 197}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/26/technology/26bits-attack/26bits-attack-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 336, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/26/technology/26bits-attack/26bits-attack-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 384, 'width': 1170, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'ca