 efficiently — just ask an E.R. nurse.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/26/the-human-cost-of-the-second-amendment/', 'snippet': 'Gun advocates say that guns don’t kill people, people kill people. The truth is that people with guns kill people, often very efficiently — just ask an E.R. nurse.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Wisconsin, Aurora, Virginia Tech, Columbine. We all know these place names and what happened there. By the time this column appears, there may well be a new locale to add to the list. Such is the state of enabled and murderous mayhem in the United States. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Human Cost of the Second Amendment', 'kicker': 'Bedside', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Aurora, Colo, Shooting (2012)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nursing and Nurses', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-27T00:30:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Theresa Brown', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Theresa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brown', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/43404a7b-7f5d-53a8-8af0-e97655c34137', 'word_count': 963, 'uri': 'nyt://article/43404a7b-7f5d-53a8-8af0-e97655c34137'}, {'abstract': 'After falling behind from a product shortage, the automaker is planning to rejuvenate its Lexus brand by making the line more appealing to younger and more adventurous buyers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/27/business/toyota-moves-to-revamp-its-lexus-line.html', 'snippet': 'After falling behind from a product shortage, the automaker is planning to rejuvenate its Lexus brand by making the line more appealing to younger and more adventurous buyers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DETROIT — With a strong comeback under way in mainstream sedans and S.U.V.’s, Toyota Motor is now hoping to rejuvenate its Lexus brand by appealing to younger and more adventurous buyers.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/27/business/LEXUS/LEXUS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/27/business/LEXUS/LEXUS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/27/business/LEXUS/LEXUS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/27/business/LEXUS/LEXUS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/27/business/LEXUS/LEXUS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Toyota Moves to Revamp Its Lexus Luxury Line', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Toyota Moves to Revamp Its Lexus Luxury Line', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Toyota Motor Corporation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'LEXUS DIVISION OF TOYOTA MOTOR SALES USA', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-27T00:33:55+0000', 'document_type