.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is a single lawsuit and, at that, a legal action in its infancy. That said, the lawsuit brought by the family of Derek Boogaard against the N.H.L.’s players union could lead to some novel and tumultuous territory for the sport.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/27/sports/Y-BOOGAARD/Y-BOOGAARD-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/27/sports/Y-BOOGAARD/Y-BOOGAARD-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/27/sports/Y-BOOGAARD/Y-BOOGAARD-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/27/sports/Y-BOOGAARD/Y-BOOGAARD-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1361, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/27/sports/Y-BOOGAARD/Y-BOOGAARD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/27/sports/Y-BOOGAARD/Y-BOOGAARD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/27/sports/Y-BOOGAARD/Y-BOOGAARD-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Boogaard Lawsuit May Shake Up Hockey', 'kicker': 'Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Boogaard Lawsuit May Shake Up Ho