onal', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Parker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b3b11430-d476-57c4-9597-954c5eb10164', 'word_count': 918, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b3b11430-d476-57c4-9597-954c5eb10164'}, {'abstract': 'The Donald Rumsfeld-inspired guide to what might happen over the 40 days leading up to Election Day.', 'web_url': 'https://campaignstops.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/26/blow-knowns-unknowns-and-unknowables/', 'snippet': 'The Donald Rumsfeld-inspired guide to what might happen over the 40 days leading up to Election Day.', 'lead_paragraph': 'That was Donald Rumsfeld’s infamous riff on Saddam Hussein’s mythical weapons of mass destruction in the run-up to the Iraq war.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Knowns, Unknowns and Unknowables', 'kicker': 'Campaign Stops', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-27T01:22:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Charles M. Blow', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Charles', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/694944df-2866-565d-a3ce-4a01512e7c2a', 'word_count': 706, 'uri': 'nyt://article/694944df-2866-565d-a3ce-4a01512e7c2a'}, {'abstract': 'Donations from the leading contributors to Democratic Super PAC