ation': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7f1677f8-2cc7-57ac-8759-6c4352ca9393', 'word_count': 132, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7f1677f8-2cc7-57ac-8759-6c4352ca9393'}, {'abstract': 'My job was a whirlwind of cold calls and symphonies.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/27/gala-girl/', 'snippet': 'My job was a whirlwind of cold calls and symphonies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The summer after I graduated from college, I moved to New York for a fund-raising job with an institution I soon learned to call “the world’s leading performing arts center.” I was a fiction and art history major but during my interview, the director of major gifts asked the only question that really mattered: “Are you comfortable speaking on the telephone?” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gala Girl', 'kicker': 'Townies', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Careers and Professions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Culture (Arts)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lincoln Center for the Performing Arts', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-27T16:11:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Caroline Hamilton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Caroline', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hamilton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0c85656d-a4a2-5f7f-a119-b3cf8986ae2e', 'word_count': 1084, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0c85656d-a4a2-5f7f-a119-b3cf8986ae2e'}, {'abstract': 'A leaked report appears to be a rare Israeli acknowledgment that there might be time to halt the Iranian nuclear program without military action.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/28/world/middleeast/israeli-foreign-ministry-calls-for-more-sanctions-on-iran.html', 'snippet': 'A leaked report appears to be a rare Israeli acknowledgment that there might be time to halt the Iranian nuclear program without military action.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERUSALEM — An internal report prepared by Israel’s Foreign Ministry calls for an additional round of international sanctions against Iran, an Israeli official confirmed on Thursday, in what appeared to be a rare Israeli acknowledgment that there might still be time to try to stop the Iranian nuclear program by means other than military action. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Israeli Foreign Ministry Calls for More Sanctions on Iran', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Israeli Foreign Ministry Calls for More Sanctions on Iran', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Weapons', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Netanyahu, Benjamin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Haaretz', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Embargoes and Economic Sanctions', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-27T16:12:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Isabel Kershner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Isabel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kershner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/da4b6e51-7598-5162-a13a-04d35e449865', 'word_count': 751, 'uri': 'nyt: