n_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By George Loomis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'George', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Loomis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4afd9381-62ab-52bb-90e3-79264db3fb0b', 'word_count': 1138, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4afd9381-62ab-52bb-90e3-79264db3fb0b'}, {'abstract': 'A spokesman for Iran’s foreign ministry was harassed by a small group of protesters near the United Nations on Wednesday.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/27/iranian-diplomat-harassed-in-new-york/', 'snippet': 'A spokesman for Iran’s foreign ministry was harassed by a small group of protesters near the United Nations on Wednesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last Updated, 4:18 p.m. A spokesman for Iran’s foreign ministry was harassed by a small group of protesters near the United Nations in New York on Wednesday, after an address to the international body by the Iranian president, Mahmoud Ahmadinejad.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Iranian Diplomat Harassed in New York', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-27T16:22:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey and Rick Gladstone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gladstone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e99608c1-8915-5d7c-af91-137dea6b9d99', 'word_count': 851, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e99608c1-8915-5d7c-af91-137dea6b9d99'}, {'abstract': 'The population of mixed-race Americans grew by 32 percent from 2000 to 2010.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/27/mixed-race-america/', 'snippet': 'The population of mixed-race Americans grew by 32 percent from 2000 to 2010.', 'lead_paragraph': 'That map is from a new Census Bureau report about the population of mixed-race Americans, which grew 32 percent from 2000 to 2010. The population of single-race Americans, by contrast, grew 9.2 percent.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mixed-Race America', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Census', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Population', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Race and Ethnicity', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Census Bureau', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-27T16:23:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Catherine Rampell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Catherine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rampell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/47580e79-83eb-5744-b1c9-10b5f5fb82a9', 'word_count': 134, 'uri': 'nyt://article/47580e79-83eb-5744-b1c9-10b5f5fb82a9'}, {'abstract': 'Theater notables who saw the 1962 production of “Who’s Afraid of Virginia Woolf?” share their recollections, reservations and realizations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/30/theater/whos-afraid-of-virginia-woolf-returns-for-an-anniversary.html', 'snippet': 'Theater notables who saw the 1962 production of “Who’s Afraid of Virginia Woolf?” share their recollections, reservations and realizations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IT may be 2 a.m. when George and Martha stumble home at the beginning of “Who’s Afraid of Virginia Woolf?,” but the evening is just getting started. Fueled by a bathtub’s worth of alcohol and culminating in the surfacing of some very ugly truths, Edward Albee’s faculty-mixer-as-blood-sport drama riveted audiences in October 1962 and vaulted the 34-year-old playwright from Off Broadway darling to the cover of Newsweek magazine. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/theater/20120930_VIRGINIA-slide-OYXP/20120930_VIRGINIA-slide-OYXP-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/30/theater/20120930_VIRGINIA-slide-OYXP/20120930_VIRGINIA-slide-OYXP-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/theater/20120930_VIRGINIA-slide-OYXP/20120930_VIRGINIA-slide-OYXP-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/theater/20120930_VIRGINIA-slide-OYXP/20120930_VIRGINIA-slide-OYXP-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 1200, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/theater/20120930_VIRGINIA-slide-OYXP/20120930_VIRGINIA-slide-OYXP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/30/theater/20120930_VIRGINIA-slide-OYXP/20120930_VIRGINIA-slide-OYXP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'ca