 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/27/ideas-for-english-language-learners-election-2012/', 'snippet': 'Another in our monthly “Ideas for E.L.L.’s series, this one listing ways to use Times articles, video and interactives to teach about the race to the White House.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Research shows a critical quality of an engaging lesson is relevance to student lives. With an election focused on issues like jobs, health care, education and immigration — all deeply important to the lives of E.L.L. students — we asked our expert, Larry Ferlazzo, to devote this month’s installment of “Ideas for E.L.L.s” to Election, 2012, only 40 days away.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ideas for English Language Learners | Election 2012', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-27T17:46:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Larry Ferlazzo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Larry', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ferlazzo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/de4131c7-2111-5af8-ad2d-3b8e91ba0952', 'word_count': 1105, 'uri': 'nyt://article/de4131c7-2111-5af8-ad2d-3b8e91ba0952'}, {'abstract': 'The Blue Ribbon empire expands to the Lower East Side with Blue Ribbon Sushi Izakaya in the Thompson LES Hotel.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/10/03/dining/reviews/hungry-city-blue-ribbon-sushi-izakaya-in-the-lower-east-side.html', 'snippet': 'The Blue Ribbon empire expands to the Lower East Side with Blue Ribbon Sushi Izakaya in the Thompson LES Hotel.', 'lead_paragraph': 'YOU are on the Lower East Side, but it could be Times Square, or Terminal 5 at Kennedy Airport. The room is gaping; the music is that grim pop th