ited cooperation agreement on Thursday, paving the way for the resumption of oil exports and casting their ailing economies a desperately needed lifeline. But several analysts said the deal came up far short. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sudan and South Sudan Sign Accord, but Several Issues Are Unresolved', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sudan and South Sudan Sign Accord, but Several Issues Are Unresolved', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bashir, Omar Hassan Al-', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Sudan', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kiir Mayardit, Salva', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sudan', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-27T19:36:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeffrey Gettleman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeffrey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gettleman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/90df72bb-a6f0-5e26-adb1-bd7ba9f93dd3', 'word_count': 534, 'uri': 'nyt://article/90df72bb-a6f0-5e26-adb1-bd7ba9f93dd3'}, {'abstract': 'Marketed primarily in Spanish-language markets, the redesigned León shares systems — and surprisingly, fit and finish — with its stablemate, the Volkswagen Golf.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/27/seat-leon-an-exercise-in-dressing-up-a-golf/', 'snippet': 'Marketed primarily in Spanish-language markets, the redesigned León shares systems — and surprisingly, fit and finish — with its stablemate, the Volkswagen Golf.', 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Seat León: An Exercise in Dressing Up a Golf', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paris Motor Show', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Audi Division of Volkswagen AG', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Skoda Auto', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Volkswagen AG', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-27T19:40:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Williams', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Williams', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f92e6aa4-5933-5d82-bb68-d69a0134d60d', 'word_count': 227, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f92e6aa4-5933-5d82-bb68-d69a0134d60d'}, {'abstract': 'A study finds that a job applicant’s chances of obtaining an interview fall sharply between the first month of unemployment and the eighth, and then they level out.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/27/longer-unemployment-fewer-interviews/', 'snippet': 'A study finds that a job applicant’s chances of obtaining an interview fall sharply between the first month of unemployment and the eighth, and then they level out.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’ve written before about about how the longer you’re unemployed, the less likely you are to find a job. That’s probably because of some combination of several factors: skill deterioration; better workers are more likely to get hired faster, leaving a pool of less qualified workers as the ones who disproportionately make it to long-term unemployment in the first place; and the stigma of unemployment, or at least the assumption by employers that the longer-term unemployed will be lower quality because of the previous two factors.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Longer Unemployment, Fewer Interviews', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hiring and Promotion', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-27T19:43:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Catherine Rampell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Catherine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rampell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1224b48f-188a-5673-8bc1-2428e36bd414', 'word_count': 1057, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1224b48f-188a-5673-8bc1-2428e36bd414'}, {'abstract': 'Few specifics were shared at the highly anticipated unveiling of the P1 concept, an heir to the legacy of the F1 hypercar.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/27/mclaren-reveals-a-breathtaking-supercar-and-little-else/', 'snippet': 'Few specifics were shared at the highly anticipated unveiling of the P1 concept, an heir to the legacy of the F1 hypercar.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Two years ago, Lotus made a rather large and unexpected splash here by introducing six new models that promised to transform the niche sports-ca