role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5e4a5b8c-72f8-5024-adfc-a980060e994d', 'word_count': 621, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5e4a5b8c-72f8-5024-adfc-a980060e994d'}, {'abstract': 'The Tigers nearly wasted Doug Fister’s streak of striking out nine straight batters, blowing a lead late before beating Kansas City, 5-4, on Thursday in Detroit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/28/sports/baseball/mlb-baseball-roundup.html', 'snippet': 'The Tigers nearly wasted Doug Fister’s streak of striking out nine straight batters, blowing a lead late before beating Kansas City, 5-4, on Thursday in Detroit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The playoff picture in the American League began to take shape Thursday, as Texas beat Oakland to add to its cushion in the West. The Angels could not make a move on the Athletics, though, losing to Seattle to leave them two games out of a wild-card spot, with Tampa Bay now also two back. Detroit increased its lead in the Central with a win over Kansas City, as the White Sox lost to the Rays. The Yankees lost, but their rival in the East, Baltimore, was off.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/28/sports/sub-y-bases/sub-y-bases-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 746, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/28/sports/sub-y-bases/sub-y-bases-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1491, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Detroit’s Lead Is 2; Gonzalez Wins 21st', 'kicker': 'Roundup', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Detroit’s Lead Is 2; Gonzalez Wins 21st', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subje