over the idle Orioles in the American League East dropped to one game, as Ivan Nova had another in a series of bad outings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TORONTO — Ivan Nova lofted an 87 mile-per-hour slider approximately 18 inches higher than the intended target. It came in chest-high to Edwin Encarnacion, who lashed it into the right-field corner for a two-run double that may have determined Nova’s fate for the rest of the season. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/28/sports/baseball/28yankees-1/28yankees-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 786, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/28/sports/baseball/28yankees-1/28yankees-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1571, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/28/sports/baseball/28yankees-1/28yankees-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/28/sports/baseball/28yankees-1/28yankees-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/28/sports/baseball/28yankees-1/28yankees-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Yankees’ Division Lead Shrinks as Nova’s Slump Persists', 'kicker': 'Blue Jays 6, Yankees 0', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Yankees’ Division Lead Shrinks as Nova’s Slump Persists', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Toronto Blue Jays', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-28T02:25:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc641844-1643-59d6-a920-6bac6619c532', 'word_count': 793, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc641844-1643-59d6-a920-6bac6619c532'}, {'abstract': 'The league’s commissioner and the head of the players union will meet Friday in the first formal negotiations since Sept. 12.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/28/sports/hockey/nhl-labor-talks-to-resume-friday.html', 'snippet': 'The league’s commissioner and the head of the players union will meet Friday in the first formal negotiations since Sept. 12.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Formal negotiations are scheduled to resume Friday between N.H.L. Commissioner Gary Bettman and Donald Fehr, the executive director of the N.H.L. Players’ Association — the first formal bargaining since Sept. 12, three days before the lockout began. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'N.H.L. to Resume Labor Talks as Preseason Is Canceled', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Preseason Canceled; Labor Talks To Resume', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Hockey League', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bettman, Gary', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': '