ippet': 'At the Port of New York and New Jersey, where longshoremen’s jobs have systematically been diminished by automation, the remaining human workers cling to the hope of relevance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEWARK — IN the rising light of a mid-September morning, the CSAV Pyrenees, a blue-water freighter sailing out of Suape Port in Brazil, was lashed to its lines at Berth 59 of the Port Newark Container Terminal. At rest beneath a looming row of gantry cranes, the ship had come to port on a half-day call to discharge a load of South American cargo: 421 containers’ worth, each one weighing as much as a family of elephants — or slightly more than 40,000 pounds.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'On the Waterfront, Rise of the Machines', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'On Waterfront, Rise of the Machines', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ships and Shipping', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Newark (NJ)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "International Longshoremen's Assn", 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Port Authority of New York and New Jersey', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Curto, Joseph C', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ports', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Shipping Assn', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York Harbor', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-28T14:56:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'B