{'abstract': 'After several hours on the beach in Far Rockaway, the dolphin was taken to the Riverhead Foundation on Long Island for treatment Friday afternoon but never made it to a tank.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/28/dolphin-stranded-on-shore-of-queens/', 'snippet': 'After several hours on the beach in Far Rockaway, the dolphin was taken to the Riverhead Foundation on Long Island for treatment Friday afternoon but never made it to a tank.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated, 5:48 p.m. |  A female common dolphin, six feet long and nearly 140 pounds, bobbed ashore at Far Rockaway, Queens, on Friday morning and flopped onto the beach.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/28/nyregion/28dolphin-riverhead-1-cityroom/28dolphin-riverhead-1-cityroom-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/28/nyregion/28dolphin-riverhead-1-cityroom/28dolphin-riverhead-1-cityroom-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/28/nyregion/28dolphin-riverhead-1-cityroom/28dolphin-riverhead-1-cityroom-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/28/nyregion/28dolphin-riverhead-1-cityroom/28dolphin-riverhead-1-cityroom-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/28/nyregion/28dolphin-riverhead-1-cityroom/28dolphin-riverhead-1-cityroom-thumbLarge.jpg', '