m/2012/09/30/arts/music/brittens-war-requiem-by-gianandrea-noseda.html', 'snippet': 'A live recording of Mr. Noseda’s account of the “War Requiem” at the Barbican has been released.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRITTEN: ‘WAR REQUIEM’', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/arts/30WAR/30WAR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/arts/30WAR/30WAR-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Britten’s ‘War Requiem’ by Gianandrea Noseda', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Moving Handel’s Harpischord to the Modern Piano', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Noseda, Gianandrea', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Britten, Benjamin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'London Symphony Orchestra', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-28T17:34:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anthony Tommasini', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anthony', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tommasini', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/dc5357ef-f0b8-529d-9e54-74694b724d36', 'word_count': 323, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dc5357ef-f0b8-529d-9e54-74694b724d36'}, {'abstract': 'Can a family loan fund help shield borrowers and lenders from some of the common pitfalls of person-to-person family loans?', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/28/upsides-and-downsides-of-family-loans/', 'snippet': 'Can a family loan fund help shield borrowers and lenders from some of the common pitfalls of person-to-person family loans?', 'lead_paragraph': 'In this weekend’s Your Money column, I provide a primer on creating a family loan pool. The advantages here are many. There is potentially more money available if many family members contribute. Many people can participate in setting the rules and distribution of loans, so emotion is less likely to get in the way. And it may be easier to enforce those rules if an entire clan is standing behind the loan.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Upsides and Downsides of Family Loans', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Personal Finances', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Student Loans', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-28T17:34:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ron Lieber', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ron', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lieber', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7775a4be-036a-5c7f-94d1-2d95236b9c6e', 'word_count': 99, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7775a4be-036a-5c7f-94d1-2d95236b9c6e'}, {'abstract': 'The School of American Ballet is drawing younger, active dancers (and even students) to teach. Peter Martins, the artistic director and chairman of faculty at the School of American Ballet, recruits still-active dancers as teachers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/30/arts/dance/school-of-american-ballet-enlists-city-ballet-members.html', 'snippet': 'The School of American Ballet is drawing younger, active dancers (and even students) to teach. Peter Martins, the artistic director and chairman of faculty at the School of American Ballet, recruits still-active dancers as teachers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EVERYONE knows that a dancer’s performance career ends with age. But what about a dance teacher’s? At the School of American Ballet, a generational shift is under way. Not only do former and current New York City Ballet members, including Arch Higgins, Darci Kistler, Katrina Killianand Jonathan Stafford, dominate its staff, but Peter Martins, the artistic director and chairman of faculty at the school, has put programs in place to pump even more new blood. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/arts/30SAB1_SPAN/30SAB1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/30/arts/30SAB1_SPAN/30SAB1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/arts/30SAB1_SPAN/30SAB1_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 648, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/arts/30SAB1_SPAN/30SAB1_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1295, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/arts/30SAB1_SPAN/30SAB1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/30/arts/30SAB1_SPAN/