ri': 'nyt://article/09ba027a-1359-5308-90f8-b54b1326b565'}, {'abstract': 'Speaking to his second military group in two days, Mitt Romney hammered President Obama over cuts to military spending, as well as of his handling of foreign policy issues.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/28/romney-continues-to-hit-obama-on-defense-cuts-and-foreign-policy/', 'snippet': 'Speaking to his second military group in two days, Mitt Romney hammered President Obama over cuts to military spending, as well as of his handling of foreign policy issues.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RADNOR TOWNSHIP, Pa. — Speaking to his second military group in two days, Mitt Romney on Friday hammered President Obama over cuts to military spending, as well as of his handling of foreign policy issues.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Romney Continues to Hit Obama on Defense Cuts and Foreign Policy', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pennsylvania', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-28T18:28:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Parker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b42b2734-aacb-568c-b232-ae69b0524354', 'word_count': 611, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b42b2734-aacb-568c-b232-ae69b0524354'}, {'abstract': 'The Barclays Center’s grand opening was punctuated by protesters, music-goers and throngs of curious onlookers hoping to share in the excitement.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/29/nyregion/barclays-centers-opening-is-met-with-protests.html', 'snippet': 'The Barclays Center’s grand opening was punctuated by protesters, music-goers and throngs of curious onlookers hoping to share in the excitement.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After nine years as the focal point of a pitched confrontation over urban development, power and basketball, the Barclays Center in Brooklyn began its first day of life on Friday with the hip-hop superstar Jay-Z performing at a sold-out concert while activists outside the arena reminded attendees of the unfulfilled promises of the center’s developer.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/nyregion/OPENING1-sub2/OPENING1-sub2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/30/nyregion/OPENING1-sub2/OPENING1-sub2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/nyregion/OPENING1-sub2/OPENING1-sub2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 626, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/nyregion/OPENING1-sub2/OPENING1-sub2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1251, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/nyregion/OPENING1-sub2/OPENING1-sub2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/30/nyregion/OPENING1-sub2/OPENING1-sub2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheigh