o” on TLC ends its first run, the ratings show viewers loved what the critics hated.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/28/honey-boo-boo-has-the-ratings-if-not-the-critics/', 'snippet': 'As “Here Comes Honey Boo Boo” on TLC ends its first run, the ratings show viewers loved what the critics hated.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When TLC’s reality series “Here Comes Honey Boo Boo” made its debut in August, it was met with such derision by some television critics, that it seemed like the title should be changed to “Look Out! Here Comes Honey Boo Boo.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Honey Boo Boo’ Has the Ratings, if Not the Critics', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Comedy Central', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fox News Channel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-28T19:01:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Kepler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kepler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b14731fa-ad8f-5b4c-83b6-e1fefa45ef00', 'word_count': 252, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b14731fa-ad8f-5b4c-83b6-e1fefa45ef00'}, {'abstract': 'No permanent home has been announced for a sculpture damaged in the 2001 terrorist attack and now itself serving for some as a memorial.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/28/artists-foundation-seeks-return-of-sphere-to-world-trade-center-site/', 'snippet': 'No permanent home has been announced for a sculpture damaged in the 2001 terrorist attack and now itself serving for some as a memorial.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The chorus voicing a pledge for the return of the ‘Sphere’ to 