t Exhibit He Deemed Offensive', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crosses and Crucifixes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Serrano, Andres', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Donohue, William A', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-28T22:12:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sharon Otterman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sharon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Otterman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ba141e7d-9318-563b-8e9e-53826ab1ba08', 'word_count': 728, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ba141e7d-9318-563b-8e9e-53826ab1ba08'}, {'abstract': 'Wall Street posted another victory in the battle over regulation, as a federal judge on Friday struck down the so-called position limits rule, a central piece of the Dodd-Frank financial overhaul.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/09/28/judge-strikes-down-dodd-frank-trading-rule/', 'snippet': 'Wall Street posted another victory in the battle over regulation, as a federal judge on Friday struck down the so-called position limits rule, a central piece of the Dodd-Frank financial overhaul.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Wall Street posted another victory in the battle over regulation on Friday after a federal judge struck down a central piece of the Obama administration’s financial overhaul. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Judge Strikes Down a Dodd-Frank Trading Rule', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Judge Strikes Down Commodity Speculator Limits', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dodd-Frank Wall Street Reform and Consumer Protection Act (2010)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Commodity Futures Trading Commission', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Swaps and Derivatives Assn', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Securities Industry and Financial Markets Assn', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-28T22:21:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Protess', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Protess', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/891069e5-f512-50bf-a1bc-f609222dc742', 'word_count': 757, 'uri': 'nyt://article/891069e5-f512-50bf-a1bc-f609222dc742'}, {'abstract': 'At the NY Art Book Fair this weekend at MoMA PS1, Mishka Henner’s aerial photography of oil pumps in Texas will be on display.', 'web_url': 'https://6thfloor.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/28/artists-books-and-oil-pumps/', 'snippet': 'At the NY Art Book Fair this weekend at MoMA PS1, Mishka Henner’s aerial photography of oil pumps in Texas will be on display.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This weekend the seventh annual NY Art Book Fair takes place at MoMA P.S. 1 in Queens. One of the exhibitors is ABC Artists’ Books Cooperative. And one of its featured projects is ABCED, a 33-volume series of artist books created in celebration of the artist Ed Ruscha’s 75th birthday this December. In the 1960s, Ruscha published a series of artist books — collections of his own photographs sold in small editions — that influenced generations of artists, including Mishka Henner, one of the cooperative’s 25 members.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Artists’ Books and Oil Pumps', 'kicker': 'The 6th Floor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-09-28T22:22:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By STACEY BAKER', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stacey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'BAKER', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/964b791b-a84e-5323-b683-d6345a69d269', 'word_count': 182, 'uri': 'nyt://article/964b791b-a84e-5323-b683-d6345a69d269'}, {'abstract': 'With auto sales bottoming out in Europe, the mood during press previews for the biennial Paris salon reflected a hope that 2013 might mark the beginning of a slow recovery. Here is a look at some of the models that were shown.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/09/28/automobiles/autoshow/30paris-slides.html', 'snippet': 'With auto sales bottoming out in Europe, the mood during press previews for the biennial Paris salon reflected a hope that 2013 might mark the beginning of a slow recovery. Here is a look at some of the models that were shown.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With auto sales bottoming out in Europe, the mood during press previews for the biennial Paris salon reflected a hope that 2013 might mark the beginning of a slow recovery. Here is a look at some of the models that were shown.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/28/automobiles/autoshow/30paris-slides-slide-AZUX/30paris-slides-slide-AZUX-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 631, 'wid