pton Callaway sings from the Streisand songbook — including numbers Ms. Callaway wrote herself — at 54 Below.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/29/arts/music/ann-hampton-callaway-at-54-below.html', 'snippet': 'Ann Hampton Callaway sings from the Streisand songbook — including numbers Ms. Callaway wrote herself — at 54 Below.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Although the singer Ann Hampton Callaway doesn’t sound at all like Barbra Streisand, to whom she paid fervent tribute on Wednesday evening in her new show, “The Streisand Songbook,” at 54 Below, the two share a fundamental, unshakable romanticism. Both favor overarching, dramatic love songs, and both have the vocal equipment to infuse them with fairy tale magic. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Romantic Who’s Inspired by Streisand', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Romantic Who’s Inspired by Streisand', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boston Pops Orchestra', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Callaway, Ann Hampton', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-28T22:46:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Holden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Holden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/7fd25fc0-91d6-5faf-80b3-df62ec8860b7', 'word_count': 329, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7fd25fc0-91d6-5faf-80b3-df62ec8860b7'}, {'abstract': 'Alan Greenberg, known as Ace, celebrated his 85th birthday this month.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/29/crosswords/bridge/in-bridge-game-of-chica