aving languished for most of the season, has the chance to play spoiler to the Orioles, who are tied for the lead in the wild card race, though the Red Sox fell short to start their weekend series.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/29/sports/baseball/red-sox-orioles-playoff-plans.html', 'snippet': 'Boston, having languished for most of the season, has the chance to play spoiler to the Orioles, who are tied for the lead in the wild card race, though the Red Sox fell short to start their weekend series.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BALTIMORE — A year ago Friday, on the final day of the 2011 regular season, the Boston Red Sox played here needing to win to keep their playoff hopes alive. The Orioles, who had lost 93 games, refused to let that happen.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/29/sports/orioles/orioles-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 306, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/29/sports/orioles/orioles-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 306}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/29/sports/orioles/orioles-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 522, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/29/sports/orioles/orioles-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1043, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/29/sports/orioles/orioles-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/29/sports/orioles/orioles-thumbStanda