iktor-and-rolf-straightforward-hollywood-glamour/', 'snippet': 'This was one of those rare seasons when the designers Viktor Horsting and Rolf Snoeren of Viktor & Rolf went for straightforward fashion, instead of the conceptual variety.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This was one of those rare seasons when the designers Viktor Horsting and Rolf Snoeren of Viktor & Rolf went for straightforward fashion, instead of the conceptual variety. While it was not the usual three-ring circus, this collection, loosely themed around Hollywood glamour, offered a good opportunity to reiterate the signatures of the house. It was also a reminder that Mr. Horsting and Mr. Snoeren, besides being great showmen, are in the business of selling clothes. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'From Two Great Showmen, Straightforward Hollywood Glamour', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Horsting, Viktor', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Snoeren, Rolf', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Viktor & Rolf', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-29T15:20:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Wilson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wilson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e0b03e87-80a3-577a-90bb-2729fce7f1ff', 'word_count': 175, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e0b03e87-80a3-577a-90bb-2729fce7f1ff'}, {'abstract': 'A decline in fish stocks, rising operating costs and a sharp economic downturn have devastated much of Spain’s coastal economy and intensified criticism of subsidies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/30/world/europe/bound-to-sea-but-buried-in-debt-spains-fishermen-blame-blocs-policies.html', 'snippet': 'A decline in fish stocks, rising operating costs and a sharp economic downturn have devastated much of Spain’s coastal economy and intensified criticism of subsidies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CÁDIZ, Spain — Millions of Spaniards took advantage of cheap financing to buy new houses during Spain’s decade-long economic boom and housing bubble beginning in the late 1990s. The country’s fishermen, many encouraged by European Union subsidies, did much the same for their own homes away from home: new boats. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/world/SPAIN/SPAIN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/30/world/SPAIN/SPAIN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/world/SPAIN/SPAIN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/world/SPAIN/SPAIN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/world/SPAIN/SPAIN-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/30/world/SPAIN/SPAIN-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'i