6bc-e1b41ff5a0bc', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/12c6bec7-6cc2-5bc0-96bc-e1b41ff5a0bc'}, {'abstract': 'Canada’s government had vigorously resisted calls and a court order to bring back Omar Khadr, who was 15 years old when he was captured by American forces in Afghanistan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/30/world/americas/canadian-held-at-guantanamo-bay-is-repatriated.html', 'snippet': 'Canada’s government had vigorously resisted calls and a court order to bring back Omar Khadr, who was 15 years old when he was captured by American forces in Afghanistan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OTTAWA — Omar Khadr, the only Canadian citizen held at the Guantánamo Bay detention center in Cuba, was returned to Canada early Saturday morning, the Pentagon and the Canadian government announced.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/us/GITMO-2/GITMO-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 339, 'width': 244, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/us/GITMO-2/GITMO-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 339, 'width': 244, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/us/GITMO-2/GITMO-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/30/us/GITMO-2/GITMO-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/us/GITMO-2/GITMO-2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sole