rint Cup top 10 before the race at Dover International Speedway, has revived his career on Michael Waltrip’s team.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DOVER, Del. — Another miserable day for Martin Truex Jr. had included a bad pit stop and a crash, and there was nothing left for him to do but punch his trailer. Just seven races into the 2011 Nascar Sprint Cup Series, Truex was flailing, his career stalled. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/sports/YTRUEX1/YTRUEX1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/sports/YTRUEX1/YTRUEX1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/sports/YTRUEX1/YTRUEX1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/30/sports/YTRUEX1/YTRUEX1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/sports/YTRUEX1/YTRUEX1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Resurgent Driver Returns to Scene of Only Win', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Resurgent Driver Returns to Scene of Only Win', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Truex, Martin Jr', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Racing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'N