. Genovese, a Marxist who became a conservative Catholic, argued that slavery had a paternalistic side.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/30/us/eugene-d-genovese-historian-of-south-dies-at-82.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Genovese, a Marxist who became a conservative Catholic, argued that slavery had a paternalistic side.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Eugene D. Genovese, a prizewinning historian who challenged conventional thinking on slavery in the American South by stressing its paternalism as he traveled a personal intellectual journey from Marxism to conservative Catholicism, died on Wednesday at his home in Atlanta. He was 82. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '36', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/nyregion/dog-GENOVESE2-obit/dog-GENOVESE2-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 709, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/nyregion/dog-GENOVESE2-obit/dog-GENOVESE2-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1933, 'width': 1338, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/nyregion/dog-GENOVESE2-obit/dog-GENOVESE2-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/30/nyregion/dog-GENOVESE2-obit/dog-GENOVESE2-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/nyregion/dog-GENOVESE2-obit/dog-GENOVESE2-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Eugene D. Genovese, Historian 