erage, and then the scene in the Bulldogs’ secondary turned to mayhem as a Tennessee receiver ran wide open for another big play.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Offense Carries Bulldogs After Their Defense Fails', 'kicker': 'Georgia 51, Tennessee 44', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Offense Carries Bulldogs After Their Defense Fails', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football (College)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Georgia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Tennessee', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-30T00:59:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'College Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ray Glier', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ray', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Glier', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4dac721f-d9d7-53a9-9a87-2fcdf3c4e90c', 'word_count': 751, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4dac721f-d9d7-53a9-9a87-2fcdf3c4e90c'}, {'abstract': 'Miguel Cabrera kept up his triple crown chase with his 43rd home run, and Detroit’s lead in the American League Central grew to two games with four to play.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/30/sports/baseball/cabrera-hits-43rd-homer-as-tigefrs-beat-twins.html', 'snippet': 'Miguel Cabrera kept up his triple crown chase with his 43rd home run, and Detroit’s lead in the American League Central grew to two games with four to play.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MINNEAPOLIS — With his stocking feet propped up on his desk and the Ryder Cup broadcast on the television next to him, Detroit Tigers Manager Jim Leyland scanned the list of pitchers he had available for Saturday’s afternoon game with the Minnesota Twins. Beginning with starter Justin Verlander, Leyland counted off eight names. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/sports/YTIGERS/YTIGERS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 669, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/sports/YTIGERS/YTIGERS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1337, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/sports/YTIGERS/YTIGERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/30/sports/YTIGERS/YTIGERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/30/sports/YTIGERS/YTIGERS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cabrera’s 43rd Homer Carries Tigers Closer to a Division Title', 'kicker': 'Tigers 6, Twins 4', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Home Run By Cabrera Gives a Lift To Detroit', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Verlander, Justin', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Detroit Tigers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Minnesota Twins', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cabrera, Miguel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Leyland, Jim', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pu