k Teixeira, who reported no problems with his strained left calf after playing in an instructional league game Saturday, is scheduled to return to the Yankees on Monday and will probably be in the starting lineup.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TORONTO — Mark Teixeira is scheduled to rejoin the Yankees on Monday and will probably be in the starting lineup, Manager Joe Girardi said. But Jayson Nix might be out for the next two weeks, if their season lasts that long.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Teixeira Is Set to Rejoin the Yankees', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Teixeira, Mark', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-30T18:08:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f697f827-3c79-5c27-b1c2-1d33bd28a461', 'word_count': 237, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f697f827-3c79-5c27-b1c2-1d33bd28a461'}, {'abstract': 'Bo Guagua, 24, made his most explicit defense of Bo Xilai, a former Communist Party official in China, since a sordid political scandal involving the entire Bo family broke in the spring.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/10/01/world/asia/bo-xilais-son-defends-him-as-upright-and-devoted.html', 'snippet': 'Bo Guagua, 24, made his most explicit defense of Bo Xilai, a former Communist Party official in China, since a sordid political scandal involving the entire Bo family broke in the spring.', 'lead_paragraph': 'B