 'nyt://article/79d470eb-45c3-55e4-b711-5afa4b8da057', 'word_count': 1830, 'uri': 'nyt://article/79d470eb-45c3-55e4-b711-5afa4b8da057'}, {'abstract': 'After beating the Blue Jays on Sunday, the Yankees clinched a playoff spot when the Rangers split a doubleheader with the Angels, but the Yankees still have their sights set on the division title.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/10/01/sports/baseball/yankees-rally-past-blue-jays-to-stay-in-first.html', 'snippet': 'After beating the Blue Jays on Sunday, the Yankees clinched a playoff spot when the Rangers split a doubleheader with the Angels, but the Yankees still have their sights set on the division title.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TORONTO — Two hours before the Yankees took the field Sunday afternoon, the stereo in the visitors’ clubhouse at Rogers Centre blared an old De La Soul tune called “The Magic Number,” but few of the players even noticed the significance. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/10/01/sports/baseball/01yankees-pic/01yankees-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/10/01/sports/baseball/01yankees-pic/01yankees-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/10/01/sports/baseball/01yankees-pic/01yankees-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 690, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/10/01/sports/baseball/01yankees-pic/01yankees-pic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1381, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'c