acturing and construction reports and the monthly unemployment figures, and automakers and retailers will release sales numbers for September.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ECONOMIC REPORTS Data to be released include the I.S.M. manufacturing index for September and construction spending for August (Monday); A.D.P. employment for September, I.S.M. service index for September (Wednesday); weekly jobless claims (Thursday); and unemployment for September and consumer credit for August (Friday).', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Economic Reports for the Week Ahead', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Looking Ahead', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Factories and Manufacturing', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-30T21:40:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/c336009c-99b4-5f75-8302-ff755499e3f1', 'word_count': 337, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c336009c-99b4-5f75-8302-ff755499e3f1'}, {'abstract': 'Richard Eyre’s production of Bizet’s “Carmen” returns to the Metropolitan Opera in a revival starring the Georgian mezzo-soprano Anita Rachvelishvili.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/10/01/arts/music/carmen-with-anita-rachvelishvili-at-the-met.html', 'snippet': 'Richard Eyre’s production of Bizet’s “Carmen” returns to the Metropolitan Opera in a revival starring the Georgian mezzo-soprano Anita Rachvelishvili.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To say that the Metropolitan Opera’s revival of the Richard Eyre production of Bizet’s “Carmen” on Friday evening got off to a slow start wouldn’t be quite right. Michele Mariotti, conducting in his Met debut, tore into the prelude, honoring the precedent set by Yannick Nézet-Séguin when the production was new, in 2009.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/10/01/arts/carmen/carmen-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 955, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/10/01/arts/carmen/carmen-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1911, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/10/01/arts/carmen/carmen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/10/01/arts/carmen/carmen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/10/01/arts/carmen/carmen-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Gypsy, Fiery Yet Cool', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Gypsy, Fiery Yet Cool', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rachvelishvili, Anita', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opera', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Eyre, Richard', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Opera', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-30T21:49:50+0000', 'document_typ