round effort.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kodak Plans to End Line of Inkjet Printers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Kodak Plans To End Line Of Inkjet Printers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Eastman Kodak Company', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bankruptcies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-30T23:49:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1683e756-cdd2-5ef6-882f-8019b778f962', 'word_count': 242, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1683e756-cdd2-5ef6-882f-8019b778f962'}, {'abstract': 'In a video interview, Meg Whitman, chief executive of Hewlett-Packard, explains what she needs to tell Wall Street at this week’s analysts meeting.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/09/30/video-meg-whitman-on-fixing-hewlett-packard/', 'snippet': 'In a video interview, Meg Whitman, chief executive of Hewlett-Packard, explains what she needs to tell Wall Street at this week’s analysts meeting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Few leadership attributes are as important as clear self-definition and a strong sense of direction. Meg Whitman, whose company I wrote about in Sunday’s New York Times, is among the clearest. In this video interview, she explains everything she needs to tell Wall Street at this Wednesday’s analyst meeting. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video: Meg Whitman on Fixing Hewlett-Packard', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Enterprise Computing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Whitman, Margaret C', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hewlett-Packard Company', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-30T23:54:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Quentin Hardy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Quentin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hardy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/39841e53-ac09-5b48-b315-6ef3f068c9a8', 'word_count': 324, 'uri': 'nyt://article/39841e53-ac09-5b48-b315-6ef3f068c9a8'}, {'abstract': 'The mainstream media are frequently faulted as biased against conservative causes. But it seems a dubious notion when the ownership of the megaphone is increasingly up for grabs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/10/01/business/media/challenging-the-claims-of-media-bias-the-media-equation.html', 'snippet': 'The mainstream media are frequently faulted as biased against conservative causes. But it seems a dubious notion when the ownership of the megaphone is increasingly up for grabs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the last few days, conservatives have become agitated about Mitt Romney’s drop-off in the polls. So did they think the stumble was because of the ill-fated “47 percent” slip of the lip, or the hasty effort to gain a political edge after the death of an American ambassador in Libya, or more problematically, a campaign that can’t seem to stop pratfalling no matter what the news? ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/12/business/media/carr-new-headshot/carr-new-headshot-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/12/business/media/carr-new-headshot/carr-new-headshot-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/12/business/media/carr-new-headshot/carr-new-headshot-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/12/business/media/carr-new-headshot/carr-new-headshot-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/12/business/media/carr-new-headshot/carr-new-headshot-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/12/business/media/carr-new-headshot/carr-new-headshot-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/12/business/media/carr-new-headshot/carr-new-headshot-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tired Cries of Bias Don’t Help Romney', 'kicker': 'The Media Equation', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tired Cries Of Bias Don’t Help Romney', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-30T23:56:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Carr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carr', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bef7d65c-01e8-59c2-9487-6ecf36e1cd19', 'word_count': 1134, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bef7d65c-01e8-59c2-9487-6ecf36e1cd19'}, {'abstract': 'Gay rights advocates say disputed therapies to “overcome” homosexuality have caused emotional harm to teenagers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/10/01/us/california-bans-therapies-to-cure-gay-minors.html', 'snippet': 'Gay rights advocates say disputed therapies to “overcome” homosexuality have caused emotional harm to teenagers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'California has become the first state to ban the use for minors of disputed therapies to “overcome” homosexuality, a step hailed by gay rights groups across the country that say the therapies have caused dangerous emotional harm to gay and lesbian teenagers. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'California Is First State to Ban Gay ‘Cure’ for Minors', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gay ‘Cure’ For Minors Is Banned In California', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Edmund G Jr', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-09-30T23:57:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erik Eckholm', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erik', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eckholm', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'org